id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#add-a-team-member","content":"Set a **Password** and **Confirm password**."},"39":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-37","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#add-a-team-member","content":"Choose a **Role**: **Admin** or **User**."},"40":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-38","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#add-a-team-member","content":"Click **Add user**."},"41":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-39","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#add-a-team-member","content":"You set their password and nothing is emailed to them. There is no invitation to accept, so pass the login details on yourself and ask them to change the password once they are in."},"42":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-40","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#roles","content":"| Role      | Access                              |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **Owner** | The account holder. One per account |","table":"table-1"},"43":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-41","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#roles","content":"| Role      | Access                                                                  |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Admin** | \"Full access to everything in the organization including all settings.\" |","table":"table-1"},"44":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-42","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#roles","content":"| Role     | Access                                   |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **User** | \"Basic access to organization features.\" |","table":"table-1"},"45":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-43","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#which-role","content":"Give **Admin** to people who need to change billing, team or account settings. **User** suits presenters, moderators and anyone who works on webinars without touching the account."},"46":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-44","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#change-role","content":"Change someone's role from the **Actions** column on their row. The **Owner** can't be changed from this screen; contact support if ownership needs to move."},"47":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-45","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#presenters-and-moderators","content":"A **team member** has a login. A **presenter** or **moderator** runs a specific webinar and is added on that webinar's Overview tab. Presenters and moderators can join with a link, without an account."},"48":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-46","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#presenters-and-moderators","content":"Add someone to your team when they work in EasyWebinar regularly."},"49":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-47","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#presenters-and-moderators","content":"Send a **Co-presenter** or **Moderator** join link from the Share dialog when they are a guest on one session."},"50":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-48","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#with-overview-tab","content":"Each webinar's **Team & Moderators** panel shows everyone who can run that webinar. **Add presenter** adds someone who appears on camera and presents. **Invite** sends an invitation to join the webinar team. The Overview page explains how presenters differ from team members."},"51":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-49","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#with-share-links","content":"The Share dialog holds a Co-presenter Join Link for a presenter and a **Moderator Join Link for Live room** for someone who handles chat and questions. Treat both as private. Anyone holding one can join your room in that role."},"52":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-50","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#with-live-room","content":"Co-hosts and moderators who join land backstage, not on stage. Your audience doesn't see or hear them until you bring them on. That lets a colleague join early and sort out their audio before they speak."},"53":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-51","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#with-moderation","content":"Moderators work with the settings on the **Engagement** tab. With Private Q&A, questions are visible only to hosts and moderators. With chat set to Hosts only, each attendee talks privately to your team. AI Moderation (Beta) doesn't replace a human moderator on a live session; someone still spots the question worth answering on air."},"54":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-52","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#with-plan","content":"Seats come with your plan. **Change plan**, on the **Plan** tab under **Settings → Manage Plan**, moves you up or down, so compare plans before you add people in bulk."},"55":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-53","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#with-client-workspaces","content":"If you run webinars for clients, a client workspace gives each one a separate EasyWebinar account that you manage, on its own plan. It is the setup for marketing agencies running client webinars. Unlike adding a team member, the client does get an email confirmation to set their password, so use an address they read."},"56":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-54","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#verify-the-result","content":"The new member appears in the Team list with their role and joined date, and the seat count on the Settings overview goes up by one."},"57":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-55","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#limits-and-variations","content":"**Seats depend on your plan.** Adding a member costs more only if you have used all the seats your plan includes. Seat and role rules are also listed under team and account limits."},"58":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-56","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#limits-and-variations","content":"**There is no per-permission matrix.** Access is set by role alone; custom roles were not available at the time of checking."},"59":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-57","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#limits-and-variations","content":"**Client workspaces are separate** from team seats; adding a workspace doesn't use a seat."},"60":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-58","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#faq-invite","content":"You don't invite; you create their account with **Add user**, including their password, then pass the details to them."},"61":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-59","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#faq-presenter-no-account","content":"Yes. Use the Co-presenter or Moderator join link from the Share dialog."},"62":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-60","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#faq-admin-user","content":"Admin can change everything, including settings and billing. User gets basic access to the features."},"63":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-61","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#faq-how-many","content":"It depends on your plan. The Settings overview shows seats used out of your allowance."},"64":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-62","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#faq-change-role","content":"Yes, from the **Actions** column on their row in the Team list."},"65":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-63","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#faq-co-hosts","content":"Backstage. Move them to the stage when you want them seen and heard, and back again when they're done."},"66":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-64","page_id":"/product-docs/account/team-members","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/account/team-members#faq-workspace-seat","content":"No. Seats and workspaces are separate, and each workspace is billed on its own plan."},"67":{"id":"/product-docs/account/team-members-65","page_id":"/p