uct-docs#product-areas","content":"| Area         | What it does                                               |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Settings** | Profile, team members, plan and billing, client workspaces |","table":"table-1"},"255":{"id":"/product-docs-22","page_id":"/product-docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs#how-it-connects","content":"A webinar's registration page collects registrants and can take payment through your own Stripe account. Registrants get reminder emails from the Notifications tab, and SMS or WhatsApp messages, both currently in Beta. They join the room live, or a recording plays at a scheduled time (simulive) or on demand (evergreen). Attendance, offer clicks and revenue flow into the webinar's Analytics and the People view, and out to connected CRMs and email tools, or into EasyCRM."},"256":{"id":"/product-docs-23","page_id":"/product-docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs#about","content":"Every page shows who it applies to, its status and the date it was last checked against the product. Each heading has a permanent link you can copy and share."},"257":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","type":"page","content":"Connect a CRM and map your webinar data","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Integrations"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data"},"258":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-0","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","content":"Connect one of EasyWebinar's 14 CRM and email integrations, tag contacts by what they did, and send webinar details into your CRM's own fields."},"259":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-1","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integra