 I send the join link to my CRM?"},"284":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-26","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#faq-streaming","content":"Can I stream my webinar to YouTube or LinkedIn from here?"},"285":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-27","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#next-steps","content":"Next steps"},"286":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-28","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","content":"Connecting a CRM does more than copy email addresses across. You can tag people by **what they actually did** (attended, missed, watched the replay, left early, clicked your offer) and push details like each person's join link into your CRM's fields."},"287":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-29","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","content":"**Expected result:** a connected integration on your webinar, with event mappings that tag contacts and custom fields that receive webinar data."},"288":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-30","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#why-it-matters","content":"Connecting a webinar to your CRM or email platform means registrants and attendees arrive in the system you already work in, without exporting anything. Tagging by behaviour is what turns a webinar into something your sales follow-up can act on. A no-show can start a replay sequence, while someone who clicked your offer goes to the top of the sales list."},"289":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-31","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#why-it-matters","content":"Registrants and attendees are different events, so you can treat someone who attended apart from someone who only registered. Without that split, everyone on the list gets the same follow-up, whether they watched to the end or never turned up. That gap is what tracking webinar leads in your CRM is meant to close."},"290":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-32","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#before-you-begin","content":"**Create your tags in the CRM first**, then select them in EasyWebinar."},"291":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-33","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#before-you-begin","content":"**Custom fields must exist in your CRM** before you can map to them."},"292":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-34","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#before-you-begin","content":"Integrations are set **per webinar**, so connecting one doesn't connect the rest. Different webinars can feed different lists."},"293":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-35","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#supported-integrations","content":"|             |           |                  |\n| ----------- | --------- | ---------------- |\n| GoHighLevel | Mailchimp | Constant Contact |","table":"table-0"},"294":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-36","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#supported-in