"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-75","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-registration-fields","content":"The **Phone Number** field only has something to send if your registration form collected it. Select the form block in the page builder and add the **Phone** field; custom registration fields covers the other fields you can add."},"334":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-76","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-people-view","content":"People is every registrant and attendee across all your webinars in one table, and you can filter it by behaviour and source and export the list. It is a quick way to check who should have received a tag, or to follow up with people outside your CRM rules."},"335":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-77","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-cloning","content":"When you clone a webinar, **Integration settings** is one of the groups you can copy. Tick it to bring this webinar's integration settings across to the copy."},"336":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-78","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-easycrm","content":"You don't need EasyCRM to run webinars. It's for managing the people your webinars produce. Registrants reach it by connecting EasyCRM as an integration on a webinar, as on this page, or with **Import from EasyWebinar** on its Leads screen."},"337":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-79","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#with-easycast","content":"The **Social media** category on the Integrations tab is separate from CRMs. To broadcast a webinar to YouTube or LinkedIn while it runs, use EasyCast, under **Integrations** in the sidebar."},"338":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-80","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#verify-the-result","content":"The integration shows under **Connected apps** as **Ready to use**."},"339":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-81","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#verify-the-result","content":"Your rules appear under **Current mappings**."},"340":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-82","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#verify-the-result","content":"Register a test contact and check the tag and fields arrive in your CRM."},"341":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-83","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#change-or-disconnect","content":"**Change integration** swaps the connected tool. **Disconnect** removes it from the webinar."},"342":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-84","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#limits","content":"**Integrations are per webinar.** Connecting one doesn't connect the rest, and different webinars can feed different lists."},"343":{"id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data-85","page_id":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/integrations/map-webinar-data#limits","content":"**Connecting needs an account with that service**, and you sign in to it during setup."},"3