,"963":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-39","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-test","content":"How do I check it's working?"},"964":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-jit-name","content":"Is just-in-time the same as JIT?"},"965":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"Related"},"966":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","content":"**Just-in-time Registration** is an evergreen schedule option that offers each visitor a session starting a few minutes after they register, rather than at a fixed future time. You choose how often these sessions come round, from every 2 minutes to every hour, and each just-in-time session runs in the attendee's own local time. It is the setting that lets someone who finds your registration page be watching your webinar shortly afterwards."},"967":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                           |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Offers a session starting shortly after someone registers |","table":"table-0"},"968":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                           |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Where it's set** | The schedule step of an evergreen webinar |","table":"table-0"},"969":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |           |\n| ----------------- | --------- |\n| **Webinar types** | Evergreen |","table":"table-0"},"970":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                             |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Interval options** | 2, 15, 30, 45 or 60 minutes |","table":"table-0"},"971":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#at-a-glance","content":"|                         |                           |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| **Keeping hours clear** | **Exclude specific time** |","table":"table-0"},"972":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#at-a-glance","content":"|              |                                                                              |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Timezone** | Each attendee's local time; the Overview shows **Attendee's local timezone** |","table":"table-0"},"973":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                              |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Combines with** | **On Demand** and **Recurring Schedule** on the same webinar |","table":"table-0"},"974":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#at-a-glance","content":"|                 |     |\n| --------------- | --- |\n| **Also called** | JIT |","table":"table-0"},"975":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#what-it-is","content":"A conventional webinar session sits at a time you chose in advance. A just-in-time session is generated around the person registering: EasyWebinar offers them a session that begins shortly, on a cycle set by the **Interval**."},"976":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#what-it-is","content":"Someone who arrives at your page at 2:07 can be watching by 2:15, instead of waiting until tomorrow. The recording is the same one your other evergreen sessions play; only the start time changes."},"977":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#what-it-is","content":"Just-in-time is one of three ways an evergreen webinar can be watched:"},"978":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#what-it-is","content":"| Option                        | When the registrant watches     | Timezone                  |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| **Just-in-time Registration** | A few minutes after registering | The attendee's local time |","table":"table-1"},"979":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#what-it-is","content":"| Option        | When the registrant watches  | Timezone                   |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| **On Demand** | Immediately, with no session | Not tied to a session time |","table":"table-1"},"980":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#what-it-is","content":"| Option                 | When the registrant watches  | Timezone               |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| **Recurring Schedule** | At set daily or weekly times | The webinar's timezone |","table":"table-1"},"981":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#what-it-is","content":"You can run all three together, and the registration page offers each as a choice."},"982":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#what-its-for","content":"Just-in-time is for evergreen webinars that sit in a funnel: a demo behind a website button, a teaching session in front of an offer, an onboarding session new customers reach from an email. In each case the visitor is interested now, and the webinar should be available now."},"983":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#how-it-helps","content":"**It removes the wait.** A session is always a few minutes away, so a visitor doesn't have to plan to come back."},"984":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#how-it-helps","content":"**It catches interest at its peak.** The person registering has just decided they want to watch; a short interval lets them do so while that's still true."},"985":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#how-it-helps","content":"**It suits a spread-out audience.** Because sessions follow each attendee's local time, you don't have to pick slots region by region."},"986":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#how-it-helps","content":"**It keeps a scheduled feel.** Unlike On Demand, there is still a start time, so attendees turn up for a session that begins at a set moment."},"987":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#without-it","content":"With only recurring times, a visitor who arrives just after a session has started faces a wait until the next slot, which may be hours or a day away. The gap between interest and watching is where people disappear: they close the tab meaning to return, and many don't."},"988":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#why-buyers-care","content":"For teams who measure an evergreen webinar by how many registrants actually watch, the time between registering and the session starting matters. Just-in-time shrinks it to minutes, using the same recording and the same funnel."},"989":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#set-up-new","content":"On **My Webinars**, click **Create a Webinar**, then **Create Manually**."},"990":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#set-up-new","content":"Name the webinar, choose **Evergreen Webinar** and click **Continue to Schedule**."},"991":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#set-up-new","content":"Switch on **Just-in-time Registration**."},"992":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#set-up-new","content":"Choose an **Interval**: 2, 15, 30, 45 or 60 minutes."},"993":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#set-up-new","content":"Set **Exclude specific time** if there are hours when no session should start."},"994":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#set-up-new","content":"Set up any other options you want alongside it: **On Demand**, **Recurring Schedule**, **Availability** and **Schedule Preferences**."},"995":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#set-up-new","content":"Click **Continue to Pricing** and finish the remaining steps."},"996":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#set-up-new","content":"*1 Just-in-time Registration · 2 On Demand · 3 Recurring Schedule · 4 Availability · 5 Schedule Preferences.*"},"997":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#set-up-new","content":"The full creation walkthrough, including pricing, video selection and templates, is in Create an evergreen webinar."},"998":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#set-up-existing","content":"Open the webinar's **Overview** tab and use the options menu on the **Scheduling Options** panel. That menu changes the schedule for the whole webinar rather than for a single session."},"999":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#settings","content":"| Setting                       | Options   | What it controls                                                |\n| ----------------------------- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Just-in-time Registration** | On or off | Whether the registration page offers a session starting shortly |","table":"table-2"},"1000":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#settings","content":"| Setting      | Options                     | What it controls                           |\n| ------------ | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Interval** | 2, 15, 30, 45 or 60 minutes | How often just-in-time sessions come round |","table":"table-2"},"1001":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#settings","content":"| Setting                   | Options                   | What it controls                         |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Exclude specific time** | Hours you want kept clear | Hours kept free of just-in-time sessions |","table":"table-2"},"1002":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#settings","content":"| Setting                  | Options                   | What it controls                                                                                             |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Schedule Preferences** | Depends on what's enabled | How many choices registrants see; with On Demand also on, it reads **Display Just-in-time & Instant-replay** |","table":"table-2"},"1003":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#choosing-an-interval","content":"Shorter intervals mean less waiting. The interval is the longest a new registrant waits for the next just-in-time session, so 2 minutes keeps the wait to a couple of minutes and 60 minutes can mean close to an hour."},"1004":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#choosing-an-interval","content":"Two minutes is also the setting to use when you want to check the webinar yourself, because a session starts almost as soon as you register. See Test a just-in-time session, below."},"1005":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#timezones","content":"Just-in-time is the only kind of session in EasyWebinar that follows each attendee's own local time. Everything else runs in the webinar's timezone:"},"1006":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#timezones","content":"| Session                                     | Runs in                   |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| Just-in-time sessions on evergreen webinars | The attendee's local time |","table":"table-3"},"1007":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#timezones","content":"| Session                                      | Runs in                |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| Recurring daily or weekly evergreen sessions | The webinar's timezone |","table":"table-3"},"1008":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#timezones","content":"| Session           | Runs in                |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------- |\n| Simulive sessions | The webinar's timezone |","table":"table-3"},"1009":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#timezones","content":"| Session       | Runs in                |\n| ------------- | ---------------------- |\n| Live sessions | The webinar's timezone |","table":"table-3"},"1010":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#timezones","content":"When just-in-time is on, the **Scheduling Options** panel on the Overview tab shows the timezone as **Attendee's local timezone**."},"1011":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#timezones","content":"*1 Scheduling Options · 2 Sessions.*"},"1012":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#timezones","content":"On the schedule step, EasyWebinar shows a message saying attendees will see times in their local time based on the selected timezone. On an evergreen webinar, that's true of just-in-time sessions only. Recurring daily and weekly sessions run at the times you set in the webinar's timezone."},"1013":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#test-it","content":"A recorded webinar has no live room for you to enter, so you check it by joining a running session. The quickest way to get one is to register yourself."},"1014":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#test-it","content":"Set the **Interval** to 2 minutes, the shortest option."},"1015":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#test-it","content":"Open your registration page link and register as an attendee."},"1016":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#test-it","content":"On the webinar's **Overview**, open the **Live** tab in the **Sessions** panel. A session on air appears there marked *Live now*, with **Enter room**."},"1017":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#test-it","content":"Join as an attendee to see what your audience sees."},"1018":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#test-it","content":"Set the interval back to your chosen value once you're done."},"1019":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#with-on-demand","content":"**On Demand** lets registrants watch immediately, with no session at all. Pair it with just-in-time and registrants choose between \"now\" and \"in a few minutes\". See On Demand."},"1020":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#with-recurring","content":"A daily or weekly **Recurring Schedule** can run alongside just-in-time, for registrants who prefer to book a set time. Those sessions use the webinar's timezone."},"1021":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#with-sessions","content":"Evergreen webinars have a **Live** tab in the Sessions panel, alongside **Upcoming**, **Past** and **Cancelled**, showing sessions currently on air. See The Overview tab."},"1022":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#with-chat-simulation","content":"Just-in-time attendees arrive at different moments, so there's no shared conversation to join. **Chat Simulation** on the **Engagement** tab fills the chat with an AI-generated or CSV-scripted conversation timed against the video. See Chat simulation."},"1023":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#with-ai-moderator","content":"The **AI Moderator**, in Beta, answers attendee questions from documents you upload and keeps the chat civil. On an automated webinar running at 3am, it can answer a question that would otherwise wait for someone on your team."},"1024":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#with-notifications","content":"Reminders on the **Notifications** tab are timed relative to the webinar, not to a fixed clock time, so they work with evergreen schedules. See Reminder emails and Confirmation emails."},"1025":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#with-analytics","content":"Polls, offers and analytics behave as on any webinar. In **People**, filter by **Webinar → Evergreen** to compare your automated funnel with your live sessions. See People."},"1026":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#with-plan-usage","content":"People watching evergreen sessions, including just-in-time ones, count towards the **Automated attendees** meter on the **Plan** tab."},"1027":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the setting is used."},"1028":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#saas-teams","content":"A product team links its \"watch the demo\" button to an evergreen registration page with just-in-time on a short interval. A visitor registers and is watching the recorded demo within minutes, in their own local time."},"1029":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#course-creators","content":"A creator's teaching webinar runs on just-in-time alongside a daily recurring time. New visitors from ads take the next just-in-time session; people who'd rather plan ahead book the daily slot. See Selling online courses with webinars."},"1030":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#small-business","content":"A solo consultant can't keep a calendar of live sessions. A just-in-time evergreen webinar means an enquiry from the website can be watching the consultant's explainer within minutes, with **Exclude specific time** keeping chosen hours clear."},"1031":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#customer-success","content":"A customer success team sends new customers to an onboarding webinar with just-in-time sessions, so each customer starts onboarding in their own timezone shortly after signing up."},"1032":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**Evergreen only.** Just-in-time is part of the evergreen schedule step. Live and simulive webinars use dated sessions in the webinar's timezone."},"1033":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**Fixed interval choices.** 2, 15, 30, 45 or 60 minutes."},"1034":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**Local time applies to just-in-time sessions only.** Other sessions on the same webinar use the webinar's timezone."},"1035":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**The schedule step's timezone message is broader than the behaviour.** Rely on the table above, not the in-app message."},"1036":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#limits","content":"**The type is fixed.** To use just-in-time with a webinar that is currently live or simulive, clone it as **Evergreen**. See Clone a webinar."},"1037":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-what-is-jit","content":"A session that starts a few minutes after someone registers, instead of at a fixed future time. In EasyWebinar it's an option on evergreen webinars."},"1038":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-how-often","content":"As often as you set with **Interval**: every 2, 15, 30, 45 or 60 minutes."},"1039":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-shortest","content":"Two minutes."},"1040":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-local-time","content":"Yes. Just-in-time sessions start shortly after each person registers, in their own local time."},"1041":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-recurring-timezone","content":"No. Recurring sessions run at the times you set, in the webinar's timezone."},"1042":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-exclude","content":"Yes. Use **Exclude specific time** to keep those hours clear."},"1043":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-with-on-demand","content":"Yes. Turn on **On Demand** as well; **Schedule Preferences** then reads **Display Just-in-time & Instant-replay**."},"1044":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-other-types","content":"No. It's an evergreen option. Clone the webinar as **Evergreen** to use it."},"1045":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-test","content":"Set the interval to 2 minutes, register on your own page, and watch for the session on the **Live** tab of the Sessions panel."},"1046":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#faq-jit-name","content":"Yes. JIT is the common short name for **Just-in-time Registration**."},"1047":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"Create an evergreen webinar: the full setup that just-in-time is one step of."},"1048":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"On Demand: the option for registrants who want to watch now rather than in a few minutes."},"1049":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"Chat simulation: a chat for attendees who each arrive at a different moment."},"1050":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"The Overview tab: where the Live tab shows a just-in-time session on air."},"1051":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"Clone a webinar: how a live or simulive webinar gets just-in-time sessions."},"1052":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/automated/just-in-time#related","content":"Limits and defaults: the interval options and other evergreen settings in one place."},"1053":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation","type":"page","content":"Chat simulation","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","Engagement"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation"},"1054":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation-0","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation","content":"Fill the chat on a simulive or evergreen webinar with a conversation generated by AI from a cast of simulated attendees, or scripted by you in a timed CSV."},"1055":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation-1","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"1056":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation-2","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation#what-it-is","content":"What chat simulation is"},"1057":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation-3","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation#why-it-matters","content":"Why chat simulation matters"},"1058":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation-4","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/chat-simulation#what-its-for","content":"What it's for"},"1059":{"id":"/product-