/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                            |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **On the replay** | Carried over when the replay page uses **Webinar Replica** |","table":"table-0"},"1809":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                                                   |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Written for you** | **Create with AI** generates offers from a positioning and category, for 1 credit |","table":"table-0"},"1810":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|             |                                                                                               |\n| ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Results** | **Offers Performance**, **Views to Clicks**, **Clicks to Purchases** and **Revenue by Offer** |","table":"table-0"},"1811":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#at-a-glance","content":"|               |                                                                                                                    |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Follow-up** | **Attendee Action Follow-ups**, the **Paid Offer — Transaction Success** email and the **Clicked offer** CRM event |","table":"table-0"},"1812":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"The **CTAs** tab holds two kinds of call to action. A poll asks your audience something. An offer asks them to do something: buy, book, enrol, download."},"1813":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"Each offer has:"},"1814":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"**The card attendees see**: a headline and sub headline, as a text offer or an image offer."},"1815":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"**A button**, with its own size, icon, text, colours and the URL it opens."},"1816":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"**An optional price**, or a **Free** setting."},"1817":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"**An optional countdown**, shown on the card."},"1818":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"**An internal title**, which only your team sees."},"1819":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-it-is","content":"An offer is not the same as charging for the webinar itself. Paid registration sells access to the session before it starts; an offer sells something separate, during or after it. EasyWebinar reports the two separately."},"1820":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#what-its-for","content":"Most selling webinars build towards one moment: the pitch. An offer is what attendees can act on at that moment, a single button on screen pointing at exactly the next step, instead of a URL read out loud."},"1821":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#how-it-helps","content":"**Action is one click away.** Attendees click the button while interest is high, without leaving to search for a link."},"1822":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#how-it-helps","content":"**The same offer sells after the session.** With a **Webinar Replica** replay, the offer appears on the recording too."},"1823":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#how-it-helps","content":"**It works when you're not there.** On simulive and evergreen webinars the offer card carries the pitch, and a countdown can carry the deadline."},"1824":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#how-it-helps","content":"**You can see where it loses people.** Separate numbers for views, clicks and purchases show whether the problem is the offer or the checkout."},"1825":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#how-it-helps","content":"**Clicks become follow-up.** People who clicked can get their own emails and their own CRM tag."},"1826":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#without-it","content":"Without an offer card, the call to action is whatever the presenter says and whatever link gets pasted into chat. Late arrivals miss it, chat scrolls it away, and on a recorded webinar nobody is there to repeat it. After the session there is no record of who was interested enough to click, so everyone gets the same follow-up."},"1827":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#why-buyers-care","content":"For course creators, coaches, consultants and product teams, the offer is where a webinar earns its keep. Buyers check how quickly an offer can be built, whether it can carry a deadline, whether it survives onto the replay, and whether clicks and revenue are reported against each webinar."},"1828":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#find-your-offers","content":"Open your webinar and click **CTAs**."},"1829":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#find-your-offers","content":"*1 All · Polls · Offers · 2 Search · 3 The list · 4 Row actions.*"},"1830":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#find-your-offers","content":"|     | Control                  | What it does                                           |\n| --- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 1   | **All · Polls · Offers** | Filters the list. Choose **Offers** to see only offers |","table":"table-1"},"1831":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#find-your-offers","content":"|     | Control    | What it does        |\n| --- | ---------- | ------------------- |\n| 2   | **Search** | Finds a CTA by name |","table":"table-1"},"1832":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#find-your-offers","content":"|     | Control      | What it does                                |\n| --- | ------------ | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **The list** | Type, title, price and actions for each CTA |","table":"table-1"},"1833":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#find-your-offers","content":"|     | Control         | What it does                   |\n| --- | --------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| 4   | **Row actions** | Toggle on or off, edit, delete |","table":"table-1"},"1834":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#find-your-offers","content":"A webinar with no polls or offers yet shows **\"No CTAs found\"**."},"1835":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"On the **CTAs** tab, open an existing offer."},"1836":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"To add a new one, click **+** at the bottom of the offer list on the left."},"1837":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Choose the **Offer Style**: **Text Offer** or **Image Offer**."},"1838":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Decide whether to switch on **Countdown timer**."},"1839":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Set an **Offer Price**, or switch **Free** on."},"1840":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Give the offer an internal **Title**, then write the **Headline** and **Sub Headline**."},"1841":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Set up the **Button**: size, icon, text and **Button URL**."},"1842":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Choose the button colour and button text colour."},"1843":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Check the preview in the centre of the editor, which shows the offer as attendees will see it and updates as you type."},"1844":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"Set **Published**, then save."},"1845":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"*1 Offer Style · 2 Countdown timer · 3 Offer Price · 4 Title, Headline, Sub Headline · 5 Button · 6 Colours.*"},"1846":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"|     | Setting         | What it does                      |\n| --- | --------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Offer Style** | **Text Offer** or **Image Offer** |","table":"table-2"},"1847":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"|     | Setting             | What it does                       |\n| --- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Countdown timer** | Adds a countdown to the offer card |","table":"table-2"},"1848":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"|     | Setting         | What it does                   |\n| --- | --------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| 3   | **Offer Price** | A price, or switch **Free** on |","table":"table-2"},"1849":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"|     | Setting                           | What it does                                                                 |\n| --- | --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Title, Headline, Sub Headline** | The title is internal; the headline and sub headline are what attendees read |","table":"table-2"},"1850":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"|     | Setting    | What it does                          |\n| --- | ---------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 5   | **Button** | Size, icon, text and the URL it opens |","table":"table-2"},"1851":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#create-an-offer","content":"|     | Setting     | What it does                  |\n| --- | ----------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 6   | **Colours** | Button and button text colour |","table":"table-2"},"1852":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#write-the-card","content":"The headline and sub headline do the selling, so give each a job:"},"1853":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#write-the-card","content":"**Headline**: what the attendee gets, in their terms."},"1854":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#write-the-card","content":"**Sub headline**: the detail that removes doubt, such as what's included, who it's for or when it closes."},"1855":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#write-the-card","content":"**Title**: a name your team will recognise in the CTAs list, since attendees never see it."},"1856":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#button","content":"**Button URL** is where attendees land when they click: your checkout, booking page or sales page. Write the button **Text** to match what happens next. \"Download Free Toolkit\" tells people what they'll get; \"Click here\" tells them nothing."},"1857":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#button","content":"Saving an offer without a button URL shows **\"Button link is required\"**, and that applies to paid offers too. If any field is invalid when you save, the editor shows **\"Please fix the highlighted fields before saving.\"**"},"1858":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#add-a-countdown","content":"Switch on **Countdown timer** to put a countdown on the offer card. It's a single toggle, set on each offer separately. Use it when the offer really does close or change at a set time, and say in the sub headline what ends."},"1859":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#hold-an-offer","content":"You can build offers well before the webinar and keep them out of sight:"},"1860":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#hold-an-offer","content":"Switch off the toggle on the offer's row in the **CTAs** list, or"},"1861":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#hold-an-offer","content":"Turn the editor's **Published** switch off."},"1862":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#hold-an-offer","content":"Nothing is deleted. Switch it back on when you want it live."},"1863":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-with-ai","content":"**Create with AI** builds a webinar from a description, and offers are one of its five outputs. Script, Landing pages and Emails are selected by default; click the **Offers** chip to include offers."},"1864":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-with-ai","content":"At the offers step, start with positioning."},"1865":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-with-ai","content":"| Approach       | What it does                        |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **Soft Pitch** | Education-focused, offer at the end |","table":"table-3"},"1866":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-with-ai","content":"| Approach              | What it does                                      |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Balanced Approach** | Value plus a clear offer throughout, strong close |","table":"table-3"},"1867":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-with-ai","content":"| Approach         | What it does                                 |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Direct Pitch** | Offer-focused, repeated CTAs, strong urgency |","table":"table-3"},"1868":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-with-ai","content":"Then describe what you're selling and where the button should send people. Pick a category (online course, coaching programme, membership, digital product or service package) and click **Generate Offers**. You get complete offers, each with a title, headline, sub-headline, button text and link. Tick the offers you want to keep, then click **Save and continue**. The offers step costs 1 credit."},"1869":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-with-ai","content":"Generated offers appear on the CTAs tab and are edited like any other. Read the copy before you publish, particularly anything about price and what's included."},"1870":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#show-in-room","content":"In the live room, the side rail has an **Offers** panel. Open it and push the offer to the room when you reach your pitch. When you click **Go Live**, the confirmation reminds you that offers and polls should be ready, so check them in the green room before you start."},"1871":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#show-in-room","content":"Live, simulive and evergreen webinars all use the same offers; only the delivery differs."},"1872":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#end-of-session-redirect","content":"The webinar's **Settings** tab has an **End of Session** URL, which is empty by default. Point it at your offer or booking page so attendees aren't left sitting on a finished webinar. **Expired Session** does the same for anyone arriving at a link that has expired."},"1873":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-on-the-replay","content":"The replay page has two looks, set on the **Replay** tab:"},"1874":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-on-the-replay","content":"| Option              | What happens to your offers                                                                                                       |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar Replica** | A duplicate of your live webinar, with the same video, offers, polls and chat replay, so the replay sells the way the session did |","table":"table-4"},"1875":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-on-the-replay","content":"| Option           | What happens to your offers                                                                                     |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Custom Build** | A page you design yourself, with its own layout, CTAs and branding, for when the replay needs a different pitch |","table":"table-4"},"1876":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-on-the-replay","content":"Two more replay settings support an offer:"},"1877":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-on-the-replay","content":"**How long the replay stays up**: **Always Available**, **Expire after days** or **Specific date**. A replay that closes gives the offer a matching deadline."},"1878":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#offers-on-the-replay","content":"**After the replay ends**, under Redirects, sends viewers on to your offer or booking page once the recording finishes."},"1879":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"Open the webinar's **Analytics** tab. Further down the **Overview**:"},"1880":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"| Panel                  | What it shows                                          |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Offers Performance** | Offers, views, clicks and purchases, with a click rate |","table":"table-5"},"1881":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"| Panel                                           | What it shows                 |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **Views to Clicks** and **Clicks to Purchases** | Where your offer loses people |","table":"table-5"},"1882":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"| Panel                | What it shows                                        |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Revenue by Offer** | Total revenue and payment count, with a details link |","table":"table-5"},"1883":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"The two ratios point at different fixes:"},"1884":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"| If this is low      | What it means                  | Where to look                                           |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Views to Clicks** | The offer itself isn't landing | The headline, the sub headline, the timing of the pitch |","table":"table-6"},"1885":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"| If this is low          | What it means                                       | Where to look                                                        |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Clicks to Purchases** | The offer works but the checkout or pricing doesn't | The checkout page, the price, how well the card matches the checkout |","table":"table-6"},"1886":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"The **Revenue** view splits earnings under **Revenue by Source**, separating paid registrations from offers sold in the room. Offer sales show under **Paid Offer**."},"1887":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#measure-offers","content":"The date range at the top of Analytics applies to everything on the page, so widen it if an offer looks emptier than expected."},"1888":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#with-emails","content":"Two email groups on the **Notifications** tab relate to offers:"},"1889":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#with-emails","content":"**Attendee Action Follow-ups** send based on what someone did, including whether they clicked an offer. They let you treat someone who clicked and didn't buy differently from someone who left after five minutes."},"1890":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#with-emails","content":"**Paid Offer — Transaction Success** is sent after a successful purchase, as a receipt-style confirmation."},"1891":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#with-crm","content":"A connected CRM can act on the **Clicked offer** event, which fires when someone clicks your offer. A sensible mapping is a `webinar-hot` tag plus a notification to sales."},"1892":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#with-people-view","content":"**People** has an **Offer clicked** column, and the **Behavior** filter can combine high watch time with offer clicks to find people who were interested and didn't buy. **Export** the filtered list to work with it elsewhere."},"1893":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#with-paid-webinars","content":"A webinar can charge for registration and still sell offers inside. Registration payments are reported under **Paid Webinar** and offer sales under **Paid Offer**."},"1894":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#with-cloning","content":"When you clone a webinar, offers are in the **Engagement** group of the copy dialog, with polls and email notifications. To try a new offer on a webinar that's already running, clone it and change the copy."},"1895":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, showing how offers fit different selling webinars."},"1896":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#course-creators","content":"An evergreen webinar teaches one core idea and closes with an enrolment offer pointing at the course checkout on the creator's course platform. A countdown marks a bonus window, and a **Webinar Replica** replay keeps the offer working for people who watch later."},"1897":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#coaches","content":"A live masterclass ends with a free offer whose button opens a booking page for a call. **Attendee Action Follow-ups** reach people who clicked but didn't book."},"1898":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#product-teams","content":"A recorded demo carries an offer for a trial, with the button pointing at the sign-up page. The team watches **Views to Clicks** across sessions to judge whether the demo builds enough interest."},"1899":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#agencies","content":"An agency building a client's webinar uses **Create with AI** with **Balanced Approach** to draft offers, edits them into the client's voice, and maps **Clicked offer** to a tag in the client's CRM."},"1900":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#limits","content":"**A button URL is required on every offer**, paid offers included."},"1901":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-146","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#limits","content":"**The title is internal.** Attendees see the headline and sub headline."},"1902":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-147","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#limits","content":"**The countdown is per offer.** Polls have no countdown setting."},"1903":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-148","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#limits","content":"**Two switches control visibility**: the toggle in the CTAs list and **Published** in the editor."},"1904":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-149","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#limits","content":"**Replays carry offers only with Webinar Replica.** A Custom Build replay page has its own CTAs."},"1905":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-150","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#limits","content":"**Offer revenue and registration revenue are reported separately**, under **Paid Offer** and **Paid Webinar**."},"1906":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-151","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#limits","content":"**AI offers use credits**: 1 credit for the offers step."},"1907":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-152","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-add-offer","content":"Open the **CTAs** tab, open any offer, and click **+** at the bottom of the list on the left."},"1908":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-153","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-poll-vs-offer","content":"A poll asks a question. An offer sells something, with a headline, a button and an optional price."},"1909":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-154","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-image-offer","content":"Yes. Choose **Image Offer** under **Offer Style**."},"1910":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-155","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-free-offer","content":"No. Switch **Free** on under **Offer Price**, for example for a download or a booking link."},"1911":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-156","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-wont-save","content":"If the button has no URL, the editor shows **\"Button link is required\"**. Any other invalid field shows **\"Please fix the highlighted fields before saving.\"**"},"1912":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-157","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-countdown","content":"Yes. Turn on the **Countdown timer** toggle when you edit the offer."},"1913":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-158","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-prepare","content":"Yes. Turn its toggle off in the list, or set **Published** to off in the editor."},"1914":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-159","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-show-live","content":"Open **Offers** on the side rail of the live room and push it to the room."},"1915":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-160","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-replay","content":"Yes, if the replay page is set to **Webinar Replica**."},"1916":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-161","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-results","content":"On the **Analytics** Overview. **Offers Performance** gives views, clicks and purchases with a click rate, and **Revenue by Offer** gives total revenue and payment count."},"1917":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-162","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-follow-up","content":"Yes. Use **Attendee Action Follow-ups**, tag them with the **Clicked offer** event in your CRM, or filter **People** by offer clicks and export the list."},"1918":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-163","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#faq-ai","content":"Yes. In **Create with AI**, include the **Offers** chip, choose a positioning and category, and click **Generate Offers**."},"1919":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-164","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Countdown timers: the deadline you can put on any offer card."},"1920":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-165","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Polls: the other kind of CTA, often asked just before the pitch."},"1921":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-166","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Paid webinars: charging for registration, reported apart from offer sales."},"1922":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-167","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Replay pages: keep offers selling on the recording with **Webinar Replica**."},"1923":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-168","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Webinar analytics: views, clicks, purchases and revenue for each offer."},"1924":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-169","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Connect a CRM and map your webinar data: tag the people who clicked an offer."},"1925":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers-170","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/engagement/timed-offers#related","content":"Course creators: an enrolment offer from build to follow-up."},"1926":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","type":"page","content":"Clone a webinar","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","Get started"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar"},"1927":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-0","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","content":"Copy an existing EasyWebinar webinar into a new one, choose its type and which pages, schedule, CTAs, emails and integration settings come with it, without touching the original."},"1928":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-1","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"1929":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-2","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"Before y