webinar#open-clone-dialog","content":"Click **⋮** on its card."},"1984":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#open-clone-dialog","content":"Choose **Clone Webinar**."},"1985":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"The top of the dialog sets out what you're copying from and what you're creating."},"1986":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"*1 Cloning from · 2 Clone into · 3 Choose Webinar Type.*"},"1987":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"|     | Section          | What it shows                                                         |\n| --- | ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Cloning from** | The original webinar, with its type, date and number of registrations |","table":"table-1"},"1988":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"|     | Section        | What it shows                    |\n| --- | -------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Clone into** | The type the new webinar will be |","table":"table-1"},"1989":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"|     | Section                 | What it shows                |\n| --- | ----------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| 3   | **Choose Webinar Type** | The three types to pick from |","table":"table-1"},"1990":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"Pick the type for the copy:"},"1991":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"| Choose           | The copy becomes                   |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Live Webinar** | A webinar you present in real time |","table":"table-2"},"1992":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"| Choose               | The copy becomes                                |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Simulive Webinar** | A recording broadcast at the times you schedule |","table":"table-2"},"1993":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"| Choose                | The copy becomes                                                |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Evergreen Webinar** | A recording on a continuous schedule that registrants pick from |","table":"table-2"},"1994":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-type","content":"Choosing a different type from the original is allowed and is the main reason people clone. A live original can become simulive or evergreen, and an automated one can become live."},"1995":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#name-copy","content":"**New Webinar Name** starts as the original's name with \"(Copy)\" on the end. Replace it with something you'll recognise in your webinar list, especially if both versions will run side by side."},"1996":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-what-to-copy","content":"Under **What would you like to copy?**, tick **Select everything** to bring the lot, or choose item by item."},"1997":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-what-to-copy","content":"| Group              | Items you can copy                                                      |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar assets** | Registration pages · Webinar schedule · Replay settings · Embed widgets |","table":"table-3"},"1998":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-what-to-copy","content":"| Group          | Items you can copy                   |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **Engagement** | Polls · Offers · Email notifications |","table":"table-3"},"1999":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-what-to-copy","content":"| Group            | Items you can copy   |\n| ---------------- | -------------------- |\n| **Integrations** | Integration settings |","table":"table-3"},"2000":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#choose-what-to-copy","content":"The panel at the bottom of the dialog repeats the new webinar's name and type before you commit. Read it once: it's the last chance to catch a wrong type, which can't be changed afterwards."},"2001":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#create-copy","content":"Click **Clone Webinar**. The new webinar is created with the items you ticked, and the original stays exactly as it was."},"2002":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#finish-type-change","content":"A copy that keeps the original's type is ready to edit straight away. A copy that moves from live to simulive or evergreen needs one more thing: a recording to play."},"2003":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#finish-type-change","content":"Open the new webinar and go to its **Content** tab."},"2004":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#finish-type-change","content":"In the **Webinar Video** panel, choose the video. The recording of the original live session is in your library under **Recordings**, named after its webinar, with its duration and recording date."},"2005":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#finish-type-change","content":"Open the **Overview** tab and check **Scheduling Options**. The options menu on that panel changes the schedule for the whole webinar. For what an evergreen schedule offers, see Create an evergreen webinar; for simulive, see Create a simulive webinar."},"2006":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#finish-type-change","content":"Live recordings reach the Library when **Auto Recording** is on in the live room's recording settings. If it was off for the original session, there will be no recording of it to use."},"2007":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#verify","content":"**In My Webinars**, the copy appears with the new name and its type badge, and the count on the matching type tab goes up."},"2008":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#verify","content":"**On the copy's Overview tab**, **Registrants** starts at zero."},"2009":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#verify","content":"**On the original**, registrants, sessions and settings are unchanged."},"2010":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#verify","content":"**On the copy's tabs**, the items you ticked are present: pages on **Content**, polls and offers on **CTAs**, emails on **Notifications**, and connections on **Integrations**."},"2011":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#what-it-is","content":"Cloning copies a webinar's setup into a new, separate webinar. The copy can be edited on its own from then on; changes to one don't flow to the other. It covers the setup, not the history: registrants and attendees stay with the original, so the copy is a fresh webinar rather than a continuation."},"2012":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#what-its-for","content":"Cloning has three everyday uses:"},"2013":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#what-its-for","content":"**Changing the type.** The type can't be edited on an existing webinar, so a copy of the right type is how you move between live, simulive and evergreen."},"2014":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#what-its-for","content":"**Reusing a webinar that works.** Pages, emails, polls and offers come across, so a new event doesn't start from blank."},"2015":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#what-its-for","content":"**Testing a change safely.** Try a different registration page or offer on a copy, leaving the webinar that's already running alone."},"2016":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**It saves the rebuild.** Everything you've already written and designed can come with the copy."},"2017":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**It's selective.** You choose which assets come across, item by item."},"2018":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**It protects what's live.** The original isn't touched, so a working webinar keeps working while you experiment."},"2019":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**It starts the copy clean.** No registrants come across, so the new webinar's numbers are its own."},"2020":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#without-it","content":"Without cloning, changing a webinar's format would mean building the second version by hand: recreating the registration page, rewriting the emails, re-entering polls and offers, and reconnecting integrations. Each one is a chance to introduce a difference you didn't intend."},"2021":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#why-buyers-care","content":"Teams that run webinars as a programme reuse what works. Being able to duplicate a proven webinar, or move it from a live format to an automated one, without rebuilding it, is what makes that practical."},"2022":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#with-webinar-types","content":"Each type delivers content differently, but pages, emails, polls, offers and analytics are shared across all three. That's why a clone can carry those assets into a different type."},"2023":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#with-library","content":"Simulive and evergreen copies play a video from the Library. Recordings of webinars you've already run appear under **Recordings** automatically when auto recording was on, ready to pick on the copy's **Content** tab. See The Library."},"2024":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#with-registration","content":"Ticking **Registration pages** and **Embed widgets** brings the original's pages and embed widgets across to the copy. Review them on the copy before promoting it, since the copy may now be a different type with a different schedule. See Registration page builder and Registration embeds."},"2025":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#with-ctas-and-emails","content":"**Polls** and **Offers** copy to the new webinar's **CTAs** tab, and **Email notifications** copy to its **Notifications** tab, if you leave them ticked. See Polls and Reminder emails."},"2026":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#with-integrations","content":"**Integration settings** carries the original's integration setup to the copy. Check the connections on the copy's **Integrations** tab before it goes live. See Connect a CRM and map your webinar data."},"2027":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#with-replays","content":"**Replay settings** brings the replay configuration from the original's **Replay** tab. See Replay pages."},"2028":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#with-archiving","content":"There is no Delete for webinars. If you don't need a copy, choose **Archive** from its card menu and it moves to the **Archived** tab."},"2029":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how cloning is used."},"2030":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#course-creators","content":"A creator runs a teaching webinar live a few times with recording on, then clones it as **Evergreen**, selects the recording of the strongest session on the copy, and sets an evergreen schedule. The live original stays as it was. See Selling online courses with webinars."},"2031":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team clones last quarter's webinar for a new topic. The registration page layout, reminder emails and integration settings come across, and the team rewrites the content rather than rebuilding the structure."},"2032":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#agencies","content":"An agency keeps a webinar it has refined over several events and clones it as the starting point for each new one, unticking anything that should be set up fresh."},"2033":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#customer-success","content":"A customer success team that presents onboarding live clones the webinar as **Simulive** and chooses the live recording, so the session can run on a schedule while the team covers the chat."},"2034":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#limits","content":"**There is no in-place conversion.** The type of an existing webinar can't be changed; only a copy can have a different type."},"2035":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#limits","content":"**Registrants and attendees stay with the original.** A copy starts with no registrations."},"2036":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#limits","content":"**The copy's type is fixed once created.** Check the summary at the bottom of the dialog before you click **Clone Webinar**."},"2037":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#limits","content":"**A recorded copy needs a video.** Simulive and evergreen webinars play a recording, chosen on the **Content** tab."},"2038":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#limits","content":"**Recordings exist only if auto recording was on.** A live session run with recording off leaves nothing in **Library → Recordings**."},"2039":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#limits","content":"**Copies are archived, not deleted.**"},"2040":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-change-type","content":"Clone it and choose the new type in the dialog. There's no way to convert a webinar in place."},"2041":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-live-to-evergreen","content":"Yes. Clone it with **Evergreen** as the type, then select the live session's recording on the copy's **Content** tab."},"2042":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-registrants","content":"No. The copy starts with no registrations."},"2043":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-original","content":"No. Cloning only creates something new."},"2044":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-selective","content":"Yes. Untick **Email notifications** under **What would you like to copy?**"},"2045":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-polls-offers","content":"Yes, if **Polls** and **Offers** are ticked."},"2046":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-name","content":"It starts with the original's name plus \"(Copy)\". You can change it in the dialog."},"2047":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-remove-copy","content":"Archive it from its card menu. Webinars are archived rather than deleted."},"2048":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/clone-a-webinar#faq-r