xed time for everyone, in the timezone you set. Your registration page shows that time with its timezone. Choose the timezone you will broadcast in."},"2112":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#timezone","content":"Only just-in-time sessions on evergreen webinars follow each attendee's own local time. Live and scheduled sessions always run in the webinar's timezone."},"2113":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#past-dates","content":"You can't schedule a session in the past. Earlier dates are greyed out in the picker."},"2114":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#recurring-schedules","content":"Choosing **Weekly** turns the single session into a recurring schedule and adds four controls:"},"2115":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#recurring-schedules","content":"| Control          | What it does                                  |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| **Days of week** | Which days the webinar runs, Monday to Sunday |","table":"table-1"},"2116":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#recurring-schedules","content":"| Control                                    | What it does                                                                                      |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Start Date** and **End Date (Optional)** | When the recurrence begins and ends. Leave the end date as **No end date** to run it indefinitely |","table":"table-1"},"2117":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#recurring-schedules","content":"| Control                           | What it does                          |\n| --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Session Time** and **Add Time** | Run it more than once on the same day |","table":"table-1"},"2118":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#recurring-schedules","content":"| Control            | What it does                                                             |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Blackout Dates** | Stop the webinar running on specific dates, such as holidays or time off |","table":"table-1"},"2119":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#blackout-dates","content":"A weekly webinar runs until you stop it. Use **Blackout Dates** to skip individual days without ending the series, or set an end date to stop it."},"2120":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#schedule-preferences","content":"By default registrants see **only the next available session**. Change **Schedule Preferences** to let them choose from more upcoming sessions."},"2121":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#pricing","content":"On **Step 3 of 4: Pricing**, choose one:"},"2122":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#pricing","content":"**Free** (selected by default): attendees register without paying."},"2123":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#pricing","content":"**Paid**: attendees pay to register. Requires a connected Stripe account."},"2124":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#pricing","content":"Click **Continue to Registration Template**."},"2125":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#charging","content":"Selecting **Paid** shows:"},"2126":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#charging","content":"**Pricing Title** and an optional **Description**, shown to attendees at checkout"},"2127":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#charging","content":"**Live webinar price**, in US dollars"},"2128":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#charging","content":"**Live + Replay bundle**, to sell access to the webinar and its recording together"},"2129":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#charging","content":"Payments run through **Stripe**. If no account is connected, a **Payments · Action required** panel offers **Connect with Stripe**. Payouts go directly to your own bank account; EasyWebinar never holds your funds. You can switch back to **Free** any time before creating the webinar."},"2130":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#charging","content":"Once people pay, the webinar's **Analytics** tab shows what you've earned under **Revenue**, with a list of every transaction and its status."},"2131":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#registration-template","content":"On **Step 4 of 4: Registration Template**:"},"2132":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#registration-template","content":"Filter by category: **All Templates**, **Agency**, **Coach**, **Education**, **Health & Wellness**, **Lead Magnet**, **Marketing**, or **My Templates** for ones you have saved."},"2133":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#registration-template","content":"Click a template. **Default Register Page** is the simplest one-column option; **Build Your Own** starts from a blank page."},"2134":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#registration-template","content":"Click **Create Webinar**."},"2135":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#registration-template","content":"*1 Category filters · 2 Template cards · 3 Create button.*"},"2136":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#registration-template","content":"You can skip this step. The button reads **Skip & Create Webinar** until you select a template, and you can choose one later."},"2137":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#verify-the-result","content":"The webinar is created and opens in the **registration page builder**, with your schedule applied and a live countdown to the session."},"2138":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#verify-the-result","content":"The default form collects **Full name** and **Email**, both required. Use **Add Custom Field** to collect more on the form."},"2139":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#verify-the-result","content":"Use the desktop and mobile toggle to check both layouts."},"2140":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#verify-the-result","content":"Creating the webinar does not publish it. Your registration page goes live only when you click **Publish**. Use **Preview** to check it and **Save** to keep a draft."},"2141":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#limits-and-variations","content":"**The type is fixed.** Clone the webinar and choose another type on the copy."},"2142":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#limits-and-variations","content":"**A live webinar runs at one fixed time** in the timezone you set."},"2143":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#limits-and-variations","content":"**A weekly webinar runs until you stop it.**"},"2144":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#limits-and-variations","content":"**Registrants see the next session only** unless you change the schedule preference."},"2145":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#limits-and-variations","content":"**Registrant numbers depend on your plan.** Attendee and registration limits differ between EasyWebinar's plans; the features on this page are available on all plans."},"2146":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#faq-multiple-times","content":"Yes.