ar#faq-holiday","content":"Use **Blackout Dates** on the schedule step to list the dates the webinar should skip."},"2152":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#next-steps","content":"Run a live webinar: what to do in the room when your scheduled session starts."},"2153":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#next-steps","content":"The webinar Overview tab: change the schedule for the whole webinar, or act on a single session, after it exists."},"2154":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#next-steps","content":"Webinar reminder emails: bring registrants back for the date and time you set."},"2155":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#next-steps","content":"Offers and the countdown timer: put a call to action in front of the room while you present."},"2156":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-live-webinar#next-steps","content":"Connect a CRM and map your webinar data: send registrants into your CRM as they sign up."},"2157":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","page