                                                                                               |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it is** | A pre-recorded video broadcast at times you set, watched together by everyone in that session |","table":"table-0"},"2206":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                                                |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Builder steps** | Five: name and type, schedule, pricing, video selection, registration template |","table":"table-0"},"2207":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                                    |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Schedule options** | A specific date, or a daily or weekly schedule, set the same way as a live webinar |","table":"table-0"},"2208":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                     |\n| ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Session times** | Run at the times you set, in the webinar's timezone |","table":"table-0"},"2209":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                                |                                                                                                  |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Where the video comes from** | Uploaded and hosted by EasyWebinar, or imported from YouTube, Vimeo, Wistia or a direct MP4 link |","table":"table-0"},"2210":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                 |\n| ----------------- | --------------- |\n| **Upload format** | MP4, up to 4 GB |","table":"table-0"},"2211":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                              |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Chat and Q&A** | Work as on a live webinar; you answer in real time while the recording plays |","table":"table-0"},"2212":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                              |                                                |\n| ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| **Swapping the video later** | **Webinar Video** panel on the **Content** tab |","table":"table-0"},"2213":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                             |                                                                   |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Changing the type later** | Not possible; clone the webinar and pick another type on the copy |","table":"table-0"},"2214":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Have a recording.** A simulive webinar plays a video, so you need one in your library or ready to add. You can add it during setup without leaving the builder."},"2215":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Decide where the video will live.** Uploading it means EasyWebinar hosts it for you. Importing a link means it stays on YouTube, Vimeo or Wistia. See Which video source to use, below."},"2216":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Pick your session times and timezone.** Sessions play at the times you set, in one timezone, so choose times that suit the audience you are targeting."},"2217":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Charging for it?** Paid registration runs through Stripe. Leave pricing on **Free** if you aren't charging. See Paid webinars."},"2218":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Be sure about the type.** The type is fixed once the webinar exists. If you later want an evergreen or live version, you clone it."},"2219":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#open-create-dialog","content":"In the left sidebar, click **My Webinars**."},"2220":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#open-create-dialog","content":"Click **Create a Webinar**."},"2221":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#open-create-dialog","content":"Choose **Create Manually**."},"2222":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#open-create-dialog","content":"If you'd rather have the script, pages, emails, polls and offers written for you, choose **Create with AI** and set **Type** to Simulive before generating. You still pick the video afterwards. See Create with AI."},"2223":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#name-and-type","content":"Type a **Webinar Name**. The builder won't move on while the name is empty."},"2224":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#name-and-type","content":"Under **Webinar Type**, choose **Simulive Webinar**. The card describes it as pre-recorded content that plays at scheduled times, with attendees registering for specific dates."},"2225":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#name-and-type","content":"Optionally add **Tags**."},"2226":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#name-and-type","content":"Click **Continue to Schedule**."},"2227":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#name-and-type","content":"Choosing Simulive gives the builder a fifth step. A live webinar has four; the extra one is **Video Selection**, where you choose the recording."},"2228":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#set-schedule","content":"The schedule step works the same way it does for a live webinar."},"2229":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#set-schedule","content":"Choose a **Schedule Frequency**: **Specific Date**, **Daily** or **Weekly**."},"2230":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#set-schedule","content":"Check the **Timezone**. It starts on your account timezone, and every session plays at its set time in this timezone."},"2231":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#set-schedule","content":"Under **Available Sessions**, set the date and time. Use **Add Session** to offer more than one sitting."},"2232":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#set-schedule","content":"Under **Schedule Preferences**, choose how many upcoming sessions registrants can choose from. By default they see only the next available one."},"2233":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#set-schedule","content":"Click **Continue to Pricing**."},"2234":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#set-schedule","content":"Choosing **Weekly** adds **Days of week**, a **Start Date** and **End Date (Optional)**, **Session Time** with **Add Time**, and **Blackout Dates** for days the webinar should skip. Past dates are greyed out in the date picker. For a walkthrough of every schedule control with screenshots, see Create and schedule a live webinar."},"2235":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#set-schedule","content":"The schedule step shows a message saying attendees will see times in their local time. For simulive sessions that isn't how they run: they play at the times you set, in the webinar's timezone. Only just-in-time sessions on evergreen webinars follow each attendee's local time."},"2236":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#pricing","content":"Choose **Free** or **Paid**."},"2237":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#pricing","content":"Click **Continue to Video Selection**."},"2238":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#pricing","content":"**Paid** charges attendees to register and needs a connected Stripe account. On simulive, pricing comes before video selection, so you set the price before you choose the recording."},"2239":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#choose-video","content":"This is the step that makes the webinar simulive. Whatever you pick here is what plays in every session."},"2240":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#choose-video","content":"*1 All · Videos · Recordings · 2 Search and sort · 3 Add Video · 4 Drag and drop · 5 Your library.*"},"2241":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#choose-video","content":"|     | Control                       | What it does                                                                                     |\n| --- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 1   | **All · Videos · Recordings** | Switches between videos you uploaded or imported and recordings of webinars you have already run |","table":"table-1"},"2242":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#choose-video","content":"|     | Control             | What it does              |\n| --- | ------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Search and sort** | Finds a video by its name |","table":"table-1"},"2243":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#choose-video","content":"|     | Control       | What it does                                 |\n| --- | ------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **Add Video** | Adds a new video without leaving the builder |","table":"table-1"},"2244":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#choose-video","content":"|     | Control           | What it does                          |\n| --- | ----------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Drag and drop** | Uploads a file you drop onto the page |","table":"table-1"},"2245":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#choose-video","content":"|     | Control          | What it does               |\n| --- | ---------------- | -------------------------- |\n| 5   | **Your library** | Click a video to select it |","table":"table-1"},"2246":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#choose-video","content":"Click the video you want."},"2247":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#choose-video","content":"Click **Continue to Registration Template**."},"2248":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#choose-video","content":"The **Recordings** filter is where earlier webinars show up. If you ran a session live with recording on, its recording can become the content of this simulive webinar."},"2249":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#add-video-during-setup","content":"**Add Video** opens two routes:"},"2250":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#add-video-during-setup","content":"**Local import** uploads a file from your computer, and EasyWebinar stores and serves it. No YouTube or Vimeo account is involved."},"2251":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#add-video-during-setup","content":"**Import from URL** plays a video already on **YouTube**, **Vimeo**, **Wistia** or a direct **MP4** link. You enter the link and the video's length."},"2252":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#add-video-during-setup","content":"*1 Platform · 2 Video title · 3 Video URL · 4 Video duration.*"},"2253":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#add-video-during-setup","content":"Either way, the video is saved to your library and can be reused on other webinars. For the full upload and import walkthrough, see Video hosting."},"2254":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#add-video-during-setup","content":"EasyWebinar reads the length of an uploaded file itself, but not of a linked one. It uses the duration to schedule sessions and to know when the webinar ends, so a wrong figure can cut the video short or leave attendees waiting after it has finished."},"2255":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#which-video-source","content":"|                  | Upload (**Local import**) | Link (**Import from URL**)                    |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who hosts it** | EasyWebinar               | YouTube, Vimeo, Wistia or the MP4 link's host |","table":"table-2"},"2256":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#which-video-source","content":"|             | Upload (**Local import**)             | Link (**Import from URL**) |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| **Storage** | Counts towards your account allowance | Uses none                  |","table":"table-2"},"2257":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#which-video-source","content":"|                      | Upload (**Local import**) | Link (**Import from URL**) |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| **What you provide** | The file: MP4, up to 4 GB | The link and the length    |","table":"table-2"},"2258":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#which-video-source","content":"|           | Upload (**Local import**)                          | Link (**Import from URL**)     |\n| --------- | -------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| **Suits** | A recording you don't want published anywhere else | A video that is already online |","table":"table-2"},"2259":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#which-video-source","content":"A video on YouTube stays discoverable there unless you've unlisted it, which is a reason to upload a recording you'd rather keep to registrants."},"2260":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#template","content":"Pick a registration template for the page people sign up on, or click **Skip & Create Webinar** to choose one later."},"2261":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#template","content":"Your registration page can then be edited in the drag-and-drop builder. It doesn't go public until you click **Publish**. See Registration page builder."},"2262":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#verify","content":"**In My Webinars**, the webinar sits under the **Simulive** tab and its card carries a type badge, the next session's date, time and timezone, and the registrant count."},"2263":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#verify","content":"**On the Overview tab**, the **Sessions** panel lists each sitting under **Upcoming**, **Past** and **Cancelled**. A daily or weekly schedule fills the list from its recurrence. See The Overview tab."},"2264":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#verify","content":"**On the Content tab**, a **Webinar Video** panel shows the recording you chose. Live webinars don't have this panel."},"2265":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#verify","content":"**On the registration page**, check the session times and publish the page before you share the link."},"2266":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#verify","content":"*1 Webinar Video, the panel only recorded webinars have.*"},"2267":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#change-recording","content":"The **Webinar Video** panel on the **Content** tab shows the selected recording and its length. **Preview** plays it back, and **Change Video** swaps it for another."},"2268":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#change-recording","content":"Swapping the video leaves your schedule, pages and registrations as they were. That makes it safe to replace a presentation with an improved cut while sessions are already booked."},"2269":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#what-it-is","content":"EasyWebinar has three webinar types, and they differ only in how the content is delivered. Pages, emails, polls, offers and analytics are the same across all three."},"2270":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#what-it-is","content":"|             | Live                     | Simulive    | Evergreen   |\n| ----------- | ------------------------ | ----------- | ----------- |\n| **Content** | You present in real time | A recording | A recording |","table":"table-3"},"2271":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#what-it-is","content":"|            | Live          | Simulive                | Evergreen                                         |\n| ---------- | ------------- | ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Timing** | Dates you set | Dates and times you set | A repeating schedule each registrant chooses from |","table":"table-3"},"2272":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#what-it-is","content":"|                          | Live                    | Simulive                                                | Evergreen                                  |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Who watches together** | Everyone at the session | Everyone at the session, at the same point in the video | Each registrant at the session they picked |","table":"table-3"},"2273":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#what-it-is","content":"|                       | Live | Simulive | Evergreen |\n| --------------------- | ---- | -------- | --------- |\n| **Needs a recording** | No   | Yes      | Yes       |","table":"table-3"},"2274":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#what-it-is","content":"|                                | Live       | Simulive                        | Evergreen |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------- | ------------------------------- | --------- |\n| **Your role during a session** | Presenting | Optional: answering in the chat | Optional  |","table":"table-3"},"2275":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#what-it-is","content":"The short version: simulive is a broadcast of a recording on a timetable. It sits between live, where you present every time, and evergreen, where the schedule runs continuously and each person picks their own time. For the evergreen setup, see Create an evergreen webinar."},"2276":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#what-its-for","content":"Simulive is for a presentation you give again and again, or a session scheduled at an hour you'd rather not be awake for. You record the talk once, and EasyWebinar broadcasts it at the times you choose, like a scheduled programme."},"2277":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**The delivery is the same every time.** A recording doesn't lose its place, run over or forget a point."},"2278":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**The room is still shared.** Everyone in a session is at the same moment of the video, so questions and comments in the chat make sense to everyone reading them."},"2279":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**You can still be there.** You and your moderators answer questions in the chat while the recording plays, which keeps the interaction of a live event."},"2280":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**It runs without you if it has to.** The recording plays on schedule whether or not anyone from your team joins."},"2281":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#without-it","content":"Without simulive, a recurring presentation means presenting live each time, at whatever hour the audience needs. The alternative, a fully automated webinar where people watch at different times, loses the shared conversation, because attendees arriving at different points have nothing in common to talk about."},"2282":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#why-buyers-care","content":"Teams that run the same webinar on a cycle, such as a weekly product walkthrough, a monthly onboarding session or a standing sales presentation, want consistency without giving up a live audience. Simulive gives them a polished recording, set session times and a chat they can staff."},"2283":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#with-chat","content":"Chat and Q&A are set up on the **Engagement** tab, as on a live webinar. You and your moderators reply in real time while the recording plays. See Live chat and Questions and answers."},"2284":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#with-chat","content":"Recorded webinars also have chat options a live webinar lacks: **Third party** embeds an external chat tool, **No Chat** hides the panel, and the **EW Contact Box** collects attendee questions by email even when chat is off."},"2285":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#with-chat-simulation","content":"**Chat Simulation**, under **Engagement**, fills the chat on simulive and evergreen webinars, either with **AI Simulation** or with a scripted CSV in **Manual Simulation**. Only one can be active at a time. See Chat simulation."},"2286":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#with-notifications","content":"Confirmation, reminder and follow-up emails live on the **Notifications** tab. Reminders are timed relative to the webinar rather than at a fixed clock time, so they follow a recurring simulive schedule. See Reminder emails."},"2287":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#with-replays","content":"A simulive session can have a replay page for people who missed it, set on the **Replay** tab. See Replay pages."},"2288":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#with-library","content":"Every video you add, and every recording of a past webinar, lands in the **Library**. Recordings appear there automatically when **Auto Recording** is on in the live room. See The Library."},"2289":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#with-plan-usage","content":"The **Plan** tab, under **Settings** → **Manage Plan**, counts people watching simulive and evergreen sessions on its **Automated attendees** meter, separately from **Live attendees**."},"2290":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#with-people","content":"**People** in the sidebar can filter registrants by webinar **Type**, so you can look at simulive audiences on their own. See People."},"2291":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the type fits different teams."},"2292":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team records its strongest product presentation and runs it as a weekly simulive session. A product specialist joins the chat for each sitting and answers questions while the recording plays, so prospects get a consistent pitch and real answers."},"2293":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#saas-teams","content":"A product team serving several regions schedules the same recorded walkthrough at times that suit each one. Each session runs in the webinar's timezone, so the team sets times for each region accordingly."},"2294":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#customer-success","content":"A customer success team turns its onboarding talk into a recurring simulive session. New customers register for a date, and a team member covers the chat to pick up account-specific questions."},"2295":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#coaches","content":"A coach records a signature talk once and broadcasts it on a regular schedule, joining the chat when they can. Polls and offers work as they would live, so the session still ends with a next step."},"2296":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#limits","content":"**The type is fixed.** You can't convert a simulive webinar to live or evergreen. Clone it and choose the new type on the copy. See Clone a webinar."},"2297":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#limits","content":"**A recording is required.** Simulive and evergreen both play a video; live webinars don't."},"2298":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#limits","content":"**Sessions run in the webinar's timezone,** whatever the in-app message on the schedule step says."},"2299":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#limits","content":"**You can't schedule a session in the past.**"},"2300":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#limits","content":"**Imported videos need an accurate duration.** EasyWebinar uses it to time sessions."},"2301":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#limits","content":"**Removing a linked video at its source breaks the webinar.** If a YouTube video is deleted on YouTube, the webinar that plays it stops working. An uploaded video is contained in EasyWebinar."},"2302":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#limits","content":"**Don't remove a video a webinar is using.** The webinar plays it."},"2303":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#limits","content":"**Uploads count towards storage.** Imported links use none. Extra storage is available as an add-on."},"2304":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-146","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#faq-be-there","content":"No. The recording plays on schedule either way. Being in the chat is what gives simulive its edge over evergreen, so join when you can."},"2305":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-147","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#faq-use-recording","content":"Yes. The **Recordings** filter on the video step lists recordings of your past webinars."},"2306":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-148","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#faq-video-host","content":"No. Upload it with **Local import** and EasyWebinar hosts it. Importing from YouTube, Vimeo or Wistia is optional."},"2307":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-149","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#faq-formats","content":"MP4, up to 4 GB."},"2308":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-150","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#faq-more-than-once","content":"Yes. Add sessions on the schedule step, or switch the frequency to **Daily** or **Weekly**."},"2309":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-151","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#faq-timezone","content":"No. Simulive sessions run at the times you set, in the webinar's timezone, so everyone watches together."},"2310":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-152","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar#faq-swap-video","content":"Yes. Use **Change Video** in the **Webinar Video** panel on the **Content** tab. Schedule, pages and registrations stay as they are."},"2311":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/create-a-simulive-webinar-153","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/getting-started/creat