om/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-broadcast","content":"Does anything I do in the green room get broadcast?"},"2580":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-28","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-cohosts","content":"Where do my co-hosts appear when they join?"},"2581":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-29","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-guest-speaker","content":"How do I invite a guest speaker?"},"2582":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-30","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-account-needed","content":"Does a guest presenter need an EasyWebinar account?"},"2583":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-31","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-team-vs-presenter","content":"What's the difference between a team member and a presenter?"},"2584":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-32","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-invite-from-room","content":"Can I invite people from inside the room?"},"2585":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-33","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-move-back","content":"Can I take someone off the stage?"},"2586":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-34","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-exit","content":"Can I leave the green room without going live?"},"2587":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-35","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-easycast","content":"Should I set up EasyCast in the green room?"},"2588":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-36","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-waiting-area","content":"Is the green room the same as the waiting area?"},"2589":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-37","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#related","content":"Related"},"2590":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-38","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","content":"The green room is the private state of the EasyWebinar live room before a broadcast starts. You and your team can test cameras, microphones and screen sharing and arrange the stage, while the header reads **Not Live** and nothing reaches attendees. Backstage is the waiting area inside the room: co-presenters and moderators arrive there, off stage, and appear to the audience only when you move them on."},"2591":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-39","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#at-a-glance","content":"|                | Green room                                          | Backstage                                         |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it is** | The room before **Go Live**, with nothing broadcast | A holding area for presenters who aren't on stage |","table":"table-0"},"2592":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#at-a-glance","content":"|                  | Green room                                           | Backstage                                                       |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who is there** | You and anyone who has joined to present or moderate | Co-hosts and moderators who have joined but aren't on stage yet |","table":"table-0"},"2593":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#at-a-glance","content":"|                        | Green room                | Backstage                           |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **What attendees see** | Nothing until you go live | Nothing of people waiting backstage |","table":"table-0"},"2594":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#at-a-glance","content":"|                       | Green room                                                                    | Backstage                                                 |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How you get there** | **Enter Room** on the webinar's **Overview**, then **Continue to Green Room** | Joining presenters and moderators land here automatically |","table":"table-0"},"2595":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#at-a-glance","content":"|                   | Green room                                     | Backstage                                                        |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How you leave** | **Go Live** to start broadcasting, or **Exit** | You move a person to the stage, and back again when they're done |","table":"table-0"},"2596":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#at-a-glance","content":"|                             | Green room                                        | Backstage                                |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Where it sits on screen** | The whole room, with the status badge at top left | The **Backstage** panel on the left edge |","table":"table-0"},"2597":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#what-it-is","content":"When you enter the room for a live webinar, you don't go straight on air. You land in the green room: the full webinar room with every control working, but in a **Not Live** state. Your camera preview, the stage layout, the side rail and the EasyCast controls are all there, so you prepare in the same room your attendees will see once you start."},"2598":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#what-it-is","content":"**Backstage** is the part of the room for people who are present but not presenting yet. Anyone joining as a co-host or moderator arrives backstage rather than on stage. From there you move them onto the stage when it's their turn, and back off when they've finished. This works the same before and after you go live."},"2599":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#what-it-is","content":"The two together are what EasyWebinar's glossary calls the green room: a presenter backstage before the broadcast starts."},"2600":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#what-its-for","content":"The green room separates getting ready from being seen. Presenting live involves a handful of things that can go wrong in the first minute: a muted microphone, the wrong camera, a screen share showing the wrong window, a guest who can't hear. The green room gives you time to find those problems while nobody is watching."},"2601":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#how-it-helps","content":"**Mistakes stay private.** Audio checks and false starts happen before the broadcast, not at the top of the recording."},"2602":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#how-it-helps","content":"**Guests arrive quietly.** A co-host can join early, sort out their audio and wait backstage without any of it being shown."},"2603":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#how-it-helps","content":"**The stage changes on your cue.** You decide when each person appears, so handovers between speakers look planned."},"2604":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#how-it-helps","content":"**The start is deliberate.** The broadcast begins only when you click **Go Live** and confirm."},"2605":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#without-it","content":"Without a staging area, the first few minutes of a webinar become the rehearsal. Attendees who arrived on time watch presenters ask each other whether they can be heard, and the recording that will later become your replay page starts with the same fumbling. Guest speakers who join late interrupt the session in progress."},"2606":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#why-buyers-care","content":"Teams that run webinars with more than one speaker (panels, interviews, product walkthroughs with a moderator) need guests to join without disrupting the session. A green room with a backstage area is what makes a multi-presenter webinar look composed, and buyers comparing tools for live webinars look at how guests join and whether they can wait off stage."},"2607":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#add-presenters","content":"Before the session, decide who will present and who will moderate. You have two routes."},"2608":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#add-presenters","content":"**From the Overview tab.** The **Team & Moderators** panel lists the presenters and moderators who can run this webinar. A new webinar shows \"No presenters or moderators added yet.\" Use **Add presenter** for someone who appears on camera and presents, or **Invite** to send an invitation to join the webinar team."},"2609":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#add-presenters","content":"**With a join link.** Click **Share** on the webinar and copy the link for the role:"},"2610":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#add-presenters","content":"| Link                       | Who it's for                           |\n| -------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **Co-presenter Join Link** | A presenter, so they can join the room |","table":"table-1"},"2611":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#add-presenters","content":"| Link                                  | Who it's for                              |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Moderator Join Link for Live room** | A moderator, to handle chat and questions |","table":"table-1"},"2612":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#add-presenters","content":"A presenter or moderator joining by link doesn't need an EasyWebinar account. Treat both links as private: anyone holding one can join your room in that role. The registration, attendee and replay links are the ones meant for your audience."},"2613":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#enter-the-green-room","content":"On the webinar's **Overview**, click **Enter Room**."},"2614":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#enter-the-green-room","content":"Choose your **camera, microphone and speakers**."},"2615":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#enter-the-green-room","content":"Click **Continue to Green Room**."},"2616":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#enter-the-green-room","content":"The button stays greyed out until the room can see a camera and a microphone. If you see **\"Not able to access selected media device\"**, see Camera not detected."},"2617":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"*1 Status · 2 Settings, Reactions, EasyCast and Full Screen · 3 Camera, Mic and Share · 4 Go Live and Exit · 5 Backstage · 6 Side rail · 7 Layout.*"},"2618":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"|     | Area       | What to check here                        |\n| --- | ---------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Status** | **Not Live**, and whether recording is on |","table":"table-2"},"2619":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"|     | Area                                              | What to check here            |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Settings · Reactions · EasyCast · Full Screen** | Room setup and multistreaming |","table":"table-2"},"2620":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"|     | Area                     | What to check here                            |\n| --- | ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **Camera · Mic · Share** | Your own devices and a test of screen sharing |","table":"table-2"},"2621":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"|     | Area               | What to check here                     |\n| --- | ------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Go Live · Exit** | Start the broadcast, or leave the room |","table":"table-2"},"2622":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"|     | Area          | What to check here           |\n| --- | ------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| 5   | **Backstage** | Presenters waiting off stage |","table":"table-2"},"2623":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"|     | Area          | What to check here                                                                  |\n| --- | ------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 6   | **Side rail** | **Chat**, **People**, **Offers**, **Polls**, **Design**, **Question** and **Theme** |","table":"table-2"},"2624":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#read-the-room","content":"|     | Area       | What to check here                   |\n| --- | ---------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 7   | **Layout** | How presenters are arranged on stage |","table":"table-2"},"2625":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#manage-backstage","content":"As co-hosts and moderators join, they appear backstage. Expand the **Backstage** panel on the left edge of the room to see who's waiting. To see everyone at once, open **People** on the side rail."},"2626":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#manage-backstage","content":"|     | Area              | What it shows                                            |\n| --- | ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Invite People** | Join links for presenters and moderators, ready to share |","table":"table-3"},"2627":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#manage-backstage","content":"|     | Area           | What it shows                                              |\n| --- | -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Presenters** | Everyone who can appear on stage, with the **Host** marked |","table":"table-3"},"2628":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#manage-backstage","content":"|     | Area          | What it shows     |\n| --- | ------------- | ----------------- |\n| 3   | **Attendees** | Everyone watching |","table":"table-3"},"2629":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#manage-backstage","content":"**Move someone to the stage** when it's their turn to speak."},"2630":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#manage-backstage","content":"**Move them back** when they're done."},"2631":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#manage-backstage","content":"If a guest hasn't received their link, **Invite People** gives you the presenter and moderator links from inside the room."},"2632":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#final-checks","content":"Use the time before going live to:"},"2633":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#final-checks","content":"**Test Share** with the window or screen you'll actually present."},"2634":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#final-checks","content":"**Confirm recording.** **Auto Recording Enabled** in the header means the session will be recorded; **Settings → Recording Settings** changes it."},"2635":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#final-checks","content":"**Set the look.** Backgrounds, blur, frame overlays and layout are on **Design**. Changes apply immediately, so set them here rather than mid-broadcast."},"2636":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#final-checks","content":"**Switch on any EasyCast destinations.** Click **EasyCast** in the top bar and turn **Stream** on for each channel this session should reach."},"2637":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#final-checks","content":"**Decide on camera and mic.** You can switch **Camera** and **Mic** off in the green room and still go live, for a session built on slides or video."},"2638":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#leave-the-green-room","content":"Click **Go Live** when everyone is ready. The confirmation reminds you that anyone in the waiting area will be moved in automatically, and that offers and polls should already exist. Confirm, and the header changes from **Not Live** to **LIVE** with a timer."},"2639":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#leave-the-green-room","content":"To leave without broadcasting, click **Exit**. For what happens once you're live, see Run a live webinar."},"2640":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#with-team-members","content":"A team member is someone with their own EasyWebinar login, created under **Settings → Team** as an **Admin** or **User**. A presenter or moderator is someone running a specific webinar. Add a person to your team when they work in EasyWebinar regularly; send a join link when they're a guest on one session. Sharing one login between hosts means only one of you can be in the live room as a host. See Team members."},"2641":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#with-share-links","content":"The **Share** dialog on the webinar holds seven links, including the presenter and moderator ones above. **Shorten URL's** gives you shorter versions. See Sharing links."},"2642":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#with-easycast","content":"EasyCast destinations are switched on in the green room, before you go live. Once the broadcast starts, a platform icon for each destination appears in the top bar. Connections are made once, under **Integrations → EasyCast** in the sidebar, and work across every webinar."},"2643":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#with-room-design","content":"The **Design** panel sets the background, a frame overlay and the stage layout. Layout matters most when several presenters are on stage or someone is sharing a screen."},"2644":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the green room and backstage fit different webinars."},"2645":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team runs a panel with two guest speakers from partner companies. Each guest gets the **Co-presenter Join Link**, joins fifteen minutes early, and checks their audio backstage. The host introduces the topic alone, then moves each guest onto the stage in turn."},"2646":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#customer-success","content":"A customer success manager presents a customer training session while a colleague joins with the **Moderator Join Link for Live room** to handle questions. The moderator never needs to appear on stage, so they stay off it for the whole session."},"2647":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#coaches","content":"A coach runs an interview-style masterclass with a guest expert who has no EasyWebinar account. The guest joins by link, waits backstage during the coach's opening, and comes on stage for the interview segment."},"2648":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#product-teams","content":"A product team rehearses a product launch demo in the green room: they test the screen share of the product, pick a layout that gives the demo most of the stage, and switch on a LinkedIn Organisation destination in EasyCast before going live."},"2649":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"**A camera and microphone are needed to get past the device check,** even if you switch them off in the green room."},"2650":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"**The green room broadcasts nothing.** The header reads **Not Live** until you go live."},"2651":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"**Co-hosts and moderators arrive backstage,** never straight onto the stage."},"2652":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"**Presenter and moderator links grant that role** to whoever holds them. Keep them private."},"2653":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"**Joining by link needs no account,** but a person with a team login can also join as a presenter."},"2654":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"**Design changes apply as you make them.** Anything you change after going live is visible."},"2655":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#limits","content":"**Only one event can be live at a time.** If another webinar is live, **Enter Room** shows \"You can only have one event live at a time.\""},"2656":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-broadcast","content":"No. The header reads **Not Live**, and nothing is sent to attendees until you click **Go Live** and confirm."},"2657":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-cohosts","content":"Backstage. Expand the **Backstage** panel on the left edge to see them, and move them to the stage when you want them seen."},"2658":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-guest-speaker","content":"Send them the **Co-presenter Join Link** from the **Share** dialog, or add them under **Team & Moderators** on the Overview tab."},"2659":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-account-needed","content":"No. Presenters and moderators can join with their link without an account."},"2660":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-team-vs-presenter","content":"A team member has their own login to your EasyWebinar account. A presenter or moderator is running a specific webinar, and may be a guest with only a join link."},"2661":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-invite-from-room","content":"Yes. **Invite People** at the top of the **People** panel shares the presenter and moderator join links."},"2662":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-move-back","content":"Yes. Move them back off the stage when they've finished, and they return to backstage."},"2663":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-exit","content":"Yes. Click **Exit**."},"2664":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-easycast","content":"Yes. Switch **Stream** on for each destination before you click **Go Live**."},"2665":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#faq-waiting-area","content":"No. The green room is for you and your presenters. The waiting area is where attendees wait before the session, and they're moved into the webinar automatically when you go live."},"2666":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#related","content":"Create and schedule a live webinar: the session has to exist and be scheduled before you can enter its green room."},"2667":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#related","content":"The Overview tab: where **Enter Room** opens the green room for a session."},"2668":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#related","content":"Live chat settings: decide how chat behaves before your moderator joins backstage."},"2669":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/green-room#related","content":"Set up Q&A: set up the question queue a moderator will work through."},"2670":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"page","content":"Run a live webinar","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","The live room"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar"},"2671":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-0","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","content":"Enter the EasyWebinar webinar room, prepare in the green room, go live, present with chat, polls, offers and Q&A, then end the session and find your recording."},"2672":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-1","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"2673":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-2","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"Before you begin"},"2674":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-3","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#run-the-session","content":"Run the session"},"2675":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-4","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#open-the-room","content":"1. Open the webinar room"},"2676":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-5","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#device-check","content":"2. Pass the device check"},"2677":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-6","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#get-ready","content":"3. Get ready in the green room"},"2678":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-7","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#check-recording","content":"4. Check recording"},"2679":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-8","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#style-the-room","content":"5. Style the room"},"2680":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-9","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#switch-on-easycast","content":"6. Switch on streaming destinations (optional)"},"2681":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-10","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#go-live","content":"7. Go live"},"2682":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-11","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#present","content":"8. Present"},"2683":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-12","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#end-the-session","content":"9. End the session"},"2684":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-13","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#verify-the-result","content":"Verify the result"},"2685":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-14","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#why-it-matters","content":"Why running the room well matters"},"2686":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-15","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#what-its-for","content":"What it's for"},"2687":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-16","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"How it helps"},"2688":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-17","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#without-it","content":"What happens without it"},"2689":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-18","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#why-buyers-care","content":"Why buyers care"},"2690":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-19","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#works-with","content":"How the live room works with other features"},"2691":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-20","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#with-chat-and-qa","content":"Chat and Q&A settings"},"2692":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-21","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#with-polls-and-offers","content":"Polls and offers"},"2693":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-22","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#with-replays-and-library","content":"Replays and the Library"},"2694":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-23","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#with-cloning","content":"Evergreen from a live session"},"2695":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-24","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#with-easycast","content":"EasyCast"},"2696":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-25","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#who-uses-it","content":"Who runs live webinars, and how"},"2697":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-26","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#coaches","content":"Coaches and consultants"},"2698":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-27","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#product-teams","content":"SaaS and product teams"},"2699":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-28","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#b2b-marketing","content":"B2B marketing teams"},"2700":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-29","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#course-creators","content":"Course creators"},"2701":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-30","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"2702":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-31","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"2703":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-32","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-green-room-broadcast","content":"Is anything broadcast while I'm in the green room?"},"2704":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-33","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-greyed-out","content":"Why is Continue to Green Room greyed out?"},"2705":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-34","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-camera-off","content":"Can I go live with my camera off?"},"2706":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-35","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-recorded","content":"Is my webinar recorded automatically?"},"2707":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-36","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-recording-location","content":"Where does the recording go?"},"2708":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-37","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-polls-manual","content":"Do polls appear on their own during a live webinar?"},"2709":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-38","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-share-screen","content":"Can I share my screen?"},"2710":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-39","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-stop-chat","content":"Can I stop attendees chatting with each other?"},"2711":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-waiting-area","content":"What happens to people waiting when I go live?"},"2712":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-rejoin","content":"Can I restart a session after ending it?"},"2713":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-one-live","content":"Why can't I enter the room for a second webinar?"},"2714":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#related","content":"Related"},"2715":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","content":"To run a live webinar in EasyWebinar, you open the webinar room from the webinar's **Overview**, pass a quick camera and microphone check, and arrive in the green room, where nothing reaches your audience. When you're ready you click **Go Live**, present using the panels on the right-hand rail, and finish with **End Session**. The result is a broadcast to everyone registered for the session, with the recording saved to **Library → Recordings** if recording was on."},"2716":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                                                                            |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you start** | The webinar's **Overview** → **Enter Room**, or **Go Live** in the **⋮** menu on a card in **My Webinars** |","table":"table-0"},"2717":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                             |                                                                             |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What you need to get in** | A working camera and microphone. You can switch both off once you're inside |","table":"table-0"},"2718":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                                                                |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Before you broadcast** | The green room. The header reads **Not Live** and nothing is sent to attendees |","table":"table-0"},"2719":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|               |                                                                                                   |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Recording** | Shown as **Auto Recording Enabled** in the header; change it in **Settings → Recording Settings** |","table":"table-0"},"2720":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                       |                                                                                     |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Panels while live** | **Chat**, **People**, **Offers**, **Polls**, **Question**, **Design** and **Theme** |","table":"table-0"},"2721":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                                               |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Top-bar controls** | **Settings**, **Reactions**, **EasyCast**, **Full Screen**, **Camera**, **Mic** and **Share** |","table":"table-0"},"2722":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                         |                                                                                                           |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Streaming elsewhere** | EasyCast sends the session to YouTube, LinkedIn, LinkedIn Organisation pages and custom RTMP destinations |","table":"table-0"},"2723":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|            |                                                             |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Ending** | **End Session** disconnects everyone, and nobody can rejoin |","table":"table-0"},"2724":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                             |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| **One at a time** | Only one of your events can be live at once |","table":"table-0"},"2725":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Be signed in as a team member.** Any team member signed in to EasyWebinar can open the room. To bring in a co-presenter or moderator, see The green room and backstage."},"2726":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Check your camera and microphone.** The room won't let you past the device check without both."},"2727":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Set chat, Q&A and the attendee list in advance.** Who can see chat messages and how Q&A works are chosen on the webinar's **Engagement** tab. Whether attendees can see each other is **Show Attendees** on the **Settings** tab. These belong to the webinar's setup, not the live room, so decide them before the session."},"2728":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Build your polls and offers.** Create polls and offers on the **CTAs** tab. You can keep an offer switched off in the list until you want it."},"2729":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Fill in End of Session.** On the **Settings** tab, **End of Session** is where attendees go when the stream ends. It's empty by default, which leaves attendees on a finished webinar."},"2730":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#before-you-begin","content":"**Connect any streaming destinations.** If you plan to stream to YouTube or LinkedIn as well, connect them once under **Integrations → EasyCast** in the sidebar."},"2731":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#open-the-room","content":"Open the webinar. It opens on **Overview**."},"2732":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#open-the-room","content":"Click **Enter Room** at the top right."},"2733":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#open-the-room","content":"You can also click **⋮** on the webinar's card in **My Webinars** and choose **Go Live**, which takes you into the same room."},"2734":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#device-check","content":"You're asked to choose your **camera, microphone and speakers**. Pick each one, then click **Continue to Green Room**."},"2735":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#device-check","content":"The button stays greyed out until the room can see a camera and a microphone. If it can't open your camera, you'll see **\"Not able to access selected media device\"**. Allow camera access in your browser and close any other app that's using the camera. Camera not detected walks through the fixes."},"2736":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#device-check","content":"If another of your webinars is already live, **Enter Room** shows **\"You can only have one event live at a time.\"** Join the session that's running, or go live with the new one."},"2737":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#get-ready","content":"The green room is the room as it will look, with nothing broadcast. Check your framing, test **Share**, and get your co-hosts in place."},"2738":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#get-ready","content":"*The green room: 1 Status · 2 Settings, Reactions, EasyCast and Full Screen · 3 Camera, Mic and Share · 4 Go Live and Exit · 5 Backstage · 6 Side rail · 7 Layout.*"},"2739":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#get-ready","content":"Anyone who joins as a co-host or moderator lands in **Backstage**, not on stage. The green room page covers backstage, the People panel and presenter links in detail."},"2740":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#check-recording","content":"Look at the badge in the header. **Auto Recording Enabled** means the session will be recorded. To change it, click **Settings** in the top bar, then **Recording Settings**."},"2741":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#check-recording","content":"|     | Section             | What it covers              |\n| --- | ------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Device settings** | Camera, audio and recording |","table":"table-1"},"2742":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#check-recording","content":"|     | Section                | What it covers                  |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Recording Settings** | Whether the session is recorded |","table":"table-1"},"2743":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#check-recording","content":"|     | Section         | What it covers                                 |\n| --- | --------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **Preferences** | Chat moderation, Q&A moderation and appearance |","table":"table-1"},"2744":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#check-recording","content":"Keep recording on unless you have a specific reason to switch it off. The replay usually reaches more people than the live session does, and a recording is what you'd use to turn this webinar into an evergreen one later."},"2745":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#style-the-room","content":"Click **Design** on the right-hand rail. Do this now: design changes apply immediately, so anything you change once you're live happens in front of your audience."},"2746":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#style-the-room","content":"|     | Control           | What to do with it                                                                           |\n| --- | ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **Stage / Frame** | **Stage** styles what sits behind the presenters; **Frame** styles the area around the stage |","table":"table-2"},"2747":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#style-the-room","content":"|     | Control                | What to do with it                                            |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Background presets** | Pick a supplied background, or **+** to upload your own image |","table":"table-2"},"2748":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#style-the-room","content":"|     | Control            | What to do with it                                   |\n| --- | ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **Blur Intensity** | Starts at 0. Raise it to blur whatever is behind you |","table":"table-2"},"2749":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#style-the-room","content":"|     | Control     | What to do with it                     |\n| --- | ----------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Colours** | Use a plain colour instead of an image |","table":"table-2"},"2750":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#style-the-room","content":"|     | Control            | What to do with it                                                      |\n| --- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 5   | **Frame Overlays** | A border, logo bar or lower third over the stage, or **+** for your own |","table":"table-2"},"2751":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#style-the-room","content":"|     | Control    | What to do with it                                                      |\n| --- | ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 6   | **Layout** | Open **Choose Layout** at the bottom of the stage to arrange presenters |","table":"table-2"},"2752":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#style-the-room","content":"|     | Control   | What to do with it                                        |\n| --- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 7   | **Theme** | **Light**, **Dark** or **System**, for your own view only |","table":"table-2"},"2753":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#style-the-room","content":"Blur is the quickest fix for an untidy room. A frame overlay is where your branding goes, and it carries through to the recording and anything EasyCast streams out. Upload overlays with a transparent background, otherwise they cover the video instead of framing it. Layout matters most with several presenters or a screen share, because it decides whether your slides or your faces take the space."},"2754":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#switch-on-easycast","content":"If you connected destinations in **Integrations → EasyCast**, click **EasyCast** in the top bar of the room. Switch **Stream** on for each destination you want this session to reach. The pencil beside a destination sets the title and description shown on that platform, so your public stream doesn't carry your internal webinar name. **Connect More Channels** takes you to the Integrations page to add another."},"2755":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#switch-on-easycast","content":"EasyCast is set up per account, so a destination connected once is available on every webinar. It covers **YouTube**, **LinkedIn**, **LinkedIn Organisation** and **Custom RTMP**."},"2756":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#go-live","content":"Click **Go Live**. A confirmation asks you to check two things: people in the waiting area will be moved into the webinar automatically, and your offers and polls should already be created. Click **Go Live** in the dialog to start."},"2757":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#go-live","content":"*Live: 1 LIVE with a timer, and Recording · 2 One icon per EasyCast destination · 3 End Session.*"},"2758":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#go-live","content":"The header now shows **LIVE** with a timer of how long you've been broadcasting, the recording badge changes to **Recording**, and **Go Live** becomes **End Session**. If you're streaming with EasyCast, a platform icon appears for each destination. Click it to open the stream on that platform and see what viewers there are seeing."},"2759":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#go-live","content":"You can switch your camera and microphone off with **Camera** and **Mic** and stay live, which suits a session built on slides or a video rather than your face."},"2760":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#present","content":"Everything you use while presenting sits on the right-hand rail:"},"2761":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#present","content":"| Panel    | What you use it for                                         |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Chat** | Attendee messages, with **Global Chat** and **Admin Chats** |","table":"table-3"},"2762":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#present","content":"| Panel      | What you use it for                                          |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **People** | Presenters and attendees, and moving people on and off stage |","table":"table-3"},"2763":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#present","content":"| Panel      | What you use it for          |\n| ---------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **Offers** | Pushing an offer to the room |","table":"table-3"},"2764":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#present","content":"| Panel     | What you use it for                                              |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Polls** | Launching a poll. On a live webinar you launch each one yourself |","table":"table-3"},"2765":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#present","content":"| Panel        | What you use it for                                   |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Question** | The Q&A queue, split into **Active** and **Answered** |","table":"table-3"},"2766":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#present","content":"| Panel      | What you use it for              |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Design** | Backgrounds, overlays and layout |","table":"table-3"},"2767":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#present","content":"| Panel     | What you use it for   |\n| --------- | --------------------- |\n| **Theme** | Light, dark or system |","table":"table-3"},"2768":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#present","content":"In the top bar, **Share** shares your screen, **Full Screen** expands the stage, and **Reactions** enables emoji reactions from the room."},"2769":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#present","content":"Polls don't fire on their own in a live session, so plan when each poll goes out. Offers reach the room when you push them from the **Offers** panel. The **Question** panel keeps **Active** and **Answered** apart, so you can see at a glance what's still waiting."},"2770":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#end-the-session","content":"Click **End Session** and confirm. Ending disconnects everyone in the room, and nobody can rejoin, which is why EasyWebinar asks first. If you were streaming with EasyCast, the broadcast stops on every destination at the same moment."},"2771":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#end-the-session","content":"Attendees then go to the URL you set in **End of Session**, if you set one."},"2772":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#verify-the-result","content":"**While live:** the header shows **LIVE** with a running timer and the **Recording** badge. With EasyCast on, there's one platform icon per destination."},"2773":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#verify-the-result","content":"**Recording:** open **Library → Recordings**. The recording is named after its webinar, with its duration and the date it was recorded."},"2774":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#verify-the-result","content":"**Session history:** on the webinar's **Overview**, the session moves to the **Past** tab of the **Sessions** panel."},"2775":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#verify-the-result","content":"**Attendance:** the webinar's **Analytics** tab shows **Live Attended** for people who joined the broadcast. See Webinar analytics."},"2776":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#what-its-for","content":"The live room is where a live webinar actually happens. Everything you set up beforehand (the registration page, reminders, polls, offers) leads to this hour. The room gives you a private place to prepare, a clear moment to start, the tools to engage and sell while you present, and a definite end."},"2777":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**You can prepare in private.** The green room lets you fix audio, lighting and screen sharing with nobody watching."},"2778":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**The start is controlled.** Nothing is broadcast until you confirm **Go Live**, and people in the waiting area are moved in automatically when you do."},"2779":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**Selling happens in the room.** Offers and polls are pushed from the same rail you use for chat and questions."},"2780":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**The recording is automatic.** With recording on, the session lands in your Library without an extra step."},"2781":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#how-it-helps","content":"**One session can reach more places.** EasyCast sends the same broadcast to YouTube and LinkedIn."},"2782":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#without-it","content":"Without a staging area, presenters test their microphones in front of the audience, and a co-host's first words are an apology about echo. Without a confirmation step, a webinar can start before the offers exist. Without automatic recording, the replay you planned to send to no-shows may not exist at all."},"2783":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#why-buyers-care","content":"Teams choosing a live webinar platform want to know that a live session will look composed, that they can sell during it, and that they'll have a recording afterwards. The live room covers all three in one place, and the recording feeds the replay and the evergreen version of the same webinar."},"2784":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#with-chat-and-qa","content":"How chat and questions behave in the room is set on the webinar's **Engagement** tab. **Hosts only** makes each attendee's messages private to your team, **No Chat** removes the panel, and Q&A can be public, private or disabled. See Live chat and Questions and answers."},"2785":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#with-polls-and-offers","content":"Polls and offers are created on the **CTAs** tab and shown from the room. A row's toggle in the CTAs list keeps an offer ready without showing it. Switch on **Countdown timer** in the offer editor to put a countdown on an offer."},"2786":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#with-replays-and-library","content":"Your recording appears in **Library → Recordings**. With the replay page set to **Webinar Replica**, the replay shows the same video, offers, polls and chat replay as the live session. See Replay pages and The Library."},"2787":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#with-cloning","content":"A webinar's type can't be changed, so the way to automate a successful live session is to clone it as **Evergreen** and pick its recording. See Clone a webinar."},"2788":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#with-easycast","content":"EasyCast multistreaming sends the live session to YouTube, LinkedIn, LinkedIn Organisation pages and custom RTMP destinations, connected once under **Integrations → EasyCast** and switched on per session in the room. Facebook isn't offered as a destination; its RTMP details may work under **Custom RTMP**."},"2789":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the live room fits different teams."},"2790":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#coaches","content":"A coach runs a live masterclass alone. They blur the background in the green room, keep recording on, launch a poll about the audience's situation halfway through, and push a booking offer near the end. **End of Session** sends everyone to the booking page."},"2791":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#product-teams","content":"A product manager presents a release walkthrough or product demo while a colleague moderates. The colleague waits backstage, handles the **Question** queue during the demo, and comes on stage for the last ten minutes to answer the top questions. **Share** carries the product demo, and the layout favours the screen."},"2792":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team runs a panel webinar with branded frame overlays and streams it to the company's LinkedIn page through EasyCast. Registered attendees watch in the webinar room, and the overlay carries the brand into the recording too."},"2793":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#course-creators","content":"A creator runs a training live a few times with recording on, then clones the strongest session as an evergreen webinar using the recording from the Library. The course creator's guide follows that route end to end."},"2794":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#limits","content":"**A camera and microphone are required to enter,** even if you switch them off afterwards."},"2795":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#limits","content":"**Only one event can be live at a time.**"},"2796":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#limits","content":"**Polls are launched manually** on a live webinar."},"2797":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#limits","content":"**Design changes apply immediately,** including mid-broadcast."},"2798":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#limits","content":"**Theme is personal.** Light, dark or system changes your view, not the attendees'."},"2799":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#limits","content":"**Ending is final.** **End Session** disconnects everyone, and nobody can rejoin."},"2800":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#limits","content":"**Chat, Q&A and Show Attendees are setup controls.** Set them on the webinar's tabs before you go live."},"2801":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#limits","content":"**EasyCast is for live webinars.** Simulive and evergreen webinars play a recording rather than broadcasting."},"2802":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-green-room-broadcast","content":"No. The header reads **Not Live** until you click **Go Live** and confirm."},"2803":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-greyed-out","content":"The room needs to see a working camera and microphone before it lets you in. See Camera not detected."},"2804":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-camera-off","content":"Yes. You need a camera to enter, but you can switch **Camera** and **Mic** off in the green room and still go live."},"2805":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-recorded","content":"When the header shows **Auto Recording Enabled**, yes. Change it in **Settings → Recording Settings**."},"2806":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-recording-location","content":"To **Library → Recordings**, named after the webinar with its duration and recording date."},"2807":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-polls-manual","content":"No. On a live webinar you launch each poll yourself from the **Polls** panel."},"2808":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-share-screen","content":"Yes, with **Share** in the top bar."},"2809":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-stop-chat","content":"Yes. Before the session, set chat to **Hosts only** on the **Engagement** tab, or choose **No Chat**."},"2810":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-waiting-area","content":"People in the waiting area are moved into the webinar automatically when you go live."},"2811":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-rejoin","content":"No. Ending disconnects everyone and nobody can rejoin, so make sure you're finished before you confirm."},"2812":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#faq-one-live","content":"Another of your events is live. EasyWebinar allows one live event at a time."},"2813":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#related","content":"Create and schedule a live webinar: set the session time and registration before you open the room."},"2814":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#related","content":"The webinar Overview tab: where **Enter Room** sits, and where past sessions are listed."},"2815":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-144","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#related","content":"Sharing links: the co-presenter and moderator links that bring people backstage."},"2816":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar-145","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/live-room/run-a-live-webinar#related","content":"Webinar analytics and live attendance: how many registrants turned up to this session."},"2817":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"page","content":"The Library","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","Videos, recordings and replays"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library"},"2818":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-0","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","content":"Find, add and manage the videos, webinar recordings, images and documents your webinars use, see which files count towards your storage, and put a library video to work in a simulive or evergreen webinar."},"2819":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-1","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#before-you-begin","content":"Before you begin"},"2820":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-2","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#steps","content":"Manage your media"},"2821":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-3","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#open-library","content":"1. Open the Library"},"2822":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-4","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#videos","content":"2. Check your videos and where each one is hosted"},"2823":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-5","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#recordings","content":"3. Find recordings of webinars you've run"},"2824":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-6","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#images","content":"4. Add images for your pages"},"2825":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-7","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#files","content":"5. Keep documents in Files"},"2826":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-8","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#add-media","content":"6. Add new media"},"2827":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-9","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#use-in-webinar","content":"7. Use a video or recording in a webinar"},"2828":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-10","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#verify","content":"Verify the result"},"2829":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-11","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#why-it-matters","content":"Why the Library matters"},"2830":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-12","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#what-its-for","content":"What it's for"},"2831":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-13","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#how-it-helps","content":"How it helps"},"2832":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-14","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#without-it","content":"What happens without it"},"2833":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-15","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#why-buyers-care","content":"Why buyers care"},"2834":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-16","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#works-with","content":"How it works with other features"},"2835":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-17","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-video-hosting","content":"Video hosting"},"2836":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-18","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-live-room","content":"The live room"},"2837":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-19","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-cloning","content":"Turning a live webinar into an evergreen one"},"2838":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-20","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-recorded-webinars","content":"Simulive and evergreen webinars"},"2839":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-21","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-plan","content":"Storage and your plan"},"2840":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-22","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-ai-moderator","content":"AI Moderator (Beta)"},"2841":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-23","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#who-uses-it","content":"Who uses it, and how"},"2842":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-24","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#course-creators","content":"Course creators"},"2843":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-25","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#product-teams","content":"SaaS and product teams"},"2844":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-26","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#agencies","content":"Agencies"},"2845":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-27","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#customer-success","content":"Customer success teams"},"2846":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-28","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"2847":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-29","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"2848":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-30","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-recordings","content":"Where are my webinar recordings?"},"2849":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-31","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-missing-recording","content":"Why isn't my live session in Recordings?"},"2850":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-32","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-badge","content":"How can I tell if a video is hosted on EasyWebinar or YouTube?"},"2851":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-33","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-imported-storage","content":"Do imported videos use my storage?"},"2852":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-34","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-storage","content":"How much storage do I have?"},"2853":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-35","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-recording-evergreen","content":"Can I use a recording as the content for an evergreen webinar?"},"2854":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-36","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-delete","content":"Can I delete a video a webinar is using?"},"2855":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-37","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-documents","content":"Where do I upload documents?"},"2856":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-38","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-ai-moderator-files","content":"What file types can the AI Moderator read?"},"2857":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-39","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-rename","content":"Can I rename a video?"},"2858":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#related","content":"Related"},"2859":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","content":"Use the **Library** to find and manage everything your webinars play or display: videos you uploaded or imported, recordings of sessions you have already run, images for your pages, and documents. When you're done, you'll know where each item lives, whether it is using your storage allowance, and how to put a video or recording to work in a simulive or evergreen webinar."},"2860":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#before-you-begin","content":"**Find it in the sidebar.** The Library sits in the main sidebar, alongside **My Webinars**, **Create with AI** and **Integrations**. It isn't inside a single webinar, so anything you add can be reused across your webinars."},"2861":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#before-you-begin","content":"**Know what uses storage.** Only files uploaded to EasyWebinar count towards your storage. Videos imported from a URL use none."},"2862":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#before-you-begin","content":"**Keep live recording on** if you want your sessions to land here. Recording is on by default in the live room, where the header reads **Auto Recording Enabled**."},"2863":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#before-you-begin","content":"**Know your upload limit.** Upload video as **MP4**, up to **4 GB** per file. See video and storage limits."},"2864":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#open-library","content":"Click **Library** in the sidebar. It has four tabs, and your storage is shown at the top of every one of them."},"2865":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#open-library","content":"| Tab        | What it holds                                                                 |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Videos** | Videos you added yourself, uploaded from your computer or imported from a URL |","table":"table-0"},"2866":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#open-library","content":"| Tab            | What it holds                               |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| **Recordings** | Recordings of webinars you have already run |","table":"table-0"},"2867":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#open-library","content":"| Tab        | What it holds                              |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Images** | Images you uploaded, for use on your pages |","table":"table-0"},"2868":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#open-library","content":"| Tab       | What it holds          |\n| --------- | ---------------------- |\n| **Files** | Documents such as PDFs |","table":"table-0"},"2869":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#videos","content":"Open the **Videos** tab. Each card shows the video's duration and when it was added, with a menu for renaming, previewing or removing it."},"2870":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#videos","content":"*1 The four tabs · 2 Your storage allowance · 3 A YouTube badge · 4 An EasyWebinar badge. Account details and some thumbnails are blurred.*"},"2871":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#videos","content":"The small badge in the corner of each card shows where the video is hosted:"},"2872":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#videos","content":"| Badge           | What it means                     | Uses your storage? |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| **EasyWebinar** | The file is stored on EasyWebinar | Yes                |","table":"table-1"},"2873":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#videos","content":"| Badge                        | What it means                                         | Uses your storage? |\n| ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| **YouTube**, Vimeo or Wistia | You imported a link; the video stays on that platform | No                 |","table":"table-1"},"2874":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#videos","content":"Check the badge before you delete anything on another platform. Removing a YouTube video breaks the webinar that plays it, while removing an EasyWebinar-hosted video is contained within EasyWebinar."},"2875":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#recordings","content":"Open the **Recordings** tab. Each recording is named after its webinar, with the duration and the date it was recorded."},"2876":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#recordings","content":"*Recordings of sessions already run, each named after its webinar. Account details are blurred.*"},"2877":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#recordings","content":"Recordings are captured automatically when **Auto Recording** is on in the live room, and appear here after the session. They also show on the **Recordings** tab of the video picker when you set up a simulive or evergreen webinar."},"2878":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#images","content":"Open the **Images** tab to see images you've uploaded for your pages. Click **Add Media** to upload more."},"2879":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#files","content":"Open the **Files** tab for documents, such as PDFs. Each file shows its name, its upload date and its page count."},"2880":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#files","content":"The **Files** tab is also where the AI Moderator's documents live. The AI Moderator is in **Beta**: it answers attendee questions from documents you give it, reading **PDF, DOCX or PPTX** files up to **25MB** each, and it retrains every time you add a source."},"2881":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#add-media","content":"Click **Add Media**. It works the same on every tab and offers two routes:"},"2882":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#add-media","content":"| Route            | What happens                                         |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Local import** | Uploads from your computer, and EasyWebinar hosts it |","table":"table-2"},"2883":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#add-media","content":"| Route               | What happens                                                          |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Import from URL** | Points at **YouTube**, **Vimeo**, **Wistia** or a direct **MP4** link |","table":"table-2"},"2884":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#add-media","content":"For an imported video you also enter its length, because EasyWebinar needs the duration to schedule sessions. See Video hosting for both routes step by step."},"2885":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#use-in-webinar","content":"Simulive and evergreen webinars play a video from your library:"},"2886":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#use-in-webinar","content":"When you create the webinar, the **Video Selection** step shows your library, filtered by **All**, **Videos** or **Recordings**."},"2887":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#use-in-webinar","content":"Click the video you want, or use **Add Video** to add a new one without leaving the step."},"2888":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#use-in-webinar","content":"To change it later, open the webinar's **Content** tab and use the **Webinar Video** panel. **Preview** plays the current video and **Change Video** swaps it."},"2889":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#use-in-webinar","content":"Changing the video doesn't affect the webinar's schedule, pages or registrations."},"2890":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#verify","content":"**A new upload** appears on the **Videos** tab with the **EasyWebinar** badge, and your storage figure at the top of the Library goes up."},"2891":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#verify","content":"**An imported video** appears with its platform's badge, and your storage figure doesn't change."},"2892":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#verify","content":"**A live session you recorded** appears on the **Recordings** tab after the session, named after its webinar."},"2893":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#verify","content":"**A new document** appears on the **Files** tab with its name, upload date and page count."},"2894":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#verify","content":"**A library video in use** shows in the **Webinar Video** panel on that webinar's **Content** tab."},"2895":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#what-its-for","content":"The Library is the shared store behind your webinars. It is where simulive and evergreen webinars get their content, where finished live sessions end up, and where your storage allowance is spent. Keeping it in one place means a video added once can be used by any webinar that needs it."},"2896":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#how-it-helps","content":"**One place for every recording.** Live sessions with recording on land in **Recordings** without any exporting or uploading."},"2897":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#how-it-helps","content":"**Live sessions become reusable content.** A recording can be picked as the video for a simulive or evergreen webinar."},"2898":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#how-it-helps","content":"**Storage is visible.** The allowance at the top of each tab, and the badge on each video, show what is and isn't using it."},"2899":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#how-it-helps","content":"**Safer deletions.** The host badge tells you whether a video depends on another platform before you remove anything."},"2900":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#without-it","content":"Without a shared library, every recorded webinar would need its video uploaded again, and recordings of live sessions would have to be downloaded and re-added before you could reuse them. It would also be harder to tell which videos sit on YouTube or another platform, which is how a webinar ends up playing a video someone has since deleted elsewhere."},"2901":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#why-buyers-care","content":"Teams that plan to run recorded webinars want to know where the video lives, whether they need a separate video host, and how storage is counted. In EasyWebinar the answers sit in one screen: EasyWebinar can host the file itself, imported links use no storage, and live recordings arrive in the same place ready to reuse."},"2902":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-video-hosting","content":"**Add Media** is where you choose between hosting a video on EasyWebinar and importing it from YouTube, Vimeo, Wistia or a direct MP4 link. The choice decides whether the video uses your storage. See Video hosting."},"2903":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-live-room","content":"The live room's header shows **Auto Recording Enabled** when recording is on, and the badge changes to **Recording** once you're live. Recording can be changed under **Settings → Recording Settings**, and recorded sessions land in **Library → Recordings**. See Run a live webinar."},"2904":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-cloning","content":"A webinar's type can't be changed, so the route from live to automated is cloning. Clone the live webinar, choose **Evergreen** for the copy, and pick the live session's recording on the new webinar's **Content** tab. The recording is already in your library. See Clone a webinar."},"2905":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-recorded-webinars","content":"Both types play a recording, and both choose it from the library on the **Video Selection** step. See Create a simulive webinar and Create an evergreen webinar."},"2906":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-plan","content":"Under **Settings** → **Manage Plan**, the **Plan** tab has a **Storage** meter for space used by your videos and recordings, with **Buy More**, and the **Add-ons** tab offers **Additional Storage (5GB)**. Both are covered in Your plan, billing and add-ons."},"2907":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#with-ai-moderator","content":"The AI Moderator's knowledge base documents live on the **Files** tab. Because the moderator retrains with each new source, give it a moment after an upload before you test it."},"2908":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the Library fits different kinds of work."},"2909":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#course-creators","content":"A creator runs a launch webinar live with recording on. Afterwards, the session sits in **Recordings**, and the creator clones the webinar as evergreen and picks that recording, so the version that sold well live keeps running. See selling online courses with webinars."},"2910":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#product-teams","content":"A product team uploads its demo with **Local import** rather than publishing it on YouTube, so the video stays private to the webinar. The **EasyWebinar** badge confirms where it is hosted, and the storage meter shows the space it takes."},"2911":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#agencies","content":"An agency managing webinars that play videos from a client's YouTube channel checks the badges on the **Videos** tab before the client tidies up their channel, because removing a YouTube video breaks the webinar that plays it."},"2912":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#customer-success","content":"A customer success team keeps its product FAQ and onboarding guides on the **Files** tab as the AI Moderator's knowledge base (Beta), so questions on an unattended evergreen onboarding webinar can be answered from the team's own documents."},"2913":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"**Only EasyWebinar-hosted files count towards storage.** Imported URLs use none."},"2914":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"**Upload video as MP4, up to 4 GB.** The **Video Selection** screen lists MP4, MOV or WebM, but the **Upload media** dialog says it supports MP4 files only, so upload MP4 to be safe."},"2915":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"**More storage is an add-on.** **Additional Storage (5GB)**, or **Buy More** beside the storage meter."},"2916":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"**Recordings appear only if recording was on.** Recording is on by default; check the room header before you go live."},"2917":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"**Don't delete a video a webinar is using.** The webinar plays it."},"2918":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"**Removing a video on YouTube, Vimeo or Wistia** breaks any webinar that plays the imported link."},"2919":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#limits","content":"**AI Moderator documents** are PDF, DOCX or PPTX, up to 25MB each, and the AI Moderator is in Beta."},"2920":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-recordings","content":"On the **Recordings** tab of the **Library**. Each is named after its webinar, with its duration and recording date."},"2921":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-missing-recording","content":"Recordings are captured when **Auto Recording** is on in the live room. If the header didn't read **Auto Recording Enabled**, the session wasn't recorded."},"2922":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-badge","content":"By the badge on its card: **EasyWebinar**, or the platform's own logo."},"2923":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-imported-storage","content":"No. Only files uploaded to EasyWebinar count towards your storage."},"2924":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-storage","content":"It's shown at the top of every Library tab. More is available with the **Additional Storage (5GB)** add-on or **Buy More**."},"2925":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-recording-evergreen","content":"Yes. Pick it from the **Recordings** tab when choosing the video, or swap it in later from the **Webinar Video** panel."},"2926":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-delete","content":"You shouldn't. The webinar plays that video, so removing it leaves the webinar without its content."},"2927":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-documents","content":"On the **Files** tab. It's also where the AI Moderator (Beta) keeps the documents it answers from."},"2928":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-ai-moderator-files","content":"**PDF, DOCX or PPTX**, up to **25MB** per file. The AI Moderator is in Beta."},"2929":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#faq-rename","content":"Yes. Each video card has a menu for renaming, previewing or removing it."},"2930":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#related","content":"Clone a webinar: the route from a live recording in the Library to an evergreen webinar."},"2931":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#related","content":"Replay pages: another place a recorded session is watched after the event."},"2932":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#related","content":"Webinars overview: which webinar types play a video from the Library."},"2933":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/library#related","content":"Limits and defaults: the Additional Storage add-on alongside the others."},"2934":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","type":"page","content":"Replay pages","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","Videos, recordings and replays"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages"},"2935":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-0","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","content":"Turn on a webinar's replay page, decide how long it stays available, send viewers somewhere when it ends, choose between Webinar Replica and Custom Build, and tell a replay apart from instant replay."},"2936":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages-1","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/replay-pages#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"29