osting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#add-during-setup","content":"|     | Control                       | What it does                                                        |\n| --- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | **All · Videos · Recordings** | Filters between videos you've added and recordings of past webinars |","table":"table-3"},"3152":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#add-during-setup","content":"|     | Control             | What it does          |\n| --- | ------------------- | --------------------- |\n| 2   | **Search and sort** | Finds a video by name |","table":"table-3"},"3153":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#add-during-setup","content":"|     | Control       | What it does                             |\n| --- | ------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **Add Video** | Adds a new one without leaving this step |","table":"table-3"},"3154":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#add-during-setup","content":"|     | Control           | What it does                                    |\n| --- | ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Drag and drop** | Drop a file straight onto the page to upload it |","table":"table-3"},"3155":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#add-during-setup","content"