and click the **Content** tab."},"3162":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#change-video","content":"In the **Webinar Video** panel, click **Preview** to play the current video."},"3163":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#change-video","content":"Click **Change Video** to swap it for another from your library."},"3164":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#change-video","content":"Changing the video doesn't affect the webinar's schedule, pages or registrations, so you can replace a recording with an improved cut while the webinar keeps running."},"3165":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#which-to-choose","content":"| Situation                              | Route            |\n| -------------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| The recording isn't published anywhere | **Local import** |","table":"table-4"},"3166":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#which-to-choose","content":"| Situation                                   | Route            |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| You want the webinar recording kept private | **Local import** |","table":"table-4"},"3167":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#which-to-choose","content":"| Situation                                        | Route               |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------- |\n| The video is already on YouTube, Vimeo or Wistia | **Import from URL** |","table":"table-4"},"3168":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#which-to-choose","content":"| Situation                                     | Route               |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| You want to keep storage free for other files | **Import from URL** |","table":"table-4"},"3169":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#which-to-choose","content":"| Situation                     | Route                                      |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| The file is a direct MP4 link | **Import from URL**, platform **MP4 link** |","table":"table-4"},"3170":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#which-to-choose","content":"Hosting on EasyWebinar is the simpler route for a webinar recording you don't want public. Importing is the quicker route when the video already lives on a platform you control."},"3171":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#with-library","content":"Every video you add, by either route, appears on the Library's **Videos** tab with a badge in its corner: **EasyWebinar** for a hosted file, or the platform's logo for an imported link. Recordings of live sessions appear on the **Recordings** tab."},"3172":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#with-recorded-webinars","content":"Both types play a video from your library. Simulive plays it at times you set, so everyone in a session watches together; evergreen runs continuously and lets each registrant pick a time."},"3173":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#with-cloning","content":"A live session recorded with **Auto Recording** on lands in **Library → Recordings**, already hosted on EasyWebinar. To run it as an automated webinar, clone the live webinar, choose **Evergreen** or **Simulive** for the copy, and pick the recording. See Clone a webinar and Run a live webinar."},"3174":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#with-plan","content":"Hosted videos and recordings count towards your storage, metered on the **Plan** tab under **Settings** → **Manage Plan**, with **Buy More**. **Additional Storage (5GB)** is available as an add-on. See storage and upload limits."},"3175":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how each route fits different kinds of webinar."},"3176":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#product-teams","content":"A product team records a demo for an evergreen webinar and uploads it with **Local import**. The demo isn't published anywhere else, and hosting it on EasyWebinar keeps it private to the webinar."},"3177":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#course-creators","content":"A creator already has a teaching video on YouTube. They import it with **Import from URL**, enter its exact duration, and use no storage. Later they replace it with a recording of a live session through the **Webinar Video** panel. See selling online courses with webinars."},"3178":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#agencies","content":"An agency builds automated webinars from videos its clients keep on Vimeo or Wistia. Importing the links leaves the files where the clients manage them, and the platform badge in the Library shows which videos depend on an outside host."},"3179":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#small-businesses","content":"A solo consultant without a video platform account records a training, uploads it with **Local import**, and runs it as a simulive webinar. Nothing outside EasyWebinar is needed."},"3180":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#limits","content":"**Upload MP4, up to 4 GB.** The **Video Selection** screen lists MP4, MOV or WebM, but the **Upload media** dialog says it supports MP4 files only, so upload MP4 to be safe."},"3181":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#limits","content":"**Imports come from four sources:** **YouTube**, **Vimeo**, **Wistia** or a direct **MP4 link**."},"3182":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#limits","content":"**Imported videos need their duration entered.** EasyWebinar reads the length automatically only for uploaded files."},"3183":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#limits","content":"**Hosted files count towards storage; imported links don't.**"},"3184":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#limits","content":"**Imported videos depend on the other platform.** Removing a YouTube video breaks the webinar that plays it."},"3185":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#limits","content":"**A YouTube video stays discoverable** unless you've unlisted it on YouTube."},"3186":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#limits","content":"**Live webinars don't need a video.** Simulive and evergreen webinars are the types that play one."},"3187":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#limits","content":"**Changing the video later** doesn't affect the schedule, pages or registrations."},"3188":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#faq-need-host","content":"EasyWebinar hosts them. **Local import** uploads your file and serves it, with no other video host involved. Importing from a URL is an option, not a requirement."},"3189":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#faq-platforms","content":"**YouTube**, **Vimeo**, **Wistia**, or a direct **MP4 link**."},"3190":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#faq-formats","content":"**MP4**, up to **4 GB** per file. The **Video Selection** screen lists MP4, MOV or WebM, but the **Upload media** dialog says it supports MP4 files only, so upload MP4 to be safe."},"3191":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#faq-duration","content":"EasyWebinar reads the length of an uploaded file automatically, but not of one hosted elsewhere. It needs the duration to schedule sessions correctly."},"3192":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#faq-storage","content":"No. Only files uploaded to EasyWebinar count towards your storage."},"3193":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#faq-allowance","content":"It's shown at the top of the Library. More is available with **Additional Storage (5GB)** or **Buy More**."},"3194":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#faq-past-recording","content":"Yes. It's on the **Recordings** tab, and you can pick it when setting up a simulive or evergreen webinar."},"3195":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#faq-change-video","content":"Yes, from the **Webinar Video** panel on that webinar's **Content** tab. The schedule, pages and registrations are unaffected."},"3196":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#faq-during-setup","content":"Yes. **Add Video** on the **Video Selection** step offers both routes, and you can drop a file straight onto the page."},"3197":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#faq-youtube-private","content":"It's still a YouTube video, discoverable unless you've unlisted it. Host it on EasyWebinar with **Local import** if you want it kept private."},"3198":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#related","content":"Webinars overview: which of the three webinar types play a video and which don't."},"3199":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#related","content":"Clone a webinar: turn a hosted live recording into a simulive or evergreen webinar."},"3200":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#related","content":"Paid webinars: the pricing step that comes just before Video Selection."},"3201":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/media/video-hosting#related","content":"Replay pages: where a live session's recording is watched after the event."},"3202":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","type":"page","content":"Registration confirmation emails","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","Emails and notifications"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails"},"3203":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-0","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","content":"The email EasyWebinar sends the moment someone registers, carrying their join link, and the Email Settings that control the sender name, reply-to address and admin copies."},"3204":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-1","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"3205":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-2","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#what-it-is","content":"What a registration co