onfirmation off?"},"3234":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-31","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-edit","content":"Can I change what the confirmation says?"},"3235":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-32","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-sender","content":"How do I change who the emails come from?"},"3236":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-33","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-replies","content":"Where do replies to the confirmation go?"},"3237":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-34","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-notify-admin","content":"Can I get told when someone registers?"},"3238":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-35","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-ai","content":"Does a webinar built with AI have a confirmation email?"},"3239":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-36","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-sms-whatsapp","content":"Can registrants get a text or WhatsApp confirmation too?"},"3240":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-37","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-none-received","content":"Why did nobody receive a confirmation?"},"3241":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-38","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-thank-you-page","content":"Is the confirmation the same as the thank-you page?"},"3242":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-39","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#related","content":"Related"},"3243":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","content":"The **Registration Confirmation** email is the first message a new registrant gets from your webinar. EasyWebinar sends it immediately after someone registers, and it carries their attendee join link, which makes it the email that actually gets people into the session. It sits on the webinar's **Notifications** tab, and the **Email Settings** button on the same screen decides whose name your emails show, where replies go, and whether an admin address receives a copy of each registration."},"3244":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                |                                                      |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it is** | The email each registrant receives when they sign up |","table":"table-0"},"3245":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                     |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **When it sends** | Immediately after someone registers |","table":"table-0"},"3246":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                |\n| ------------------- | -------------- |\n| **Who receives it** | The registrant |","table":"table-0"},"3247":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                            |\n| ------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| **What it carries** | The registrant's join link |","table":"table-0"},"3248":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                          |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Where you set it** | Webinar → **Notifications** → **Emails** → **Registration Confirmation** |","table":"table-0"},"3249":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                         |                                          |\n| ----------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **What you can change** | The subject and the content of the email |","table":"table-0"},"3250":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                                                    |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Sender settings** | **Sender name**, **Reply-to email** and **Notify admin**, under **Email Settings** |","table":"table-0"},"3251":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|           |                                                |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| **Scope** | Per webinar: each webinar keeps its own emails |","table":"table-0"},"3252":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                                         |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **On AI-built webinars** | A welcome email sent on registration is drafted for you |","table":"table-0"},"3253":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#what-it-is","content":"Every webinar's **Notifications** tab has three channels: **Emails**, **SMS** and **Whatsapp**. SMS and WhatsApp are in Beta. The **Emails** channel groups everything your webinar sends into five kinds of email:"},"3254":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#what-it-is","content":"| Email group                   | When it sends                       |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **Registration Confirmation** | Immediately after someone registers |","table":"table-1"},"3255":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#what-it-is","content":"| Email group           | When it sends             |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| **Webinar Reminders** | Before the webinar starts |","table":"table-1"},"3256":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#what-it-is","content":"| Email group            | When it sends                                            |\n| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar Follow-ups** | After the webinar, to registrants, attendees or no-shows |","table":"table-1"},"3257":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#what-it-is","content":"| Email group                    | When it sends                                                  |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Attendee Action Follow-ups** | Based on what someone did, such as engagement and offer clicks |","table":"table-1"},"3258":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#what-it-is","content":"| Email group                          | When it sends               |\n| ------------------------------------ | --------------------------- |\n| **Paid Offer — Transaction Success** | After a successful purchase |","table":"table-1"},"3259":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#what-it-is","content":"The confirmation is the only one of the five tied to the moment of sign-up. Reminders count down to the session, follow-ups react to what happened in it, and the transaction email answers a purchase. The confirmation answers a registration."},"3260":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#what-it-is","content":"It is a different thing from the **Thank you Page**. The thank-you page is what the browser shows straight after registering, with confirmation and what happens next. The email is what stays in the registrant's inbox after they have closed that tab, and it is where they go looking for the link on the day."},"3261":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#what-its-for","content":"The confirmation does two jobs at once. It tells the registrant that signing up worked, and it hands them the join link they will need later. EasyWebinar's own guidance calls it the one email you shouldn't turn off, because every other step of getting someone into the room depends on them having that link."},"3262":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#how-it-helps","content":"**It arrives at the moment of highest interest.** The email lands seconds after someone chose to register, while the webinar is still on their mind."},"3263":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#how-it-helps","content":"**It gives the join link a permanent home.** The registrant can search their inbox for it instead of trying to find your registration page again."},"3264":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#how-it-helps","content":"**It sets the sender relationship early.** The **Sender name** a registrant sees here is the one they will see on every reminder, so the first email teaches them who to look out for."},"3265":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#how-it-helps","content":"**It opens a reply channel.** Because the **Reply-to email** is an address you choose, a registrant with a question can simply reply."},"3266":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#without-it","content":"A registrant without a confirmation has only what they saw on the thank-you page. If they closed it, or registered on a phone between other tasks, they may have nothing to come back to. They can still receive reminders, but the first email they see from you then arrives days later from a name they don't connect with signing up, which is easy to ignore."},"3267":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#why-buyers-care","content":"Registrations only turn into attendance, and attendance into revenue, if people can find their way into the session. Teams comparing webinar platforms look at whether the confirmation is automatic, whether the sender can be set to their own name, and whether replies reach a real inbox. In EasyWebinar all three are settings on one tab of each webinar."},"3268":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#open-notifications","content":"Open your webinar and click the **Notifications** tab. The **Emails** channel opens first."},"3269":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#open-notifications","content":"*1 Channel tabs · 2 Email Settings · 3 An email group · 4 Create New.*"},"3270":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#open-notifications","content":"|     | Area             | What it does             |\n| --- | ---------------- | ------------------------ |\n| 1   | **Channel tabs** | Emails, SMS and Whatsapp |","table":"table-2"},"3271":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#open-notifications","content":"|     | Area               | What it does                                   |\n| --- | ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 2   | **Email Settings** | Sender name, reply-to address and admin copies |","table":"table-2"},"3272":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#open-notifications","content":"|     | Area               | What it does                      |\n| --- | ------------------ | --------------------------------- |\n| 3   | **An email group** | Its trigger, audience and subject |","table":"table-2"},"3273":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#open-notifications","content":"|     | Area           | What it does                     |\n| --- | -------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| 4   | **Create New** | Adds another email to that group |","table":"table-2"},"3274":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#review-confirmation","content":"Find the **Registration Confirmation** group at the top of the list."},"3275":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#review-confirmation","content":"Read the entry. Each one shows its **trigger**, the audience it goes **to**, and its **subject** line, so you can check what it does without opening it."},"3276":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#review-confirmation","content":"Open the email to change its subject and content. Every email on the tab is editable in the same way."},"3277":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#review-confirmation","content":"Keep the join link in the body. It is the reason the email exists."},"3278":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#review-confirmation","content":"A webinar built with **Create with AI** arrives with its emails already written, starting with a welcome email sent on registration. Those AI drafts come with merge tags already in place, so dates, times and join links fill themselves in. Read the wording before you publish, and edit it like any other email."},"3279":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#email-settings","content":"On the **Emails** channel, click **Email Settings**."},"3280":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#email-settings","content":"Enter a **Sender name**."},"3281":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#email-settings","content":"Enter a **Reply-to email**."},"3282":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#email-settings","content":"Turn on **Notify admin** if you want a copy of each registration sent to an admin address, and give it that address."},"3283":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#email-settings","content":"Save your changes."},"3284":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#email-settings","content":"| Setting         | What it does                           | What to put in it                                          |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Sender name** | The name recipients see in their inbox | Your name or your company's, so a registrant recognises it |","table":"table-3"},"3285":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#email-settings","content":"| Setting            | What it does     | What to put in it                                                             |\n| ------------------ | ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Reply-to email** | Where replies go | An address somebody actually reads, because people do reply to webinar emails |","table":"table-3"},"3286":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#email-settings","content":"| Setting          | What it does                                      | What to put in it                                                           |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Notify admin** | Sends a copy of registrations to an admin address | A shared or personal inbox for whoever needs to see sign-ups as they happen |","table":"table-3"},"3287":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#publish-registration-page","content":"A confirmation only goes out when someone registers, and your registration link doesn't work until the registration page is published. Saving the page alone isn't enough. Open the **Registration Page** from the **Content** tab and click **Publish** before you promote the link. See Registration page builder."},"3288":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#with-reminders","content":"The confirmation starts the email sequence and **Webinar Reminders** carry it to the session. Reminders share the same **Email Settings**, so the sender a registrant learns from the confirmation is the one they see again before the webinar. See Reminder emails."},"3289":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#with-thank-you-page","content":"The **Thank you Page** is one of the five pages on the **Content** tab and appears straight after registering. On a paid webinar, it shows the attendee's **Webinar join link** with a **Join Room** button, and the session **Date** with **Add to Calendar** buttons for Google, Outlook and Apple. The page and the email cover the same moment from two sides: one in the browser, one in the inbox."},"3290":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#with-sms-whatsapp","content":"Both Beta channels have their own message for the moment of registration: **Welcome SMS** on the **SMS** tab and **Welcome Message** on the **Whatsapp** tab, each sent immediately after someone registers. They need a phone number, so the **Phone** field has to be on your registration form, and they come from an EasyWebinar number rather than your own. Both work alongside email rather than replacing it."},"3291":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#with-create-with-ai","content":"The emails step of **Create with AI** drafts a full email sequence, beginning with a welcome email on registration and followed by reminders and follow-ups. After the build, the emails sit on the **Notifications** tab like any others. See Create a webinar with AI."},"3292":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#with-paid-registration","content":"On a paid webinar, the attendee is registered once payment goes through and is then sent to your thank-you page. Purchases of an offer inside the webinar have their own email, **Paid Offer — Transaction Success**, the receipt-style confirmation for anyone who bought. See Paid webinars."},"3293":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#with-crm","content":"A connected CRM or email tool can act on the same moment through the **Registered** event, for example tagging every new registrant. On the **Custom fields** side, the **Webinar Join Link** can be mapped into a CRM field so each contact holds their own working link. See Connect a CRM and map your webinar data."},"3294":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#with-cloning","content":"When you clone a webinar, **Email notifications** is one of the items you can bring across, in the **Engagement** group with polls and offers. A copied confirmation keeps your wording and sender choices, so check it still names the right webinar. See Clone a webinar."},"3295":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#with-analytics","content":"The **Registered** metric in a webinar's Analytics counts unique sign-ups, which is the number of people your confirmation should have reached. The **People** view lists each registrant with a **Registered on** column. See Webinar analytics and People."},"3296":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the confirmation fits different kinds of webinar."},"3297":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#coaches","content":"A coach sets the **Sender name** to their own name and the **Reply-to email** to the inbox they check every day. Registrants often reply to the confirmation with a question about the session, and that reply becomes the first real conversation with a prospect."},"3298":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team running a webinar for pipeline turns on **Notify admin** and points it at a team address, so sales can see registrations as they arrive. In the connected CRM, the **Registered** event tags each new contact for the campaign."},"3299":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#agencies","content":"An agency running webinars for several clients sets each webinar's **Sender name** to the client's company and the **Reply-to email** to the client's own address. Because the settings are held per webinar, each client's registrants hear from the client, not the agency."},"3300":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#course-creators","content":"A course creator uses **Create with AI** to draft the sequence, then rewrites the welcome email in their own voice and sets the sender to a name their students already know. See selling online courses with webinars."},"3301":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#limits","content":"**Emails are set per webinar.** Each webinar has its own confirmation and its own **Email Settings**; cloning is how you carry them to a new webinar."},"3302":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#limits","content":"**The sender name is a display name.** Replies go to the **Reply-to email** you set."},"3303":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#limits","content":"**Notify admin needs an address.** It sends a copy of registrations to the admin address you give it."},"3304":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#limits","content":"**The registration page must be published.** Until it is, the registration link doesn't work and no confirmations go out."},"3305":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#limits","content":"**Merge tags come pre-filled on AI-built emails.** If you rewrite an AI draft, keep the tags that carry the date, time and join link."},"3306":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#limits","content":"**SMS and WhatsApp welcome messages are in Beta** and need the **Phone** field on your registration form."},"3307":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-when-sent","content":"Immediately after someone registers. The entry on the **Notifications** tab shows this as its trigger."},"3308":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-turn-off","content":"It's the email that carries the join link, so EasyWebinar's guidance is to keep it on. Without it, a registrant who closes the thank-you page has no copy of their link in their inbox."},"3309":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-edit","content":"Yes. Open the email on the **Notifications** tab to change its subject and content."},"3310":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-sender","content":"Click **Email Settings** on the **Emails** channel and set the **Sender name** and **Reply-to email**."},"3311":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-replies","content":"To the **Reply-to email** in **Email Settings**. Use an address someone reads, because people do reply."},"3312":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-notify-admin","content":"Yes. Turn on **Notify admin** in **Email Settings** and give it an address. It sends a copy of registrations there."},"3313":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-ai","content":"Yes. **Create with AI** drafts a welcome email sent on registration, with merge tags for dates, times and join links already in place. Edit it on the **Notifications** tab."},"3314":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-sms-whatsapp","content":"Both are in Beta: **Welcome SMS** and the WhatsApp **Welcome Message** send immediately after someone registers. Each needs the **Phone** field on your registration form."},"3315":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-none-received","content":"Check the registration page is published. The registration link doesn't work until you click **Publish**, so nobody can register and no confirmation is sent."},"3316":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#faq-thank-you-page","content":"No. The **Thank you Page** shows in the browser straight after registering. The confirmation is the email that stays in the registrant's inbox."},"3317":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#related","content":"Reminder emails: the emails that follow the confirmation, using the same Email Settings."},"3318":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#related","content":"Registration page builder: publish the page, or no confirmations go out."},"3319":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#related","content":"Create a webinar with AI: drafts the welcome email with its merge tags in place."},"3320":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#related","content":"Paid webinars: registration happens only after payment, so that is when the confirmation sends."},"3321":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#related","content":"Clone a webinar: carry the confirmation and sender settings to a new webinar."},"3322":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#related","content":"Connect a CRM and map your webinar data: act on the Registered event and store each join link."},"3323":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/confirmation-emails#related","content":"People: check who registered and when."},"3324":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/notifications/reminder-emails","type":"page","content":"Webinar reminder emails","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","Emails and notifications"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/n