ds#faq-default-fields","content":"What does the registration form ask by default?"},"3587":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-28","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-phone","content":"Can I collect a phone number?"},"3588":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-29","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-own-questions","content":"Can I add my own questions?"},"3589":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-30","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-consent","content":"How do I ask for marketing consent?"},"3590":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-31","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-campaign","content":"How do I see which campaign a registrant came from?"},"3591":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-32","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-utm-empty","content":"Why is my Source & UTM filter empty?"},"3592":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-33","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-phone-crm","content":"Can I send the phone number to my CRM?"},"3593":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-34","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-no-sms","content":"Why can't I send text reminders?"},"3594":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-35","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-export","content":"Can I export what people entered?"},"3595":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-36","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-publish","content":"Do I need to publish after changing the form?"},"3596":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-37","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#related","content":"Related"},"3597":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-38","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","content":"An EasyWebinar registration form starts with two required fields, **Full name** and **Email**. Select the form block in the page builder and you can add a **Phone** field, add your own custom fields, turn on a **GDPR Compliance** consent checkbox, and turn on **UTM Params** so each registration records the campaign that brought it in. What you collect then shows up in the **People** view and can be mapped into a connected CRM."},"3598":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-39","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                                   |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you set it** | Webinar → **Content** → **Edit** on **Registration Page** → select the form block |","table":"table-0"},"3599":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                            |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Default fields** | **Full name** and **Email**, both required |","table":"table-0"},"3600":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                         |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Extra fields** | A **Phone** field, and your own custom fields with **Add Custom Field** |","table":"table-0"},"3601":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|             |                                                                                      |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Consent** | **GDPR Compliance** adds a consent checkbox you word yourself and can make mandatory |","table":"table-0"},"3602":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                              |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Campaign capture** | **UTM Params** records the campaign behind each registration |","table":"table-0"},"3603":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|            |                                   |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Button** | The submit button can be restyled |","table":"table-0"},"3604":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                                                                                                            |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where the data shows** | **People** view (including the **Phone** column and the **Source & UTM** filter), **Export**, and CRM custom-field mapping |","table":"table-0"},"3605":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                                            |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar types** | Live, simulive and evergreen; the form block is on every registration page |","table":"table-0"},"3606":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-it-is","content":"The registration form is a block on the registration page, like the countdown or a heading. Its settings decide what a person is asked when they sign up. Out of the box it asks for a name and an email address, both required."},"3607":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-it-is","content":"The form block's settings add four things on top of that:"},"3608":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-it-is","content":"| Option    | What it adds         |\n| --------- | -------------------- |\n| **Phone** | A phone number field |","table":"table-1"},"3609":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-it-is","content":"| Option            | What it adds                                     |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Custom fields** | Your own questions, for anything you need to ask |","table":"table-1"},"3610":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-it-is","content":"| Option              | What it adds                                                                          |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **GDPR Compliance** | A consent checkbox, with wording you write and an option to make ticking it mandatory |","table":"table-1"},"3611":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-it-is","content":"| Option         | What it adds                                                                        |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **UTM Params** | Campaign capture: each registration records which tagged link brought the person in |","table":"table-1"},"3612":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-it-is","content":"You can also restyle the form's submit button from the same place."},"3613":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#what-its-for","content":"Custom fields let the registration form collect what your follow-up actually needs. A phone number for text reminders, a question that tells you who is in the audience, a record of consent for marketing, and the campaign each person came from."},"3614":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#how-it-helps","content":"**It makes text reminders possible.** SMS and WhatsApp reminders (both in Beta) go to the number someone gave you, so they depend on the **Phone** field."},"3615":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#how-it-helps","content":"**It tells you who registered, not just how many.** A custom question gives you context before the session starts."},"3616":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#how-it-helps","content":"**It puts consent on the form.** **GDPR Compliance** adds the checkbox with your own wording, so you don't need a separate consent step."},"3617":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#how-it-helps","content":"**It shows which campaign worked.** With **UTM Params** on, you can filter registrants by **Source & UTM** in the People view."},"3618":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#how-it-helps","content":"**It feeds your CRM.** The phone number can be mapped into a CRM field of your choice."},"3619":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#without-it","content":"With only name and email, you know how many people registered but very little else. You can't text anyone, and you can't tell which ad, email or post sent them. UTM capture is the option people most often miss: without it, the registration count goes up and the reason why is lost."},"3620":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#why-buyers-care","content":"For teams that run webinars to generate leads or sell, the registration form is where first-party data starts. Buyers check whether they can add their own questions, collect phone numbers for reminders, ask for consent on the form itself, and attribute each registrant to a campaign without a separate tool."},"3621":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Open your webinar and click the **Content** tab."},"3622":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Click **Edit** on the **Registration Page** card. The page opens in the builder."},"3623":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Click the form block on the canvas. An orange toolbar appears above it, and the settings panel on the right fills with the form's options across **Settings** and **Advanced** tabs."},"3624":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Add the **Phone** field if you'll want to text people or keep their number."},"3625":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Click **Add Custom Field** for each extra question you want to ask."},"3626":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Turn on **GDPR Compliance** if you ask for marketing consent. Write the consent wording, and choose whether ticking it is mandatory."},"3627":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Turn on **UTM Params** to record the campaign behind each registration."},"3628":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Restyle the submit button if it needs to match your page."},"3629":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Use the device toggle to check the form on mobile, then **Preview**, **Save** and **Publish**."},"3630":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"*The default form, with **Full name** and **Email**, as it appears when a new webinar opens in the builder.*"},"3631":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#set-up-the-form","content":"Form changes reach visitors only once the page is published. **Save** keeps a draft; **Publish** makes it public."},"3632":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#utm-capture","content":"**UTM Params** is a switch on the form block. Once it's on, each registration records the campaign that brought it in."},"3633":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#utm-capture","content":"Turn on **UTM Params** on the form block and publish the page."},"3634":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#utm-capture","content":"Tag the links you share as you normally would, in ads, emails and posts."},"3635":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#utm-capture","content":"Open **People** in the sidebar, click **Add Filter**, and choose **Source & UTM** to see which campaign each registrant came from."},"3636":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#utm-capture","content":"*1 Categories · 2 Refinements · 3 Apply Filter.*"},"3637":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#utm-capture","content":"Because People also shows who attended, this gives you campaign attribution against real attendance, not just clicks. If you also use ad pixels, they tell your ad platform what happened; UTM capture shows the same story inside EasyWebinar."},"3638":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#gdpr-consent","content":"Turning on **GDPR Compliance** on the form block adds a consent checkbox to your form."},"3639":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#gdpr-consent","content":"**Write the wording yourself.** Say what the person is agreeing to, in your own words."},"3640":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#gdpr-consent","content":"**Make it mandatory if you need to.** You can require the box to be ticked before someone can register."},"3641":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#gdpr-consent","content":"The checkbox is a form option. What it asks for, and how you use the data afterwards, is yours to decide."},"3642":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-people-view","content":"**People** in the sidebar lists every registrant and attendee across all your webinars, one row per person per webinar. Columns include **Name** and email, **Phone** (if you collected it), the webinar and its type, the session, and when they registered. Use **Columns** to choose what appears."},"3643":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-people-view","content":"| To find                  | Use                                                               |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Who came from a campaign | **Add Filter** → **Source & UTM** (needs UTM capture on the form) |","table":"table-2"},"3644":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-people-view","content":"| To find                     | Use                          |\n| --------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| Registrants for one webinar | **Add Filter** → **Webinar** |","table":"table-2"},"3645":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-people-view","content":"| To find                       | Use                           |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| A list to work with elsewhere | Filter first, then **Export** |","table":"table-2"},"3646":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-people-view","content":"**Export** downloads the filtered list."},"3647":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"A connected CRM or email tool has a **Custom fields** tab that sends webinar details into your CRM's own fields. The data it lists is:"},"3648":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"| Webinar data      | What it's for                        |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **Webinar Title** | Which webinar this contact came from |","table":"table-3"},"3649":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"| Webinar data          | What it's for                     |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Webinar Join Link** | The attendee's personal join link |","table":"table-3"},"3650":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"| Webinar data                | What it's for       |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Webinar Join Short Link** | A shortened version |","table":"table-3"},"3651":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"| Webinar data            | What it's for     |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------- |\n| **Webinar Replay Link** | Their replay link |","table":"table-3"},"3652":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"| Webinar data                  | What it's for       |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **Webinar Replay Short Link** | A shortened version |","table":"table-3"},"3653":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"| Webinar data     | What it's for             |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------- |\n| **Phone Number** | Their phone, if collected |","table":"table-3"},"3654":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-your-crm","content":"Pick the matching CRM field beside each item. The field must already exist in your CRM; after creating one there, click **Refresh**. Integrations are set per webinar."},"3655":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#in-text-reminders","content":"SMS and WhatsApp notifications, both in Beta, are set on the **Notifications** tab and go to the phone number from your registration form. Without the **Phone** field on the form, there's nobody to message. Reminder emails cover the email side."},"3656":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#with-page-builder","content":"The form is one block on the registration page. Everything else on the page, from the template to the countdown and page-wide settings, is covered in Registration page builder."},"3657":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#with-tracking","content":"UTM capture and ad pixels answer different questions. Pixels go in **Tracking Code** on the webinar's **Settings** tab and report to your ad platform. **UTM Params** keeps the campaign with the registrant inside EasyWebinar."},"3658":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#with-analytics","content":"The webinar's **Analytics** tab counts visitors and registrations. The People view's **Source & UTM** filter shows which campaign produced attendees, not just registrations."},"3659":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#with-cloning","content":"Cloning a webinar can copy its registration pages, so a form you've set up once can carry into the copy."},"3660":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the form options fit different kinds of webinar."},"3661":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#course-creators","content":"A course creator adds a custom field asking for the student's current level, so the pitch at the end can speak to beginners and advanced students differently. **UTM Params** shows which posts and emails filled the session."},"3662":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team runs paid ads to a webinar. It turns on **UTM Params**, tags each ad, and filters **People** by **Source & UTM** after the session to compare campaigns by who actually attended. The phone number is mapped into the CRM so sales has it."},"3663":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#coaches","content":"A coach adds the **Phone** field so the final reminder can go by text (Beta), and turns on **GDPR Compliance** with a mandatory checkbox agreeing to follow-up emails."},"3664":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#agencies","content":"An agency running webinars for clients sets the consent wording to each client's own policy and exports the filtered registrant list for the client after each session."},"3665":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#limits","content":"**Full name and Email come first, both required.** Phone, custom fields, consent and UTM capture are options you add."},"3666":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#limits","content":"**UTM filtering needs UTM capture.** The **Source & UTM** filter depends on **UTM Params** being on in your registration form."},"3667":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#limits","content":"**CRM fields must exist first.** Create the field in your CRM, then click **Refresh** before mapping."},"3668":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#limits","content":"**Text reminders depend on the Phone field.** SMS and WhatsApp are in Beta."},"3669":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#limits","content":"**Nothing changes for visitors until you publish.**"},"3670":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-default-fields","content":"**Full name** and **Email**, both required."},"3671":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-phone","content":"Yes. Select the form block in the page builder and add the **Phone** field."},"3672":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-own-questions","content":"Yes. Use **Add Custom Field** on the form block for anything you need to ask."},"3673":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-consent","content":"Turn on **GDPR Compliance** on the form block. You write the consent wording and can make ticking it mandatory."},"3674":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-campaign","content":"Turn on **UTM Params** on the form, tag your links, then filter **People** by **Source & UTM**."},"3675":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-utm-empty","content":"UTM filtering needs UTM capture turned on in the registration form. Turn on **UTM Params** and tag the links you share."},"3676":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-phone-crm","content":"Yes. On the integration's **Custom fields** tab, map **Phone Number** to a field in your CRM."},"3677":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-no-sms","content":"SMS and WhatsApp (both Beta) go to the phone number from the registration form. Add the **Phone** field first."},"3678":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-export","content":"Yes. Filter the **People** view, then **Export** the list."},"3679":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#faq-publish","content":"Yes. **Save** keeps a draft; the change reaches visitors once you click **Publish**."},"3680":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#related","content":"Registration page builder: the rest of the page around the form block, and how to publish it."},"3681":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#related","content":"Connect a CRM and map your webinar data: send the phone number and join links into your CRM's own fields."},"3682":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#related","content":"Registration embeds: put this same form on your own site."},"3683":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/custom-fields#related","content":"Course creators: where the registration form fits in a full course launch."},"3684":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","type":"page","content":"Registration embeds","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","Registration and pages"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds"},"3685":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-0","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","content":"Put an EasyWebinar registration form on your ow