ation-embeds#saas-teams","content":"SaaS and product teams"},"3707":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-22","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#coaches","content":"Coaches and consultants"},"3708":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-23","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#agencies","content":"Agencies"},"3709":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-24","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"3710":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-25","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"3711":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-26","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-own-website","content":"Can I put the registration form on my own website?"},"3712":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-27","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-where-else","content":"Where else can I find the embed code?"},"3713":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-28","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-customise","content":"Can I change how the widget looks?"},"3714":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-29","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-where-to-paste","content":"Where should I paste it?"},"3715":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-30","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-widget-or-link","content":"Should I use the widget or the registration page link?"},"3716":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-31","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-check-working","content":"How do I check the widget is working?"},"3717":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-32","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-clone","content":"Does cloning a webinar copy its widget?"},"3718":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-33","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-still-need-page","content":"Do I still need a registration page if I use the widget?"},"3719":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-34","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#related","content":"Related"},"3720":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-35","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","content":"The **Registration Widget** lets people register for your webinar without leaving your own website. On the webinar's **Content** tab you copy its **Embed Code** and paste it into your page wherever the form should appear: a landing page, a blog post, a sidebar. The same snippet is in the **Share** dialog, and **View & Customize** lets you change how the widget looks before you copy it."},"3721":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-36","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Puts the webinar's registration form directly on your own site |","table":"table-0"},"3722":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-37","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                                                                            |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where to get it** | Webinar → **Content** → **Registration Widget** → **Embed Code**; also **Share** → **Registration Widget** |","table":"table-0"},"3723":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-38","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| **Change its look** | **View & Customize**, before you copy the code |","table":"table-0"},"3724":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-39","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                              |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where it goes** | Anywhere on your page the form should appear |","table":"table-0"},"3725":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#at-a-glance","content":"|                        |                                        |\n| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **Good places for it** | A landing page, a blog post, a sidebar |","table":"table-0"},"3726":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#at-a-glance","content":"|                                    |                                                                                        |\n| ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Use the page link instead when** | You want EasyWebinar's page to do the selling, or you're sharing in email or on social |","table":"table-0"},"3727":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#at-a-glance","content":"|             |                                                                           |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Cloning** | **Embed widgets** is one of the assets you can copy into a cloned webinar |","table":"table-0"},"3728":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#what-it-is","content":"Every webinar has a registration page hosted by EasyWebinar, and a **Registration Page Link** that sends people to it. The Registration Widget is the other route: instead of sending visitors to EasyWebinar, you bring the form to them, on a page you already control."},"3729":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#what-it-is","content":"|                           | Registration Widget                           | Registration Page Link             |\n| ------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Where people register** | On your own site, in the form you've embedded | On EasyWebinar's registration page |","table":"table-1"},"3730":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#what-it-is","content":"|                    | Registration Widget                               | Registration Page Link |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| **What you share** | Nothing: people find the form where you placed it | A link                 |","table":"table-1"},"3731":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#what-it-is","content":"|           | Registration Widget                 | Registration Page Link                                                   |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Suits** | Landing pages, blog posts, sidebars | Email, social posts, and pages where EasyWebinar's page does the selling |","table":"table-1"},"3732":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#what-it-is","content":"|                      | Registration Widget                                    | Registration Page Link                          |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where you get it** | **Content** tab or **Share** dialog, as **Embed Code** | **Share** dialog, as **Registration Page Link** |","table":"table-1"},"3733":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#what-it-is","content":"Both register people for the same webinar."},"3734":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#what-its-for","content":"The widget is for keeping people on your site. If a visitor is already reading your page, the shortest path to a registration is a form right there, not a link to somewhere new."},"3735":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#how-it-helps","content":"**One less step.** Visitors register where they are instead of clicking through to another page."},"3736":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#how-it-helps","content":"**Your page stays in charge.** The content around the form is yours: your blog post, your landing page, your sidebar."},"3737":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#how-it-helps","content":"**It's the same snippet everywhere.** Copy it once from the Content tab or the Share dialog and paste it into any page."},"3738":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#how-it-helps","content":"**It travels with clones.** When you clone a webinar, you can bring its embed widgets along."},"3739":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#without-it","content":"Without an embed, every visitor on your own site has to follow a link to the EasyWebinar page to register. Each extra click and page load is a chance for someone to get distracted and leave, and the context that persuaded them (the article they were reading, the page they landed on) is left behind."},"3740":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#why-buyers-care","content":"Teams that already run websites and blogs want webinar registration to sit inside the content that brings in traffic. Buyers check whether the platform lets them embed a form, whether they can adjust its look, and whether it's a simple copy-and-paste."},"3741":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#from-content-tab","content":"Open your webinar and click the **Content** tab."},"3742":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#from-content-tab","content":"Scroll to **Registration Widget**, below the five webinar pages."},"3743":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#from-content-tab","content":"If you want to change how the form looks, click **View & Customize** first."},"3744":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#from-content-tab","content":"Copy the **Embed Code**."},"3745":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#from-share-dialog","content":"On the webinar's **Overview**, click **Share**."},"3746":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#from-share-dialog","content":"Choose **Registration Widget** in the dialog."},"3747":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#from-share-dialog","content":"Copy the snippet."},"3748":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#from-share-dialog","content":"*1 Registration Widget · 2 Share on social media · 3 One-Click Registration Link.*"},"3749":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#from-share-dialog","content":"It's the same snippet in both places, so use whichever screen you're on."},"3750":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#add-to-your-site","content":"Open the page on your site where people should register."},"3751":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#add-to-your-site","content":"Paste the embed code wherever the form should appear."},"3752":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#add-to-your-site","content":"Publish the page on your site."},"3753":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#add-to-your-site","content":"Register once yourself through the embedded form."},"3754":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#add-to-your-site","content":"Check the webinar's **Overview**: the **Registrants** stat counts people who completed the registration form, so your test registration should show there."},"3755":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#widget-or-link","content":"| Situation                                                 | Use        |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | ---------- |\n| Someone is already reading your landing page or blog post | The widget |","table":"table-2"},"3756":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#widget-or-link","content":"| Situation                              | Use        |\n| -------------------------------------- | ---------- |\n| You want a form in your site's sidebar | The widget |","table":"table-2"},"3757":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#widget-or-link","content":"| Situation                            | Use                            |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------ |\n| You're sending an email to your list | The **Registration Page Link** |","table":"table-2"},"3758":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#widget-or-link","content":"| Situation                      | Use                                                                              |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| You're posting on social media | The **Registration Page Link**, or **Share on social media** in the Share dialog |","table":"table-2"},"3759":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#widget-or-link","content":"| Situation                                                                     | Use                            |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| You want EasyWebinar's page, with its design and countdown, to do the selling | The **Registration Page Link** |","table":"table-2"},"3760":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#widget-or-link","content":"| Situation                                             | Use                                 |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| You're emailing contacts you already have details for | The **One-Click Registration Link** |","table":"table-2"},"3761":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#widget-or-link","content":"You don't have to choose one. You can use the widget on your own site and the link everywhere else."},"3762":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#with-registration-page","content":"The registration page is still where your webinar's full pitch lives: the design, the countdown, the copy. Build and publish it in the page builder even if most registrations come through the widget, because the link and the page are what you'll use in email and on social."},"3763":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#with-share-links","content":"The Share dialog groups every way to share a webinar: **Share Links**, **Registration Widget** and **Share on social media**."},"3764":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#with-confirmation-emails","content":"**Registration Confirmation** is sent immediately after someone registers, and it carries their join link."},"3765":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#with-people-view","content":"**People** in the sidebar lists every registrant across your webinars. After your test registration, find yourself there to confirm the details came through."},"3766":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#with-cloning","content":"The **Clone Webinar** dialog lists **Embed widgets** under **Webinar assets**, alongside registration pages, the webinar schedule and replay settings. Leave it ticked to copy the widget into the new webinar."},"3767":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the widget fits different kinds of sites."},"3768":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team writes a blog post on the webinar's topic and embeds the registration form at the end, so readers who reach the bottom can sign up on the spot. The **Registration Page Link** goes into the newsletter and paid social."},"3769":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#saas-teams","content":"A product team runs a monthly product webinar and keeps the widget in the sidebar of its help centre or product blog, so customers looking for help can register for the next session without leaving."},"3770":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#coaches","content":"A coach's website has a \"Free masterclass\" page. The registration widget sits on that page, under the coach's own story, so the page they already designed does the persuading."},"3771":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#agencies","content":"An agency builds a client's landing page in the client's site builder and pastes the widget in, so the page stays on the client's domain and in the client's design."},"3772":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#limits","content":"**The widget is a form, not the whole page.** When you want EasyWebinar's page to do the selling, send the registration page link instead."},"3773":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#limits","content":"**Customise first.** Use **View & Customize** to change how the widget looks before you copy the code."},"3774":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#limits","content":"**Copy the code from the right webinar.** The Registration Widget sits on each webinar's own **Content** tab."},"3775":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#limits","content":"**Test it after pasting.** Register once and check **Registrants** on the Overview before you send traffic to the page."},"3776":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-own-website","content":"Yes. Copy the **Embed Code** from **Registration Widget** on the **Content** tab and paste it into your page."},"3777":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-where-else","content":"In the **Share** dialog, under **Registration Widget**. It's the same snippet."},"3778":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-customise","content":"Yes. Click **View & Customize** before you copy the code."},"3779":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-where-to-paste","content":"Wherever the form should appear on your page: a landing page, a blog post or a sidebar."},"3780":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-widget-or-link","content":"Use the widget when you want people to register without leaving your site. Use the link when you want EasyWebinar's page to do the selling, or when you're sharing in email or on social."},"3781":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-check-working","content":"Register once through it, then look at **Registrants** on the webinar's Overview and find yourself in **People**."},"3782":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-clone","content":"It can. **Embed widgets** is one of the assets listed under **Webinar assets** in the clone dialog."},"3783":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#faq-still-need-page","content":"Yes, for anywhere you share a link, such as email and social posts. The **Registration Page Link** only works once the page is published."},"3784":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds#related","content":"Registration page builder: the page your link still needs for email and social."},"3785":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/registration-embeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url"