:[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-backstage","content":"Will my co-presenter appear on screen as soon as they join?"},"3980":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-39","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-shorten","content":"Can I shorten these links?"},"3981":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-40","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-replay-link","content":"Where's the replay link?"},"3982":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-41","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-replay-access","content":"Who can watch my replay?"},"3983":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-42","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-crm-join-link","content":"Can I send each attendee their own join link from my CRM?"},"3984":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-43","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-own-domain","content":"Can my links use my own domain?"},"3985":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-44","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#related","content":"Related"},"3986":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-45","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","content":"Every EasyWebinar webinar generates seven links, and the **Share** button on the webinar's header shows them all in one dialog. One is the public registration link you promote; others let a known contact register in one click, let attendees join, let a co-presenter or moderator into the room, and send people to the replay. The dialog also holds the **Registration Widget** embed code, a **Share on social media** section, and a **Shorten URL's** toggle for shorter versions of every link."},"3987":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-46","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#at-a-glance","content":"| Link                       | Who you send it to                         | Keep it private? |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ---------------- |\n| **Registration Page Link** | Your audience. This is the one you promote | No               |","table":"table-0"},"3988":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-47","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#at-a-glance","content":"| Link                            | Who you send it to                                     | Keep it private?                           |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **One-Click Registration Link** | An existing list; it carries name and email in the URL | Send it only to the contacts it belongs to |","table":"table-0"},"3989":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-48","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#at-a-glance","content":"| Link                   | Who you send it to                              | Keep it private?           |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| **Attendee Join Link** | Registered attendees, to enter the live session | No, it's for your audience |","table":"table-0"},"3990":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-49","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#at-a-glance","content":"| Link                     | Who you send it to                       | Keep it private?           |\n| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| **Attendee Replay link** | People watching the recording afterwards | No, it's for your audience |","table":"table-0"},"3991":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-50","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#at-a-glance","content":"| Link                       | Who you send it to                     | Keep it private? |\n| -------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| **Co-presenter Join Link** | A presenter, so they can join the room | Yes              |","table":"table-0"},"3992":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-51","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#at-a-glance","content":"| Link                                  | Who you send it to                        | Keep it private? |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| **Moderator Join Link for Live room** | A moderator, to handle chat and questions | Yes              |","table":"table-0"},"3993":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-52","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#at-a-glance","content":"| Link                    | Who you send it to                                                 | Keep it private?   |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------ |\n| **Thank You Page Link** | Rarely sent directly: it's where registrants land after signing up | Not usually shared |","table":"table-0"},"3994":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-53","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#what-it-is","content":"The Share dialog is the single place to copy any link a webinar produces. Click **Share** on the webinar's header and the dialog opens with three groups:"},"3995":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-54","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#what-it-is","content":"| Group           | What's in it                       |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Share Links** | The seven links in the table above |","table":"table-1"},"3996":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-55","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#what-it-is","content":"| Group                   | What's in it                                                     |\n| ----------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Registration Widget** | The embed code that puts your registration form on your own site |","table":"table-1"},"3997":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-56","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#what-it-is","content":"| Group                     | What's in it                           |\n| ------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **Share on social media** | Sharing the webinar on social networks |","table":"table-1"},"3998":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-57","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#what-it-is","content":"A **Shorten URL's** toggle gives you shorter versions."},"3999":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-58","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#what-it-is","content":"The links fall into three kinds. **Audience links** (registration, one-click registration, attendee join, attendee replay) are meant for the people watching. **Team links** (co-presenter and moderator) let someone into the room in a role, so they're private. The **Thank You Page Link** is where registrants arrive on their own, so you rarely need it."},"4000":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-59","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#what-its-for","content":"A webinar has more than one audience: people you want to register, people already registered, people who missed it, and the people helping you run it. The Share dialog gives each of them the right door in, from one screen."},"4001":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-60","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#how-it-helps","content":"**No hunting for links.** Every link for the webinar is in one dialog, a click from the Overview."},"4002":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-61","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#how-it-helps","content":"**Guests don't need accounts.** A co-presenter or moderator can join with a link, without an EasyWebinar login."},"4003":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-62","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#how-it-helps","content":"**Known contacts skip the form.** The **One-Click Registration Link** registers someone you already have details for without asking them to type them again."},"4004":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-63","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#how-it-helps","content":"**Shorter links when you need them.** **Shorten URL's** makes links easier to put in a post or a text."},"4005":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-64","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#without-it","content":"Without role-specific links, the only way to bring a guest speaker into the room is to give them access to your account. And without a one-click link, every contact you invite from your own list has to retype details you already hold, which is a reason for some of them not to bother."},"4006":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-65","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#why-buyers-care","content":"Teams that run webinars with guest speakers, moderators and existing customer lists need to give each person the right access quickly and safely. Buyers check whether presenters can join without their own seat on the account, whether existing contacts can register without friction, and whether the replay can be shared as easily as the webinar."},"4007":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-66","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#open-share-dialog","content":"Click **My Webinars** in the sidebar and open the webinar."},"4008":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-67","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#open-share-dialog","content":"On the **Overview** tab, click **Share** on the webinar's header, next to **Registration Page**."},"4009":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-68","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#open-share-dialog","content":"Turn on **Shorten URL's** if you want shorter versions."},"4010":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-69","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#open-share-dialog","content":"Copy the link you need."},"4011":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#open-share-dialog","content":"*1 Registration Widget · 2 Share on social media · 3 One-Click Registration Link.*"},"4012":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#registration-page-link","content":"The public link to your registration page, and the one you promote in ads, emails and posts. It only works once the registration page has been published in the page builder; saving alone isn't enough."},"4013":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#one-click-registration-link","content":"A link for an existing list. It carries the person's name and email in the URL, so a known contact registers without filling in the form. Because it depends on details you already hold, it only works for contacts you already have. Use it in emails to your own list, where you know who each recipient is."},"4014":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#attendee-join-link","content":"For registered attendees, to enter the live session. Registrants also receive a join link in the **Registration Confirmation** email, which is sent the moment someone registers. That's why it's the one email you shouldn't turn off."},"4015":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#attendee-replay-link","content":"For people watching the recording afterwards. It's the same link as the **Replay Page Link** on the webinar's **Replay** tab, where you also turn the replay page on with **Enable replay page**."},"4016":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#attendee-replay-link","content":"*1 Replay Settings · 2 Replay Page Link · 3 Availability · 4 Redirects · 5 Experience.*"},"4017":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#attendee-replay-link","content":"Once the page is enabled it reads *Replay page is live, anyone with the link can watch*, so treat the replay link as public. Replay emails aren't set up here: add a **Webinar Follow-up** on the **Notifications** tab and include the replay link."},"4018":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#co-presenter-join-link","content":"For a presenter, so they can join the room. They don't need an EasyWebinar account to use it. When a co-host or moderator joins a live session, they land backstage, not on stage, and your audience doesn't see or hear them until you move them to the stage."},"4019":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#moderator-join-link","content":"For a moderator, to handle chat and questions. Like the co-presenter link, it works without an account. It's also a handy way to check your own webinar from the inside: on a recorded webinar with an embedded third-party chat, joining with the **Moderator Join Link** lets you look at the side panel."},"4020":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#moderator-join-link","content":"Anyone holding the **Co-presenter Join Link** or the **Moderator Join Link for Live room** can join your room in that role. Send them only to the people who should have them. The registration, attendee and replay links are the ones meant for your audience."},"4021":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#thank-you-page-link","content":"Where registrants land after signing up. You'll rarely send it to anyone, but it's useful for checking the page yourself."},"4022":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#shorten-links","content":"Turn on **Shorten URL's** in the Share dialog to get shorter versions of the links. If you send join and replay links from a connected CRM, the integration's **Custom fields** tab offers short versions there too: **Webinar Join Short Link** and **Webinar Replay Short Link**, alongside the full **Webinar Join Link** and **Webinar Replay Link**."},"4023":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#with-team-and-moderators","content":"The **Team & Moderators** panel on the Overview is the other way to bring people into a webinar: **Add presenter** adds someone who appears on camera and presents, and **Invite** sends an invitation to join the webinar team. A join link suits a guest on one session; adding someone to your account team suits people who work in EasyWebinar regularly."},"4024":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#with-live-room","content":"Inside the room, the **People** panel's **Invite People** shares join links for presenters and moderators, so you can bring someone in after you've entered the green room. See Run a live webinar."},"4025":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#with-registration-widget","content":"The Share dialog's **Registration Widget** holds the same embed snippet as the **Content** tab. Use it to put the form on your own site instead of sharing a link."},"4026":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#with-crm","content":"A connected CRM can receive each attendee's personal join link and replay link through the **Custom fields** tab. Mapping the join link is what lets you send reminders from your CRM instead of EasyWebinar, with each contact getting their own working link."},"4027":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#with-social-sharing","content":"**Social Sharing** on the webinar's **Settings** tab, and **Social Sharing (Open Graph)** in the page builder, control how your link looks when someone shares it."},"4028":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#with-domain","content":"Every public link includes your subdomain, ending in `.easywebinar.live`, including the links in your emails. The **C-Name** add-on lets links use your own domain instead. Changing your subdomain changes your existing links, so anything already shared will break; set it before you promote."},"4029":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#with-expired-session","content":"**Expired Session** on the webinar's **Settings → General** tab sets where people go if their link no longer works. It's empty by default, so fill it in with a page that tells people what to do next."},"4030":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how each link fits a different job."},"4031":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#agencies","content":"An agency runs a webinar for a client whose founder is the speaker. The agency sends the founder the **Co-presenter Join Link** and its own team member the **Moderator Join Link for Live room**. Neither needs a login to the agency's account, and the founder waits backstage until the host brings them on."},"4032":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team promotes the **Registration Page Link** in ads and social posts with **Shorten URL's** on. For an email to existing customers, it uses the **One-Click Registration Link**, so customers register without retyping details the team already holds."},"4033":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#customer-success","content":"A customer success team runs a training webinar for existing customers. It emails the **One-Click Registration Link** to the customer list, then sends the **Attendee Replay link** in a follow-up to everyone who couldn't attend live."},"4034":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#course-creators","content":"A course creator sends no-shows the replay link in a **Webinar Follow-up** after the session, and maps the join link into their email tool so reminders come from their own system."},"4035":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#limits","content":"**The registration link needs a published page.** Publish the registration page before you promote the link."},"4036":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#limits","content":"**The one-click link only works for known contacts.** It carries name and email in the URL."},"4037":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#limits","content":"**Presenter and moderator links grant access.** Anyone holding one can join your room in that role."},"4038":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#limits","content":"**The replay link is public while the replay page is on.** Anyone with it can watch."},"4039":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#limits","content":"**Your subdomain is in every link.** Changing it breaks links you've already sent."},"4040":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#limits","content":"**Integrations are per webinar.** Mapping join and replay links into a CRM is set up on each webinar."},"4041":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-promote","content":"Click **Share** and copy the **Registration Page Link**. That's the public one."},"4042":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-link-broken","content":"The registration page needs to be published. Open it in the page builder and click **Publish**."},"4043":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-one-click","content":"Yes, with the **One-Click Registration Link**. It carries their name and email in the URL, so it only works for contacts you already have."},"4044":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-guest-speaker","content":"Send them the **Co-presenter Join Link** from the Share dialog, or add them under **Team & Moderators** on the Overview."},"4045":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-account-needed","content":"No. Presenters and moderators can join with a link without having an account."},"4046":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-backstage","content":"No. A co-host or moderator who joins lands backstage. Your audience doesn't see or hear them until you move them to the stage."},"4047":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-shorten","content":"Yes. Turn on **Shorten URL's** in the Share dialog."},"4048":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-replay-link","content":"In the Share dialog, as **Attendee Replay link**, and on the **Replay** tab as **Replay Page Link**. Turn on **Enable replay page** first."},"4049":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-replay-access","content":"Anyone with the link, while the replay page is enabled."},"4050":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-crm-join-link","content":"Yes. Map **Webinar Join Link** to a custom field in your CRM on the integration's **Custom fields** tab."},"4051":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#faq-own-domain","content":"Yes, with the **C-Name** add-on and a CNAME record at your DNS provider."},"4052":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#related","content":"The Overview tab: where the **Share** button sits, next to **Registration Page**."},"4053":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#related","content":"Registration embeds: when the Registration Widget suits better than a link."},"4054":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#related","content":"Registration page builder: publish the page so the registration link works."},"4055":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#related","content":"Replay pages: how long the Attendee Replay link stays watchable."},"4056":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#related","content":"Team members: logins for colleagues, as opposed to join links for guests."},"4057":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/registration/sharing-links#related","content":"Connect a CRM and map your webinar data: send each attendee's join and replay links to your CRM."},"4058":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"page","content":"Paid webinars and paid registration","breadcrumbs":["EasyWebinar documentation","Webinars","Selling"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars"},"4059":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-0","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","content":"Charge people to register for a webinar in EasyWebinar, take payment through Stripe, sell a live-plus-replay bundle, and track every paid registration and transaction."},"4060":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-1","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"4061":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-2","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#what-it-is","content":"What paid registration is"},"4062":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-3","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#why-it-matters","content":"Why paid webinars matter"},"4063":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-4","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars#what-its-for","content":"What it's for"},"4064":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars-5","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/selling/paid-webinars","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-do