- |\n| **Registrants** | People who completed the registration form. On a paid webinar, everyone who has registered and paid |","table":"table-2"},"4299":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-70","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#read-the-stats","content":"| Stat              | What it counts                     |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Live Attended** | People who joined the live session |","table":"table-2"},"4300":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-71","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#read-the-stats","content":"| Stat               | What it counts                                                                               |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Total Attended** | Live attendees plus replay viewers, so it is always the larger of the two attendance numbers |","table":"table-2"},"4301":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-72","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#read-the-stats","content":"| Stat        | What it counts                   |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **Revenue** | Money taken through this webinar |","table":"table-2"},"4302":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-73","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#read-the-stats","content":"These are headline numbers. For the full picture, open the **Analytics** tab: it adds **Visitors**, **Replay Watched** and **Missed**, and splits **Total Attended** into **Live only**, **Replay only** and **Both**."},"4303":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-74","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#scheduling-options","content":"**Scheduling Options** summarises when the webinar runs:"},"4304":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-75","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#scheduling-options","content":"| Line          | What it shows                                                                    |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Frequency** | The schedule frequency (**Specific Date**, **Daily** or **Weekly**) and its time |","table":"table-3"},"4305":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-76","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#scheduling-options","content":"| Line           | What it shows            |\n| -------------- | ------------------------ |\n| **Start Date** | When the schedule begins |","table":"table-3"},"4306":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-77","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#scheduling-options","content":"| Line         | What it shows                |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------- |\n| **Timezone** | The timezone sessions run in |","table":"table-3"},"4307":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-78","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#scheduling-options","content":"| Line            | What it shows                                                                                                    |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Preferences** | How many upcoming sessions a registrant can pick from. The default is to display only the next available session |","table":"table-3"},"4308":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-79","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#scheduling-options","content":"To change the date, time or recurrence, open the options menu on the **Scheduling Options** panel. A change made here applies to the whole webinar, not to one sitting."},"4309":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-80","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#evergreen-scheduling","content":"On an evergreen webinar with just-in-time switched on, the timezone line reads **Attendee's local timezone**. That's because a just-in-time session starts shortly after each person registers, in their own local time."},"4310":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-81","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#evergreen-scheduling","content":"*1 Scheduling Options · 2 Sessions, generated from the schedule.*"},"4311":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-82","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#sessions","content":"The **Sessions** panel lists every sitting of the webinar under its own tab:"},"4312":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-83","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#sessions","content":"| Tab          | What it holds                      |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Upcoming** | Sessions scheduled and not yet run |","table":"table-4"},"4313":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-84","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#sessions","content":"| Tab      | What it holds              |\n| -------- | -------------------------- |\n| **Past** | Sessions already broadcast |","table":"table-4"},"4314":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-85","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#sessions","content":"| Tab           | What it holds                                      |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Cancelled** | Sessions that were called off, kept for the record |","table":"table-4"},"4315":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-86","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#sessions","content":"| Tab      | What it holds                                      |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Live** | Evergreen webinars only: sessions currently on air |","table":"table-4"},"4316":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-87","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#sessions","content":"Each row shows the date, time, timezone and registration count for that sitting. A one-time webinar has a single upcoming session. A daily or weekly webinar fills the list from its recurrence, and a daily evergreen schedule generates a long run of upcoming sessions without you adding any."},"4317":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-88","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#sessions","content":"To act on one sitting without touching the rest, use the options menu on that session's row. To change every sitting at once, go back to **Scheduling Options**."},"4318":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-89","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#registration-pricing","content":"**Registration Pricing** shows whether the webinar is **Free** or **Paid**."},"4319":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-90","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#registration-pricing","content":"**On a free webinar** the panel reads \"This webinar is free — attendees register without payment,\" with a **Convert to paid** button."},"4320":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-91","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#registration-pricing","content":"**On a paid webinar** the panel shows your pricing title and price, and the pencil edits them. A **Payment Gateway** panel shows the connected Stripe account, and **Manage** opens your payment settings."},"4321":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-92","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#registration-pricing","content":"*1 Registrants · 2 Revenue · 3 Registration Pricing · 4 Payment Gateway.*"},"4322":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-93","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#registration-pricing","content":"Converting needs a connected Stripe account. But when a free webinar is converted to paid after creation, its registration page keeps the free form, so people can still register without paying. If you want to charge, create a new webinar and choose **Paid** on the pricing step."},"4323":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-94","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#team-and-moderators","content":"**Team & Moderators** shows everyone who can run this webinar. On a new webinar it reads \"No presenters or moderators added yet.\""},"4324":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-95","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#team-and-moderators","content":"**Add presenter** adds someone who appears on camera and presents."},"4325":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-96","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#team-and-moderators","content":"**Invite** sends an invitation to join the webinar team."},"4326":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-97","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#team-and-moderators","content":"You don't have to add everyone here. The **Share** dialog has a **Co-presenter Join Link** and a **Moderator Join Link for Live room**, and a presenter or moderator can join with a link without having an EasyWebinar account at all."},"4327":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-98","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#team-members-vs-presenters","content":"A team member is someone with their own login to your EasyWebinar account, added under **Settings → Team** as an **Admin** or a **User**. A presenter or moderator is someone running a specific webinar, added on that webinar's Overview tab. Add someone to the team when they work in EasyWebinar regularly; send a join link when they're a guest on one session."},"4328":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-99","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#share","content":"Click **Share** to see the seven links the webinar generates, grouped under **Share Links**, **Registration Widget** and **Share on social media**, with a **Shorten URL's** toggle. The one to promote is the **Registration Page Link**. The co-presenter and moderator links let someone into the room in that role, so keep them private."},"4329":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-100","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#share","content":"**Registration Page**, beside **Share**, opens the live registration page so you can see what visitors see."},"4330":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-101","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#enter-room","content":"On a live webinar, **Enter Room** takes you into the webinar room."},"4331":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-102","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#enter-room","content":"Click **Enter Room**."},"4332":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-103","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#enter-room","content":"Check your **camera, microphone and speakers** and pick your devices."},"4333":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-104","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#enter-room","content":"Click **Continue to Green Room**. The button stays greyed out until the room can see a working camera and microphone."},"4334":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-105","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#enter-room","content":"If another webinar is already on air, you'll see \"You can only have one event live at a time.\" Join that one, or go live with the new one."},"4335":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-106","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#enter-recorded-session","content":"A recorded webinar has no live room to enter. On an evergreen webinar, wait for a session to be running: the **Sessions** panel's **Live** tab shows it, marked *Live now*, with **Enter room**."},"4336":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-107","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#enter-recorded-session","content":"*1 The Live tab, showing sessions currently on air · 2 Enter room, which opens the session.*"},"4337":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-108","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#verify-the-result","content":"**The schedule is right.** **Scheduling Options** shows the frequency, start date and timezone you expect, and the **Upcoming** tab lists the sittings you meant to run."},"4338":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-109","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#verify-the-result","content":"**The pricing is right.** **Registration Pricing** shows **Free**, or your pricing title, price and a connected **Payment Gateway**."},"4339":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-110","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#verify-the-result","content":"**The team is in place.** **Team & Moderators** lists your presenters and moderators instead of \"No presenters or moderators added yet.\""},"4340":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-111","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#verify-the-result","content":"**Registrations are counting.** After a test registration, **Registrants** moves off zero and the session row's registration count goes up."},"4341":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-112","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#what-its-for","content":"The Overview tab is the home screen for one webinar. It answers the questions you ask most often (is anyone registering, when does it run, what does it cost, who is presenting, which link do I send) without opening any of the other eight tabs."},"4342":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-113","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#how-it-helps","content":"**One place to check before a session.** Schedule, pricing, team and links sit side by side, so a last check takes seconds."},"4343":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-114","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#how-it-helps","content":"**Session-level control.** You can act on one sitting from its row without rewriting the whole schedule."},"4344":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-115","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#how-it-helps","content":"**Numbers that update as you run.** The stats change as the webinar runs, so you can watch registrations and attendance move."},"4345":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-116","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#how-it-helps","content":"**A straight route into the room.** **Enter Room** is on the same screen as the stats, so going live doesn't mean hunting for a link."},"4346":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-117","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#without-it","content":"Without a single summary screen, the basics of a webinar get scattered. You check the schedule in one place, pricing in another and the presenter list somewhere else, and it's easy to promote a webinar with the wrong date or forget to add a co-presenter until they message you asking for a link."},"4347":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-118","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#why-buyers-care","content":"Anyone running more than one webinar a month needs to see each one's state quickly and hand the right links to the right people. Buyers comparing platforms look at how much it takes to manage a webinar after it's created: changing a date, acting on one sitting, adding a guest speaker, checking revenue."},"4348":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-119","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#with-registration-page","content":"The registration page is built on the **Content** tab and opened from the **Registration Page** button here. The **Registrants** stat counts people who complete its form."},"4349":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-120","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#with-paid-registration","content":"On a paid webinar, **Registrants** counts everyone who has registered and paid, and **Revenue** is the total taken. Every transaction is listed under **Analytics → Revenue → Paid Webinar**."},"4350":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-121","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#with-analytics","content":"The four stats are a summary of what the **Analytics** tab shows in detail. A brand-new webinar shows zeros on both until registrations start."},"4351":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-122","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#with-replays","content":"**Total Attended** includes replay viewers, and the **Attendee Replay link** sits in the Share dialog. Replay availability and design are set on the **Replay** tab."},"4352":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-123","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#with-cloning","content":"The type of a webinar can't be changed after it's created. To run the same webinar as a different type, clone it from its card on **My Webinars**. The copy starts with no registrations."},"4353":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-124","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the tab fits different teams."},"4354":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-125","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#coaches","content":"A coach runs a weekly live session. Before each one they open the Overview, check the **Upcoming** tab for the right date, glance at **Registrants**, and use **Enter Room** to get into the green room early."},"4355":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-126","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#agencies","content":"An agency runs webinars for clients, with the client's own speaker presenting. The account manager sends the speaker the **Co-presenter Join Link** from **Share**, so the speaker doesn't need an EasyWebinar login, and adds a colleague as moderator under **Team & Moderators**."},"4356":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-127","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#b2b-marketing","content":"A marketing team runs a webinar for a product launch. The Overview gives them the **Registration Page Link** to promote, and the gap between **Registrants** and **Live Attended** tells them, after the session, whether reminders did their job."},"4357":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-128","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#course-creators","content":"A course creator runs an evergreen webinar every day. The Overview shows the generated run of upcoming sessions, and the **Live** tab lets them enter a session while it is running."},"4358":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-129","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#limits","content":"**The webinar type is fixed.** It can't be changed from the Overview or anywhere else after creation. Clone the webinar instead."},"4359":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-130","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#limits","content":"**Scheduling Options changes the whole webinar.** For one sitting, use the options menu on that session's row."},"4360":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-131","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#limits","content":"**Cancelled sessions stay listed.** They're kept under their own tab so the history of the webinar stays intact."},"4361":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-132","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#limits","content":"**Converting to paid doesn't add a price to the registration page.** Choose **Paid** at creation instead."},"4362":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-133","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#limits","content":"**Presenter and moderator links are private.** Anyone holding one can join your room in that role."},"4363":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-134","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#limits","content":"**Only one event can be live at a time.** Entering a room while another webinar is on air shows a message saying so."},"4364":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-135","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#limits","content":"**A new webinar shows zeros** across all four stats until registrations start."},"4365":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-136","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-promote-link","content":"Click **Share** on the Overview tab and copy the **Registration Page Link**. That's the public one."},"4366":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-137","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-live-vs-total","content":"**Live Attended** counts people who joined the live session. **Total Attended** adds replay viewers, so it's the larger number."},"4367":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-138","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-change-date","content":"Use the options menu on **Scheduling Options**. It changes the schedule for the whole webinar, not a single sitting."},"4368":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-139","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-one-session","content":"Use the options menu on that session's row in the **Sessions** panel."},"4369":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-140","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-cancelled","content":"Cancelled sessions are kept under their own tab so the webinar's history stays intact."},"4370":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-141","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-guest-speaker","content":"Send them the **Co-presenter Join Link** from **Share**, or add them under **Team & Moderators**. They don't need an EasyWebinar account to join with a link."},"4371":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-142","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab#faq-convert-to-paid","content":"There's a **Convert to paid** button, but the registration page of a converted webinar keeps the free form. Create a new webinar and choose **Paid** on the pricing step instead."},"4372":{"id":"/product-docs/webinars/setup/overview-tab-143","page_id":"/product-docs/webinars/setu