on**, with its own size, icon, text, colours and the URL it opens."],[2649,"**A camera and microphone are needed to get past the device check,** even if you switch them off in the green room."],[2794,"**A camera and microphone are required to enter,** even if you switch them off afterwards."],[625,"**A deadline on the offer itself.** EasyWebinar's offer editor has a **Countdown timer** switch. Demio's help docs describe no countdown on a Featured Action. WebinarKit's offer countdown appears on its product page, not in its help docs. See EasyWebinar vs Demio and EasyWebinar vs WebinarKit."],[1324,"**A documented offer countdown.** EasyWebinar's offer editor has a **Countdown timer** switch. Demio documents its Featured Actions, and Livestorm its in-room link promotion, without a countdown setting. See EasyWebinar vs Demio and EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."],[2894,"**A library video in use** shows in the **Webinar Video** panel on that webinar's **Content** tab."],[2892,"**A live session you recorded** appears on the **Recordings** tab after the session, named after its webinar."],[2142,"**A live webinar runs at one fixed time** in the timezone you set."],[2893,"**A new document** appears on the **Files** tab with its name, upload date and page count."],[2890,"**A new upload** appears on the **Videos** tab with the **EasyWebinar** badge, and your storage figure at the top of the Library goes up."],[4364,"**A new webinar shows zeros** across all four stats until registrations start."],[4200,"**A priced replay option.** EasyWebinar's **Live + Replay bundle** sells the recording as a second option with its own price. Zoom's replay access is complimentary viewing included with the ticket. WebinarNinja's help centre says multiple pricing levels aren't supported. See EasyWebinar vs Zoom and EasyWebinar vs WebinarNinja."],[1544,"**A published state**, which decides whether the poll is live."],[1542,"**A question**, the thing you are asking."],[1258,"**A real deadline becomes visible.** Attendees see how long an offer stays open without relying on what they heard."],[2037,"**A recorded copy needs a video.** Simulive and evergreen webinars play a recording, chosen on the **Content** tab."],[2482,"**A recording is required.** Every session plays the video chosen at creation or later on the **Content** tab."],[2297,"**A recording is required.** Simulive and evergreen both play a video; live webinars don't."],[4345,"**A straight route into the room.** **Enter Room** is on the same screen as the stats, so going live doesn't mean hunting for a link."],[2143,"**A weekly webinar runs until you stop it.**"],[3185,"**A YouTube video stays discoverable** unless you've unlisted it on YouTube."],[1821,"**Action is one click away.** Attendees click the button while interest is high, without leaving to search for a link."],[2902,"**Add Media** is where you choose between hosting a video on EasyWebinar and importing it from YouTube, Vimeo, Wistia or a direct MP4 link. The choice decides whether the video uses your storage. See Video hosting."],[4324,"**Add presenter** adds someone who appears on camera and presents."],[4142,"**Add the Paid Webinars add-on.** It's listed under **Settings → Plan → Add-ons** as \"Selling access to webinars, with checkout\". Charging for a webinar needs it."],[2249,"**Add Video** opens two routes:"],[3015,"**After the replay ends**, under **Redirects**, sends viewers on as soon as the recording finishes playing. Point it at your offer, a booking page, or the next step you want people to take. Without it, viewers aren't sent anywhere when the recording ends."],[1878,"**After the replay ends**, under Redirects, sends viewers on to your offer or booking page once the recording finishes."],[1183,"**AI chat varies between sessions; a manual script doesn't.**"],[1469,"**AI Moderation and Chat Simulation need Easywebinar Chat.**"],[1457,"**AI Moderation**, in Beta, can answer attendee questions from documents you upload and keep the chat civil. It works with the built-in chat only, and it doesn't replace a human moderator on a live session. It is switched on from the **Chat** screen once set up in the **AI Moderation** section."],[2919,"**AI Moderator documents** are PDF, DOCX or PPTX, up to 25MB each, and the AI Moderator is in Beta."],[1906,"**AI offers use credits**: 1 credit for the offers step."],[1611,"**AI polls use credits.** Generating polls costs 1 credit within a Create with AI build."],[553,"**AI Simulation** builds a cast of simulated attendees, each with their own engagement level, knowledge level, language and behaviour."],[1109,"**AI Simulation**: you describe a cast of attendees, and the AI generates what they say."],[3920,"**AI-written copy needs a read.** Check pricing and what's included before publishing."],[2476,"**All three ways to watch in one webinar.** EasyWebinar offers just-in-time, On Demand and set times together on one page. Livestorm says recurring events can't be set up on-demand, and Demio's public docs show no just-in-time option. See EasyWebinar vs Livestorm and EasyWebinar vs Demio."],[446,"**Allow camera and microphone access** for EasyWebinar when your browser asks. If you blocked it earlier, change the site's camera and microphone permission in your browser settings, then reload the page."],[908,"**An abandoned checkout isn't a registration.**"],[4207,"**An abandoned checkout isn't a registration.** Only a successful payment registers someone."],[2891,"**An imported video** appears with its platform's badge, and your storage figure doesn't change."],[1818,"**An internal title**, which only your team sees."],[1817,"**An optional countdown**, shown on the card."],[1816,"**An optional price**, or a **Free** setting."],[4218,"**Analytics → Revenue → Paid Webinar** lists every transaction with its status. The Overview tab shows the total registrants and revenue."],[902,"**Analytics is per webinar.** The **People** page in the sidebar is the one that spans every webinar."],[541,"**Ask for consent.** Turn on **GDPR Compliance** to add a consent checkbox you word yourself."],[1575,"**Ask what you will use.** If an answer won't change what you say next or who you follow up with, cut the question."],[2775,"**Attendance:** the webinar's **Analytics** tab shows **Live Attended** for people who joined the broadcast. See Webinar analytics."],[585,"**Attendee Action Follow-ups** go further: they send based on what someone did, including how engaged they were and whether they clicked your offer. Someone who clicked **Enrol now** and didn't buy gets a different email from someone who left after five minutes."],[1305,"**Attendee Action Follow-ups** on the **Notifications** tab send emails based on what someone did, including whether they clicked an offer."],[1889,"**Attendee Action Follow-ups** send based on what someone did, including whether they clicked an offer. They let you treat someone who clicked and didn't buy differently from someone who left after five minutes."],[1408,"**Attendees help each other.** In a public chat, people often answer each other's questions before you get to them."],[375,"**Automated attendees** counts people watching simulive and evergreen sessions."],[2598,"**Backstage** is the part of the room for people who are present but not presenting yet. Anyone joining as a co-host or moderator arrives backstage rather than on stage. From there you move them onto the stage when it's their turn, and back off when they've finished. This works the same before and after you go live."],[2725,"**Be signed in as a team member.** Any team member signed in to EasyWebinar can open the room. To bring in a co-presenter or moderator, see The green room and backstage."],[2218,"**Be sure about the type.** The type is fixed once the webinar exists. If you later want an evergreen or live version, you clone it."],[2728,"**Build your polls and offers.** Create polls and offers on the **CTAs** tab. You can keep an offer switched off in the list until you want it."],[607,"**Build** the webinar with **Create with AI**, choosing the course offer category and **Balanced Approach**."],[1856,"**Button URL** is where attendees land when they click: your checkout, booking page or sales page. Write the button **Text** to match what happens next. \"Download Free Toolkit\" tells people what they'll get; \"Click here\" tells them nothing."],[4360,"**Cancelled sessions stay listed.** They're kept under their own tab so the history of the webinar stays intact."],[341,"**Change integration** swaps the connected tool. **Disconnect** removes it from the webinar."],[1186,"**Changes apply when you click Save Changes.**"],[3052,"**Changes to the page design need publishing.** Each of the five pages has its own **Publish** button."],[2013,"**Changing the type.** The type can't be edited on an existing webinar, so a copy of the right type is how you move between live, simulive and evergreen."],[3187,"**Changing the video later** doesn't affect the schedule, pages or registrations."],[2387,"**Charging for access?** Paid registration needs a connected Stripe account. See Paid webinars."],[2217,"**Charging for it?** Paid registration runs through Stripe. Leave pricing on **Free** if you aren't charging. See Paid webinars."],[2486,"**Chat Simulation runs one mode at a time:** AI or manual, not both."],[2285,"**Chat Simulation**, under **Engagement**, fills the chat on simulive and evergreen webinars, either with **AI Simulation** or with a scripted CSV in **Manual Simulation**. Only one can be active at a time. See Chat simulation."],[2800,"**Chat, Q&A and Show Attendees are setup controls.** Set them on the webinar's tabs before you go live."],[543,"**Check it on a phone.** Use the device toggle; most registrations come from phones."],[1161,"**Check the preview.** It shows timestamps, names and roles as attendees will see them."],[1979,"**Check you have a recording if the copy will be simulive or evergreen.** Those types play a video. A live webinar's recording is in the Library if **Auto Recording** was on when it ran."],[2726,"**Check your camera and microphone.** The room won't let you past the device check without both."],[137,"**Check your credits.** AI generation uses credits, and your balance is shown at the top right of every step. A full build costs around 23."],[4176,"**Checkout abandoned** counts people who reached checkout but didn't pay. They aren't registered. It is a useful number to watch: a high count points to the price, the checkout step, or a mismatch between the registration page and what checkout shows."],[197,"**Choose a video** for simulive and evergreen webinars, which play a recording."],[4144,"**Choose Paid when you create the webinar.** The price block is added to your registration page at creation. See Choose Paid at creation below."],[726,"**Clear all** resets every filter. The result count below the table shows how far a filter narrowed the list."],[1825,"**Clicks become follow-up.** People who clicked can get their own emails and their own CRM tag."],[59,"**Client workspaces are separate** from team seats; adding a workspace doesn't use a seat."],[3910,"**Clone Webinar** can copy registration pages into a new webinar. To try a different registration page on a webinar that's already running, clone it and change the copy."],[613,"**Clone** the webinar as **Evergreen**, select the live recording, turn on just-in-time and **Chat Simulation**, and let it sell every day."],[447,"**Close other apps that are using the camera**, such as another video-call tool, then reload."],[2651,"**Co-hosts and moderators arrive backstage,** never straight onto the stage."],[540,"**Collect what you need.** The form starts with name and email. Add a **Phone** field, or your own custom fields such as the student's current level."],[2634,"**Confirm recording.** **Auto Recording Enabled** in the header means the session will be recorded; **Settings → Recording Settings** changes it."],[2388,"**Confirm the type.** A webinar's type can't be changed after creation. If you have a live webinar you want to run this way, see Clone a webinar instead."],[4143,"**Connect a Stripe account.** Payments run through Stripe. You can connect it during the pricing step or from **Integrations → Payment**."],[2730,"**Connect any streaming destinations.** If you plan to stream to YouTube or LinkedIn as well, connect them once under **Integrations → EasyCast** in the sidebar."],[343,"**Connecting needs an account with that service**, and you sign in to it during setup."],[4374,"**Continue to Green Room** stays greyed out until the room can see a working camera and microphone. If you see \"You can only have one event live at a time.\", another webinar is already live. See Camera not detected."],[4361,"**Converting to paid doesn't add a price to the registration page.** Choose **Paid** at creation instead."],[2039,"**Copies are archived, not deleted.**"],[3774,"**Copy the code from the right webinar.** The Registration Widget sits on each webinar's own **Content** tab."],[4282,"**Create the webinar first.** The Overview tab belongs to a webinar that already exists. See Create and schedule a live webinar, Create a simulive webinar or Create an evergreen webinar."],[2391,"**Create with AI** also supports evergreen: set **Type** before generating, then choose the video afterwards. See Create with AI."],[116,"**Create with AI** builds a complete EasyWebinar webinar from a written description. In five steps it writes a slide-by-slide presentation script, fills your registration, thank-you and waiting-area pages, drafts the email sequence, and creates polls and offers. A full build takes about ten minutes and uses around 23 credits, and everything it produces opens in the normal editors so you can change it."],[531,"**Create with AI** builds a complete webinar from a description: the presentation script, the registration, thank-you and waiting pages, the email sequence, polls and offers. It takes about ten minutes, and everything stays editable."],[1863,"**Create with AI** builds a webinar from a description, and offers are one of its five outputs. Script, Landing pages and Emails are selected by default; click the **Offers** chip to include offers."],[1585,"**Create with AI** builds a webinar from a description, and polls are one of its five outputs. Script, Landing pages and Emails are selected by default; click the **Polls** chip to include polls in the build."],[3895,"**Create with AI** can build your pages as part of a full webinar. After it writes the script, the pages step asks you to choose **AI picks for you**, which auto-selects a template, or **Choose manually** to browse."],[1302,"**Create with AI** writes offers for you. Its **Direct Pitch** positioning is \"offer-focused, repeated CTAs, strong urgency\", while **Soft Pitch** is education-focused with the offer at the end. Whichever you choose, the offers it creates are normal offers on the **CTAs** tab, so you can add a countdown to any of them."],[290,"**Create your tags in the CRM first**, then select them in EasyWebinar."],[211,"**Credits are spent per step.** About 23 for a full build; the script and pages are 10 each."],[3667,"**CRM fields must exist first.** Create the field in your CRM, then click **Refresh** before mapping."],[1184,"**CSV files must be UTF-8**, with commas inside messages wrapped in double quotes."],[291,"**Custom fields must exist in your CRM** before you can map to them."],[3773,"**Customise first.** Use **View & Customize** to change how the widget looks before you copy the code."],[2446,"**Days off stay off.** **Blackout Dates** stop sessions on holidays and any other days you pick."],[2385,"**Decide how people should be able to watch.** Soon after registering, straight away, at set times, or a mix. The schedule step is built around that choice."],[2637,"**Decide on camera and mic.** You can switch **Camera** and **Mic** off in the green room and still go live, for a session built on slides or video."],[139,"**Decide the webinar type.** Choose **Live**, **Simulive** or **Evergreen** before generating. A webinar's type can't be changed after it's created."],[1980,"**Decide what to leave behind.** Everything is ticked if you choose **Select everything**, but you can untick, for example, the emails if the copy needs new ones."],[2215,"**Decide where the video will live.** Uploading it means EasyWebinar hosts it for you. Importing a link means it stays on YouTube, Vimeo or Wistia. See Which video source to use, below."],[1259,"**Deciding later stops being the easy choice.** A visible time limit gives people a reason to act during the webinar."],[2654,"**Design changes apply as you make them.** Anything you change after going live is visible."],[2797,"**Design changes apply immediately,** including mid-broadcast."],[1734,"**Disable removes Q&A for the whole session.**"],[2917,"**Don't delete a video a webinar is using.** The webinar plays it."],[1168,"**Don't impersonate real customers.** A simulated message shouldn't pass itself off as something a real customer said."],[2302,"**Don't remove a video a webinar is using.** The webinar plays it."],[3854,"**Drafts stay private.** **Save** keeps your work without changing what visitors see until you **Publish**."],[750,"**Each row is one person on one webinar.** Someone who registered for two webinars appears twice."],[3125,"**Easy to swap.** The **Webinar Video** panel changes a webinar's video without touching its schedule, pages or registrations."],[2801,"**EasyCast is for live webinars.** Simulive and evergreen webinars play a recording rather than broadcasting."],[298,"**EasyCRM** is EasyWebinar's own CRM and connects the same way. The full list, with what each connection is for, is on the integrations overview."],[608,"**Edit** the script and pages, add UTM capture to the form, and **Publish** the registration page."],[3418,"**Email notifications** can come across when you clone a webinar, so a reminder schedule you have tuned carries into the copy."],[3429,"**Email stays the main channel.** Text and WhatsApp reminders work alongside email, not instead of it."],[3301,"**Emails are set per webinar.** Each webinar has its own confirmation and its own **Email Settings**; cloning is how you carry them to a new webinar."],[132,"**Emails arrive wired up.** The sequence comes with merge tags already in place, so dates, times and join links fill themselves in."],[1468,"**Embedded widgets show to attendees.** Join as an attendee to see one; the admin view shows host tools."],[2799,"**Ending is final.** **End Session** disconnects everyone, and nobody can rejoin."],[1736,"**Ending the session is final.** **End Session** disconnects everyone and nobody can rejoin."],[1032,"**Evergreen only.** Just-in-time is part of the evergreen schedule step. Live and simulive webinars use dated sessions in the webinar's timezone."],[3540,"**Evergreen only.** On Demand is set on the evergreen schedule step. Live and simulive webinars don't have it."],[4201,"**Every payment in one list.** EasyWebinar's **Paid Webinar** view lists each transaction with its status. Livestorm's help pages describe a Paid column per registrant, with no revenue total for the event. See EasyWebinar vs Livestorm."],[1707,"**Everyone** for chat plus **Private Q&A** is a common setup: the room stays sociable, and questions reach you in an orderly queue."],[1424,"**Everyone** is the recommended setting and suits most webinars. Pick **Hosts only** for:"],[216,"**Everything is a draft.** Check pages and emails before you publish, particularly prices and inclusions."],[3123,"**Existing videos work as they are.** If the video is already on YouTube, Vimeo or Wistia, you import the link and use no storage."],[4283,"**Expect zeros on a new webinar.** The four stats stay at zero until registrations start."],[287,"**Expected result:** a connected integration on your webinar, with event mappings that tag contacts and custom fields that receive webinar data."],[29,"**Expected result:** a new team member listed under **Settings → Team** with the right role, able to sign in with the details you give them."],[1970,"**Expected result:** a new, independent webinar of the type you picked, carrying the settings and assets you selected, with no registrants, and the original webinar exactly as it was."],[2204,"**Expected result:** a simulive webinar with its schedule, pricing and recording in place, listed on the **Simulive** tab of **My Webinars**, with a **Webinar Video** panel on its **Content** tab."],[2082,"**Expected result:** a webinar with its schedule applied, open in the registration page builder, ready for you to publish."],[2374,"**Expected result:** an evergreen webinar with its schedule, pricing and recording set, a list of upcoming sessions generated on its **Overview** tab, and a registration page ready to publish."],[4029,"**Expired Session** on the webinar's **Settings → General** tab sets where people go if their link no longer works. It's empty by default, so fill it in with a page that tells people what to do next."],[753,"**Export respects your filters.**"],[3646,"**Export** downloads the filtered list."],[2729,"**Fill in End of Session.** On the **Settings** tab, **End of Session** is where attendees go when the stream ends. It's empty by default, which leaves attendees on a finished webinar."],[2860,"**Find it in the sidebar.** The Library sits in the main sidebar, alongside **My Webinars**, **Create with AI** and **Integrations**. It isn't inside a single webinar, so anything you add can be reused across your webinars."],[215,"**Five polls per poll step.** Each comes with its question, options and reasoning."],[1033,"**Fixed interval choices.** 2, 15, 30, 45 or 60 minutes."],[611,"**Follow up** with offer-clickers through **Attendee Action Follow-ups**, and tag them in your email tool with **Clicked offer**."],[2122,"**Free** (selected by default): attendees register without paying."],[2478,"**From live to evergreen in one product.** EasyWebinar lists recordings of your past webinars under **Recordings** when you pick the video. EverWebinar can import a past WebinarJam session if the same account has an active WebinarJam subscription. See EasyWebinar vs WebinarJam and EverWebinar."],[2608,"**From the Overview tab.** The **Team & Moderators** panel lists the presenters and moderators who can run this webinar. A new webinar shows \"No presenters or moderators added yet.\" Use **Add presenter** for someone who appears on camera and presents, or **Invite** to send an invitation to join the webinar team."],[3665,"**Full name and Email come first, both required.** Phone, custom fields, consent and UTM capture are options you add."],[3670,"**Full name** and **Email**, both required."],[1714,"**Group similar questions** and answer them together on air."],[2602,"**Guests arrive quietly.** A co-host can join early, sort out their audio and wait backstage without any of it being shown."],[4002,"**Guests don't need accounts.** A co-presenter or moderator can join with a link, without an EasyWebinar login."],[2214,"**Have a recording.** A simulive webinar plays a video, so you need one in your library or ready to add. You can add it during setup without leaving the builder."],[2384,"**Have the recording to hand.** Every session plays it. You can upload or import it during setup if it isn't in your library yet."],[1853,"**Headline**: what the attendee gets, in their terms."],[3183,"**Hosted files count towards storage; imported links don't.**"],[150,"**How long it runs.**"],[1877,"**How long the replay stays up**: **Always Available**, **Expire after days** or **Specific date**. A replay that closes gives the offer a matching deadline."],[2251,"**Import from URL** plays a video already on **YouTube**, **Vimeo**, **Wistia** or a direct **MP4** link. You enter the link and the video's length