p a long presentation.** A question every so often turns a passive audience into a responsive one."],[3380,"**It brings the session back into view.** A registration made days ago is easy to forget; a reminder an hour before puts it in front of the person again."],[2998,"**It can carry a deadline.** **Expire after days** or **Specific date** give the replay a closing point, which creates urgency."],[3853,"**It can carry your tracking.** Pixels and analytics scripts go on the page from the builder's settings, so you can measure the traffic you send."],[2997,"**It can keep selling.** With **Webinar Replica**, the replay carries the same offers and polls as the live session, so it sells the way the session did."],[1116,"**It can model the questions you want answered.** A scripted attendee question followed by an `Admin` reply puts a common objection and its answer in front of everyone."],[1549,"**It can point to buyers.** A question such as \"when are you planning to travel?\" sorts people who are close to a decision from people who are browsing."],[984,"**It catches interest at its peak.** The person registering has just decided they want to watch; a short interval lets them do so while that's still true."],[517,"**It catches late viewers.** **After the replay ends** can redirect replay viewers to your course checkout."],[515,"**It drafts the webinar for you.** **Create with AI** turns one description into a script, pages, emails, polls and offers."],[698,"**It exports segments, not everything.** **Export** downloads the filtered list, so the work the filters did comes with it."],[3618,"**It feeds your CRM.** The phone number can be mapped into a CRM field of your choice."],[1550,"**It feeds your follow-up.** The People view records how many polls each person answered, alongside their watch time and whether they clicked your offer."],[1411,"**It fits an existing tool.** On recorded webinars, **Third party** keeps conversations in the chat tool your team already uses."],[516,"**It follows up by behaviour.** Emails and email-tool tags can follow who attended and who clicked your offer."],[3263,"**It gives the join link a permanent home.** The registrant can search their inbox for it instead of trying to find your registration page again."],[2999,"**It hands viewers a next step.** **After the replay ends** sends them to an offer, a booking page, or whatever comes next."],[3383,"**It is measurable.** **Registered** to attended in Analytics tells you whether the reminders are doing their job."],[3541,"**It isn't the replay page.** Replay availability, deadlines, redirects and the replay page's look are set on the **Replay** tab for the replay page."],[986,"**It keeps a scheduled feel.** Unlike On Demand, there is still a start time, so attendees turn up for a session that begins at a set moment."],[828,"**It locates the leak.** **Visitors** to **Registered** measures your registration page. **Registered** to attended measures your reminder emails."],[3614,"**It makes text reminders possible.** SMS and WhatsApp reminders (both in Beta) go to the number someone gave you, so they depend on the **Phone** field."],[1182,"**It needs the built-in chat.** Third-party chat replaces EasyWebinar's panel."],[3265,"**It opens a reply channel.** Because the **Reply-to email** is an address you choose, a registrant with a question can simply reply."],[2018,"**It protects what's live.** The original isn't touched, so a working webinar keeps working while you experiment."],[3616,"**It puts consent on the form.** **GDPR Compliance** adds the checkbox with your own wording, so you don't need a separate consent step."],[696,"**It ranks engagement for you.** **Lead score** rates how engaged each person was, which makes a long list quick to sort."],[2996,"**It reaches the larger audience.** **Missed**, people who registered and never showed up, is often the biggest group a webinar has, and the replay link is what they want."],[983,"**It removes the wait.** A session is always a few minutes away, so a visitor doesn't have to plan to come back."],[3382,"**It runs on every session automatically.** Because timing is relative, there is nothing to reschedule when a recurring or evergreen webinar adds new sessions."],[2445,"**It runs without staff.** Nobody needs to present, and Chat Simulation exists for rooms that run unattended."],[2280,"**It runs without you if it has to.** The recording plays on schedule whether or not anyone from your team joins."],[1114,"**It runs without you.** On an evergreen webinar that plays all day, the simulated chat plays in every session."],[2016,"**It saves the rebuild.** Everything you've already written and designed can come with the copy."],[829,"**It separates offer problems from checkout problems.** **Views to Clicks** and **Clicks to Purchases** show where buyers drop out."],[3264,"**It sets the sender relationship early.** The **Sender name** a registrant sees here is the one they will see on every reminder, so the first email teaches them who to look out for."],[695,"**It shows behaviour, not just registration.** **Watch percentage**, **Replay watch percentage** and **Offer clicked** separate interested people from casual sign-ups."],[3000,"**It shows up in your numbers.** Replay viewing is counted separately in Analytics, so you can see what the replay added."],[518,"**It shows what sold.** **Offers Performance** and **Revenue by Offer** report each offer's results for that webinar."],[3617,"**It shows which campaign worked.** With **UTM Params** on, you can filter registrants by **Source & UTM** in the People view."],[830,"**It shows who to follow up.** **Missed** is everyone who registered and never attended."],[3509,"**It sits alongside scheduled options.** Registrants who'd rather turn up for a session can still pick a just-in-time or recurring one."],[3850,"**It starts filled in.** The schedule and countdown are applied when the webinar is created, so the page is usable before