wn words."],[3406,"**You build them from templates** grouped by tone, then edit the words."],[4208,"**You can change the price later** with the pencil on **Registration Pricing** in the Overview tab."],[3852,"**You can check the phone layout.** The device toggle shows the mobile version without leaving the builder."],[1409,"**You can make it private.** **Hosts only** turns chat into one-to-one conversations with your team when attendees shouldn't see each other."],[2777,"**You can prepare in private.** The green room lets you fix audio, lighting and screen sharing with nobody watching."],[1688,"**You can see what's left.** The **Active** and **Answered** split in the room, and the **Not Answered Rate** afterwards, show what you didn't get to."],[1824,"**You can see where it loses people.** Separate numbers for views, clicks and purchases show whether the problem is the offer or the checkout."],[2279,"**You can still be there.** You and your moderators answer questions in the chat while the recording plays, which keeps the interaction of a live event."],[3407,"**You can test first.** **Send Test SMS** and **Send Test Message** send the selected template to your own number. Pick your country from the flag dropdown rather than typing a dialling code."],[2299,"**You can't schedule a session in the past.**"],[1115,"**You decide how much control to keep.** AI Simulation fills a room naturally; Manual Simulation plays exactly the conversation you wrote."],[3851,"**You edit what you see.** Changes happen on the canvas, with a settings panel for whatever block you select."],[1410,"**You stay reachable without chat.** Choose **No Chat** and attendees can still contact you through the contact box."],[597,"**Your domain:** the **C-Name** add-on puts webinar pages on your own domain."],[3736,"**Your page stays in charge.** The content around the form is yours: your blog post, your landing page, your sidebar."],[626,"**Your setup comes with you.** Clone a live webinar as **Evergr