ee Live chat and Questions and answers."],[14,"Chat and Q&A moderation"],[2691,"Chat and Q&A settings"],[2347,"Chat choices for recorded webinars"],[1738,"Chat is a running conversation. Q&A collects questions in a list you work through, and with **Private Q&A** attendees don't see it."],[1456,"Chat is conversation; Q&A is a list of questions. A common setup is **Everyone** for chat with **Private Q&A**: the room stays sociable while questions arrive in an orderly queue."],[1678,"Chat is conversation: greetings, reactions, side remarks, attendees talking to each other. Q&A is a list. Each entry is a question, and your job is to work through the list during or at the end of the session."],[1401,"Chat is open conversation in the room, running alongside your video. It is separate from Q&A, which is a queue of questions you work through and can keep out of sight."],[1474,"Chat is open conversation. Q&A is a queue of questions you answer in order, and you can hide it from attendees."],[1406,"Chat lets attendees respond as you present: say hello, react, ask, and talk to each other. It is how a presenter knows the room is listening, and on a simulive webinar it is how you stay present while your recording plays."],[1433,"Chat moderation preferences sit in the room's **Settings**, under **Preferences**, alongside Q&A moderation and appearance."],[1362,"Chat on simulive and evergreen webinars"],[1053,"Chat simulation"],[2318,"Chat simulation"],[943,"Chat Simulation"],[2179,"Chat Simulation"],[2346,"Chat Simulation"],[1096,"Chat simulation plays a conversation in the chat of a recorded webinar, so a session doesn't open to an empty room. In EasyWebinar you set it up on a simulive or evergreen webinar's **Engagement** tab, under **Chat Simulation**, in one of two ways. **AI Simulation** builds a cast of simulated attendees and generates their chat and questions. **Manual Simulation** plays a script you write in a CSV, with each message timed against your video. The Chat Simula