ng link."],[3316,"No. The **Thank you Page** shows in the browser straight after registering. The confirmation is the email that stays in the registrant's inbox."],[3925,"No. The button reads **Skip & Create Webinar** when nothing is selected, and you can choose later."],[2042,"No. The copy starts with no registrations."],[1335,"No. The countdown setting is in the offer editor; the poll editor has question, response options and **Published**."],[2665,"No. The green room is for you and your presenters. The waiting area is where attendees wait before the session, and they're moved into the webinar automatically when you go live."],[2802,"No. The header reads **Not Live** until you click **Go Live** and confirm."],[2656,"No. The header reads **Not Live**, and nothing is sent to attendees until you click **Go Live** and confirm."],[2304,"No. The recording plays on schedule either way. Being in the chat is what gives simulive its edge over evergreen, so join when you can."],[4217,"No. They appear under **Checkout abandoned**, not as a registrant."],[1190,"No. Turning one on disables the other."],[2495,"No. Upload it with **Local import** and EasyWebinar hosts it. Importing a link is optional."],[2306,"No. Upload it with **Local import** and EasyWebinar hosts it. Importing from YouTube, Vimeo or Wistia is optional."],[3551,"No. Use the replay page on the **Replay** tab for that."],[3060,"No. While the replay page is enabled, anyone with the link can watch."],[631,"No. Your course stays on your course platform. EasyWebinar's offer button sends buyers to your checkout."],[452,"Not at first. A camera and microphone are required to enter, even if you turn them off afterwards with the **Camera** and **Mic** controls in the green room."],[352,"Not from this tab. Use **EasyCast**, a separate item under **Integrations** in the sidebar."],[2311,"Not in place. Clone it and choose **Evergreen** on the copy."],[3552,"Not necessarily. Turn it on when the content matters more than the 