ar**, then **Create Manually**."],[2103,"On **Step 2 of 4: Schedule**:"],[2121,"On **Step 3 of 4: Pricing**, choose one:"],[2131,"On **Step 4 of 4: Registration Template**:"],[1718,"On a **simulive** webinar, chat and Q&A work normally. Everyone in a session sees the same moment of the video, and you and your moderators answer in real time while the recording plays."],[1438,"On a busy webinar, one presenter can't watch the chat and present at the same time. The webinar's **Share** dialog includes a **Moderator Join Link for Live room**, which lets a moderator join to handle chat and questions. Treat it as private: anyone holding it can join the room in that role."],[1717,"On a large webinar, a moderator can work the queue while the presenter keeps presenting. Send them the **Moderator Join Link for Live room** from the webinar's **Share** dialog; it is the link for someone handling chat and questions. Keep it private, because anyone holding it can join in that role."],[1299,"On a live webinar you choose the moment to show the offer from the **Offers** panel in the room. Before you go live, **Go Live** reminds you to have offers and polls ready."],[4330,"On a live webinar, **Enter Room** takes you into the webinar room."],[1584,"On a live webinar, polls don't appear on their own: you launch each one manually. When you click **Go Live**, the confirmation reminds you that offers and polls should be ready, so check your poll list in the green room first."],[3030,"On a live webinar, the room header shows **Auto Recording Enabled** when recording is on, and recorded sessions land in **Library → Recordings**. Recording can be changed in the room under **Settings → Recording Settings**. See Run a live webinar and The Library."],[933,"On a new evergreen webinar"],[3458,"On a new evergreen webinar"],[1336,"On a new live webinar, yes: the registration page builder opens with a countdown to the session. On other types, check the page in the builder. You can restyle the block, hide it on mobile with **Desktop Only**, or remove it."],[4349,"On a paid webinar, **Registrants** counts everyone who has registered and paid, and **Revenue** is the total taken. Every transaction is listed under **Analytics → Revenue → Paid Webinar**."],[3292,"On a paid webinar, the attendee is registered once payment goes through and is then sent to your thank-you page. Purchases of an offer inside the webinar have their own email, **Paid Offer — Transaction Success**, the receipt-style confirmation for anyone who bought. See Paid webinars."],[3863,"On a paid webinar, the template you pick includes the price automatically."],[1117,"On a recorded webinar with an empty chat, the first impression is of a room nobody else came to. Attendees on automated webinars already know they might be watching a recording. An empty panel confirms it in the least flattering way, and people leave before the content has had a chance to work."],[552,"On a recorded webinar, attendees arrive at different times, so there's no shared conversation, and an empty chat panel makes the room look abandoned. **Chat Simulation** (Beta) fills it, on simulive and evergreen webinars:"],[1174,"On a simulive webinar, everyone in a session watches the same moment, so real chat works and you can answer live while the recording plays. Chat Simulation is available on simulive webinars as well as evergreen ones."],[1719,"On an **evergreen** webinar, Q&A is set up the same way on the Engagement tab. There is also a separate built-in contact form, the **EW Contact Box**, which sends submitted questions to an email address you choose. On a recorded webinar, attendees find it under **Contact** in the room, on its **Question** tab. It is a different thing from the Q&A queue: questions arrive by email rather than in the room's **Question** panel."],[1188,"On an automated webinar, attendees arrive at different times, so a genuine shared chat isn't possible. An empty panel makes the room look deserted."],[2455,"On an automated webinar, people arrive at different times, so a shared live conversation isn't possible. Turn on **Chat Simulation** on the **Engagement** tab to fill the chat with an AI-generated or CSV-scripted conversation. See Chat simulation."],[4309,"On an evergreen webinar with just-in-time switched on, the timezone line reads **Attendee's local timezone**. That's because a just-in-time session starts shortly after each person registers, in their own local time."],[1440,"On an evergreen webinar, a real shared chat isn't possible because attendees arrive at different times. **Chat Simulation** plays back a conversation, either generated by AI or scripted by you in a CSV, so the room doesn't look empty. It needs **Easywebinar Chat**."],[934,"On an existing evergreen webinar"],[3459,"On an existing evergreen webinar"],[940,"On Demand"],[2328,"On Demand"],[3447,"On Demand (instant replay)"],[3451,"On Demand and the replay page are different"],[3506,"On Demand is for evergreen webinars where the content is the point, not the occasion: training, product explainers, onboarding material and other sessions people want to get through on their own timetable."],[3063,"On Demand: instant replay on evergreen webinars, which is often confused with the replay page."],[1048,"On Demand: the option for registrants who want to watch now rather than in a few minutes."],[2499,"On Demand: wording the instant replay button and how it differs from the replay page."],[1441,"On simulive and evergreen webinars you can replace the built-in panel with a chat tool you already use, such as Chatroll, Intercom or anything that gives you an embed snippet."],[1916,"On the **Analytics** Overview. **Offers Performance** gives views, clicks and purchases with a click rate, and **Revenue by Offer** gives total revenue and payment count."],[3909,"On the **Analytics** tab, **Visitors** counts unique IPs on your landing page and **Registered** counts unique sign-ups. A low **Visitors to Registered** rate points at the page itself: the headline, the form, the promise."],[3018,"On the **Content** tab, click **Edit** on the **Replay Page** card."],[1835,"On the **CTAs** tab, open an existing offer."],[1560,"On the **CTAs** tab, open an existing poll."],[3279,"On the **Emails** channel, click **Email Settings**."],[1480,"On the **Engagement** tab, set chat to **Hosts only**, or choose **No Chat**."],[2927,"On the **Files** tab. It's also where the AI Moderator (Beta) keeps the documents it answers from."],[4008,"On the **Overview** tab, click **Share** on the webinar's header, next to **Registration Page**."],[2920,"On the **Recordings** tab of the **Library**. Each is named after its webinar, with its duration and recording date."],[3156,"On the **Video Selection** step, click the video you want."],[561,"On the new webinar's **Content** tab, select the recording of your live session."],[4077,"On the Overview tab"],[3549,"On the schedule step when you set up an evergreen webinar, not on the **Replay** tab."],[1012,"On the schedule step, EasyWebinar shows a message saying attendees will see times in their local time based on the selected timezone. On an evergreen webinar, that's true of just-in-time sessions only. Recurring daily and weekly sessions run at the times you set in the webinar's timezone."],[3521,"On the webinar's **Overview** tab, the options menu on the **Scheduling Options** panel changes the schedule for the whole webinar. The same panel shows the frequency, start date, timezone and the preference you chose."],[2613,"On the webinar's **Overview**, click **Enter Room**."],[3745,"On the webinar's **Overview**, click **Share**."],[1016,"On the webinar's **Overview**, open the **Live** tab in the **Sessions** panel. A session on air appears there marked *Live now*, with **Enter room**."],[3906,"On the webinar's **Settings → Tracking Code** sub-tab, you pick a page and paste code into **Header Code**, **Body Code** or **Footer Code**. Tracking code is set per page. The registration page tells your ad platform who was interested; the thank-you page, which only loads after someone registers, is the reliable conversion signal."],[3040,"On the webinar's **Settings** tab, the **Tracking Code** sub-tab lets you add scripts to each of the five pages, including the **Replay Page**, so your analytics or ad platform can count people who watched afterwards."],[4161,"Once payment goes through, the attendee is registered and sent to your thank-you page."],[2130,"Once people pay, the webinar's **Analytics** tab shows what you've earned under **Revenue**, with a list of every transaction and its status."],[4017,"Once the page is enabled it reads *Replay page is live, anyone with the link can watch*, so treat the replay link as public. Replay emails aren't set up here: add a **Webinar Follow-up** on the **Notifications** tab and include the replay link."],[1432,"Once you enter the room, the **Chat** panel sits on the side rail with **People**, **Offers**, **Polls**, **Question**, **Design** and **Theme**. It holds messages from attendees, split into **Global Chat** and **Admin Chats**."],[1623,"One about the attendee rather than a test of knowledge. It's easier to answer, and it tells you something you can use."],[3952,"One-Click Registration Link"],[1740,"Only hosts and moderators."],[2494,"Only if you set an **End Date**. Left on **No end date**, the schedule runs indefinitely."],[2112,"Only just-in-time sessions on evergreen webinars follow each attendee's own local time. Live and scheduled sessions always run in the webinar's timezone."],[1111,"Only one can be active on a webinar at a time."],[1482,"Open **Analytics**. The **Chat** panel shows total messages, filterable by session."],[1914,"Open **Offers** on the side rail of the live room and push it to the room."],[3635,"Open **People** in the sidebar, click **Add Filter**, and choose **Source & UTM** to see which campaign each registrant came from."],[1616,"Open **Polls** on th